+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui.cpp:1861
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"Many graphs set `enable`, `blendStrength`, and `blendThreshold` every frame.\n"
+"Pausing the graph execution will allow controlling these values without interference."
