+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_neural_radiance_cache.cpp:84
+msgid "The same as SecondaryVertexTrainingRadiance, but smoothed over time.\n"
+msgstr "То же, что SecondaryVertexTrainingRadiance, но со сглаживанием во времени.\n"
