+msgstr "内存分析器"
+
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:179
+#, c-format
+msgid "This is a tool to help diagnose memory related problems in Remix.  Press the `Sample Memory` button to take a snapshot of all the memory allocations currently in use by the application.  You can refresh this list at any time by clicking that button.  Once you have a snapshot, the data will be displayed as a list below."
+msgstr "这是一个帮助诊断 Remix 内存相关问题的工具。按下 `Sample Memory`（内存采样）按钮，即可为应用程序当前使用的所有内存分配拍摄快照。随时点击该按钮即可刷新此列表。获取快照后，数据将以列表形式显示在下方。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:182
+#, c-format
+msgid "Memory profiler is disabled.  Please enable in the rtx.conf with `rtx.profiler.memory.enable = True` or with `RTX_PROFILER_MEMORY_ENABLE = 1` environment variable"
+msgstr "内存分析器已禁用。请在 rtx.conf 中设置 `rtx.profiler.memory.enable = True`，或通过环境变量 `RTX_PROFILER_MEMORY_ENABLE = 1` 启用"
