+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:50
+#, c-format
+msgid "Help improve RTX Remix by allowing NVIDIA to collect diagnostic data:"
+msgstr "允许 NVIDIA 收集诊断数据，帮助改进 RTX Remix："
+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:54
+msgid "Basic session and system information"
+msgstr "基本会话和系统信息"
+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:57
+#, c-format
+msgid "Collected each time RTX Remix is launched."
+msgstr "每次启动 RTX Remix 时收集。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:60
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"Includes game name, Remix version, GPU model and driver, OS version,\n"
+"RAM, and session configuration flags. Does not include user files, game\n"
+"content, or broad system state. NVIDIA will use this data to prioritize\n"
+"development work."
+msgstr ""
+"包括游戏名称、Remix 版本、GPU 型号和驱动程序、操作系统版本、\n"
+"内存以及会话配置标志。不包括用户文件、游戏\n"
+"内容或广泛的系统状态。NVIDIA 将使用这些数据确定\n"
+"开发工作的优先级。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:62
+msgid "Technical crash information"
+msgstr "技术性崩溃信息"
+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:65
+#, c-format
+msgid "Automatically submitted when RTX Remix crashes."
+msgstr "在 RTX Remix 崩溃时自动提交。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:68
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"Includes the same basic system information above plus crash type, error\n"
+"severity, and GPU diagnostic state at the time of the crash, without identifying\n"
+"you. NVIDIA will use this data to prioritize, investigate, and fix issues."
+msgstr ""
+"包括上述相同的基本系统信息，以及崩溃类型、错误\n"
+"严重程度和崩溃时的 GPU 诊断状态，不会识别\n"
+"您的身份。NVIDIA 将使用这些数据确定问题的优先级、调查并修复问题。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui_first_use_guide.cpp:72
+#, c-format
+msgid "Data collected will be used to improve RTX Remix, and is kept in compliance with NVIDIA's Privacy Policy:"
+msgstr "收集的数据将用于改进 RTX Remix，并按照 NVIDIA 隐私政策进行保管："
+
