+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_accumulation.cpp:147
+msgid "Continuous Accumulation"
+msgstr "连续累积"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_accumulation.cpp:148
+msgid ""
+"Enables continuous accumulation even after numFramesToAccumulate frame count is reached.\n"
+"Frame to frame accumulation weight remains limitted by numFramesToAccumulate count.\n"
+"This, however, skews the result as values contribute to the end result longer than numFramesToAccumulate allows.\n"
+msgstr ""
+"即使达到 numFramesToAccumulate 帧数后，仍继续累积。\n"
+"帧间累积权重仍受 numFramesToAccumulate 数量限制。\n"
+"但这会使结果产生偏差，因为各个值对最终结果的贡献时间会超过 numFramesToAccumulate 所允许的范围。\n"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_accumulation.cpp:153
+msgid "Fp16 Accumulation"
+msgstr "Fp16 累积"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_accumulation.cpp:154
+msgid ""
+"Accumulate using fp16 precision. Default is fp32.\n"
+"Much of the renderer is limitted to fp16 formats so on one hand fp16 better emulates renderer's formats.\n"
+"On the other hand, renderer also clamps and filters the signal in many places and thus is less prone\n"
+"to very high values causing precision issues preventing very low values have any impact.\n"
+"Therefore, to minimize precision issues the default accumulation mode is set to fp32."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 fp16 精度进行累积。默认为 fp32。\n"
+"渲染器的大部分环节都受限于 fp16 格式，因此一方面，fp16 能更好地模拟渲染器的格式。\n"
+"另一方面，渲染器也会在许多地方对信号进行钳制和滤波，因此不太容易\n"
+"因极高的值引发精度问题，导致极低的值无法产生任何影响。\n"
+"因此，为尽量减少精度问题，默认累积模式设为 fp32。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.sunSize
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:153
+msgid "Size of sun disc in degrees."
+msgstr "太阳圆盘的大小（单位：度）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspective
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:154
+msgid "Apply the atmosphere's in-scatter and extinction to scene geometry through a camera-fitted froxel volume (Hillaire EGSR 2020, Section 5.4). This is what gives distant buildings and terrain their haze and desaturation - the strongest distance cue an outdoor scene has. Without it, everything past the global volumetrics froxel range renders at full saturation and contrast. Where global volumetrics are enabled the march starts past that grid's range, so the two hand off instead of double counting."
+msgstr "通过与摄像机贴合的 froxel 体积（Hillaire EGSR 2020，第 5.4 节）将大气的内散射和消光应用于场景几何体。远处的建筑和地形正是因此才呈现出雾霭感和较低的饱和度——这是户外场景中最强的距离线索。若不启用，超出全局体积效果 froxel 范围的一切都会以完全的饱和度和对比度渲染。启用全局体积效果时，步进从该网格范围之外开始，因此两者会相互衔接，而不会重复计算。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveDepthRangeMeters
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:160
+msgid ""
+"Far bound in meters of the aerial perspective volume's depth axis. The 32 slices are distributed exponentially from the global volumetrics handoff out to here, so each carries the same relative depth resolution rather than the same absolute depth - the near slices stay metres apart while the far ones stretch to kilometres. Surfaces beyond this bound receive the last slice's haze.\n"
+"32 km is the value from Hillaire EGSR 2020 Section 5.4, sized for a 3 km world map. Because the distribution is relative, raising it costs near-field accuracy only logarithmically."
+msgstr ""
+"空气透视体积深度轴的远端边界（单位：米）。32 个切片从全局体积效果的交接处到此处按指数分布，因此每个切片具有相同的相对深度分辨率，而非相同的绝对深度——近处切片彼此相距数米，而远处切片则延伸至数千米。超出此边界的表面将使用最后一个切片的雾霭。\n"
+"32 km 是 Hillaire EGSR 2020 第 5.4 节中的值，适用于 3 km 的世界地图。由于分布是相对的，增大此值对近场精度的影响仅呈对数增长。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveNearFadeStartMeters
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:168
+msgid ""
+"Distance in meters below which aerial perspective is not applied to a surface at all.\n"
+"This is the aerial perspective's fogStart, and it exists for the reason D3D9 fog has one. The volume's integration begins at the global volumetrics handoff - rtx.volumetrics.froxelMaxDistanceMeters, 20 m by default - which is the right bound for the physics but far too near to be the bound on what the volume may paint. Scene shadowing of the column is resolved on a 32x32 screen grid, so a surface just past the handoff reads a column blended from neighbours up to ~60 px away; where those look past it into sunlit air, the forward-scatter lobe lands on it as a halo bleeding through walls and terrain. Holding the volume off until it has real distance to integrate removes that whole class of artifact and costs almost nothing physically - clear-air extinction over the first few hundred metres is negligible.\n"
+"Raise it if halos still reach interior geometry; lower it if near-field haze is visibly missing."
+msgstr ""
+"低于此距离（单位：米）的表面完全不应用空气透视。\n"
+"这相当于空气透视的 fogStart，其存在的理由与 D3D9 雾具有 fogStart 的理由相同。体积的积分从全局体积效果的交接处开始（即 rtx.volumetrics.froxelMaxDistanceMeters，默认 20 m），这对物理计算而言是正确的边界，但作为体积可绘制范围的边界则太近了。场景对空气柱的遮挡在 32x32 的屏幕网格上解析，因此刚好位于交接处之外的表面会读取由最远约 60 px 外的相邻单元混合而成的空气柱；当这些相邻单元越过该表面看向被阳光照亮的空气时，前向散射波瓣会作为光晕落在该表面上，透过墙壁和地形渗出。在体积有足够的实际距离可积分之前不应用它，即可消除这一整类瑕疵，且在物理上几乎没有代价——晴朗空气在最初几百米内的消光可以忽略不计。\n"
+"如果光晕仍会出现在室内几何体上，请增大此值；如果近场雾霭明显缺失，请减小此值。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveNearFadeEndMeters
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:181
+msgid "Distance in meters at which aerial perspective reaches full strength. Across [aerialPerspectiveNearFadeStartMeters, this] it ramps in smoothly, so a receding floor or road shows no band where the volume takes over. A value at or below the start distance makes the transition a hard step."
+msgstr "空气透视达到完全强度时的距离（单位：米）。在 [aerialPerspectiveNearFadeStartMeters, 此值] 区间内平滑过渡，因此向远处延伸的地面或道路不会在体积接管处出现条带。若此值小于或等于起始距离，过渡将变为硬切换。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveLutResolution
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:187
+msgid ""
+"Screen-space resolution of the aerial perspective volume, on both axes.\n"
+"This axis resolves how the haze varies with view DIRECTION. Most of that is smooth, but the Mie aureole around the sun is not, and undersampling it shows as coarse banding in the haze near the sun. At 32 one texel covers roughly 60x34 px at 1080p. Cost is quadratic in this value and is arithmetic only - the bake traces no rays unless aerialPerspectiveSceneShadow is on."
+msgstr ""
+"空气透视体积在屏幕空间中的分辨率（两个轴相同）。\n"
+"此轴决定雾霭随视线“方向”如何变化。大部分变化是平滑的，但太阳周围的米氏日晕并非如此，采样不足会在太阳附近的雾霭中表现为粗糙的色带。值为 32 时，在 1080p 下一个纹素大约覆盖 60x34 px。开销与此值成平方关系，且仅为算术运算——除非开启 aerialPerspectiveSceneShadow，否则烘焙不会追踪任何光线。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveLutDepthSlices
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:194
+msgid ""
+"Depth slices in the aerial perspective volume.\n"
+"Kept separate from aerialPerspectiveLutResolution because this axis resolves how the haze varies with DISTANCE, and the exponential slice distribution already gives every slice the same relative depth resolution - so it needs far less than the screen axes do. Cost is linear in this value."
+msgstr ""
+"空气透视体积中的深度切片数。\n"
+"与 aerialPerspectiveLutResolution 分开设置，因为此轴决定雾霭随“距离”如何变化，而指数切片分布已使每个切片具有相同的相对深度分辨率——因此所需的数量远少于屏幕轴。开销与此值成线性关系。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveSceneShadow
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:200
+msgid ""
+"Trace the scene for sun occlusion of the air column the aerial perspective volume integrates.\n"
+"The volume covers the air BETWEEN the camera and a surface. Untraced, it treats that air as fully sunlit even when the surface is precisely what is hiding the sun - and since the forward-scatter lobe peaks in exactly that direction, the result is a bright halo bleeding through walls and terrain wherever the sun sits behind them. One opaque shadow ray per march step removes it, and because the visibility is averaged over the column rather than decided once, a doorway reads correctly: the indoor part of the column is shadowed while the part past the threshold is not.\n"
+"Known limitation: this volume is applied only to pixels that hit geometry - a primary miss returns early in the composite - so the shadowing is clipped to the occluder's screen-space silhouette. One pixel to the side the ray reaches the sky, receives no aerial perspective, and so receives no darkening either, which reads as the object's outline stamped onto the haze rather than as a shaft cast through it. A real shaft continues past the object across the sky behind it, which this construction cannot express at any resolution or sample count.\n"
+"Shadow shafts proper belong to the global volumetrics grid, which integrates for every pixel including sky misses and therefore carries its shadows across silhouettes without a seam. The two systems already meet: this volume begins where rtx.volumetrics.froxelMaxDistanceMeters ends, so widening that range hands more of the shadowed near field to the system that resolves it correctly.\n"
+"Costs roughly a shadow ray per froxel step within aerialPerspectiveSceneShadowRangeMeters."
+msgstr ""
+"追踪场景，计算空气透视体积所积分的空气柱受到的太阳遮挡。\n"
+"该体积覆盖的是摄像机与表面“之间”的空气。若不追踪，即使正是该表面挡住了太阳，这部分空气也会被视为完全受阳光照射——而前向散射波瓣恰好在这个方向上最强，因此只要太阳位于墙壁和地形之后，就会出现透过它们渗出的明亮光晕。每个步进步长发射一条不透明阴影光线即可消除该问题；而且由于可见性是在整个空气柱上取平均，而不是一次性判定，门口也能正确呈现：空气柱的室内部分处于阴影中，而门槛之外的部分则不在阴影中。\n"
+"已知限制：此体积仅应用于命中几何体的像素（主光线未命中时会在合成阶段提前返回），因此阴影会被裁剪到遮挡物的屏幕空间轮廓内。偏移一个像素，光线就会到达天空，既不会获得空气透视，也不会被压暗，看起来就像物体的轮廓被印在雾霭上，而不是投射穿过雾霭的光束。真实的光束会越过物体延伸到其后方的天空中，而这种结构无论分辨率或采样数多高都无法表现。\n"
+"真正的阴影光束属于全局体积效果网格，它会对包括天空未命中在内的每个像素进行积分，因此其阴影可以无缝地跨越轮廓。这两个系统已经衔接：此体积从 rtx.volumetrics.froxelMaxDistanceMeters 结束处开始，因此扩大该范围就能把更多处于阴影中的近场交给能够正确解析它的系统。\n"
+"开销约为在 aerialPerspectiveSceneShadowRangeMeters 范围内每个 froxel 步长一条阴影光线。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveSceneShadowDebug
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:219
+msgid ""
+"Diagnostic for aerialPerspectiveSceneShadow. Every way that feature can silently fail - the constant not reaching the bake, the TLAS descriptor never binding, the rays missing the geometry - looks identical on screen, so these modes take them apart one build at a time.\n"
+"0 = off (production).\n"
+"1 = force the column fully occluded WITHOUT tracing. The halo must disappear. If it does not, the constant or the dispatch is broken and the trace is irrelevant.\n"
+"2 = trace, then invert the result. The halo must survive ONLY where a ray found geometry. A screen that stays uniformly lit means the rays are hitting nothing."
+msgstr ""
+"aerialPerspectiveSceneShadow 的诊断选项。该功能可能静默失败的各种情况（常量未传入烘焙、TLAS 描述符从未绑定、光线未命中几何体）在屏幕上看起来完全相同，因此这些模式可以逐个构建地将它们区分开来。\n"
+"0 = 关闭（正式使用）。\n"
+"1 = 在“不”追踪的情况下强制将空气柱视为完全被遮挡。光晕必须消失。如果没有消失，则说明常量或调度有问题，与追踪无关。\n"
+"2 = 追踪后反转结果。光晕必须“仅”在光线找到几何体的位置保留。如果整个屏幕保持均匀照亮，则说明光线没有命中任何物体。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveSceneShadowRangeMeters
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:229
+msgid "How far from the camera, in meters, scene geometry is allowed to shadow the aerial perspective column. Samples past this trace nothing and are treated as sunlit, which is what the air above the rooftops actually is - and a ray launched from kilometres out would only pay for a bounds test it always loses. Raise it if a scene has occluders far larger than a kilometre (a mountain ridge, a megastructure) casting into the volume; lower it to spend fewer rays."
+msgstr "距摄像机多远（单位：米）以内的场景几何体可以为空气透视空气柱投射阴影。超出此距离的采样不进行追踪，并视为受阳光照射，这正是屋顶上方空气的实际情况——而从数千米外发射的光线只会白白付出一次必然失败的边界测试开销。如果场景中有远大于一千米的遮挡物（山脊、巨型建筑）向体积内投射阴影，请增大此值；减小此值可减少光线数量。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerialPerspectiveMieAnisotropyMax
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:236
+msgid ""
+"Upper bound on the Mie anisotropy the aerial perspective volume may use. The sky is not affected, and values at or above mieAnisotropy do nothing.\n"
+"A strongly forward-scattering lobe is at its brightest looking straight into the sun, which is also where the air in front of a surface is most likely to be sitting in that surface's own shadow. aerialPerspectiveSceneShadow is what removes the resulting halo; this cap is the second line of defence for the column past aerialPerspectiveSceneShadowRangeMeters, where nothing is traced. 0.8 is the Mie anisotropy of Hillaire EGSR 2020 Table 1. Raise it toward mieAnisotropy for a stronger sunward haze wash on distant geometry."
+msgstr ""
+"空气透视体积可使用的米氏各向异性的上限。天空不受影响，大于或等于 mieAnisotropy 的值不起作用。\n"
+"强前向散射波瓣在直视太阳时最亮，而此时表面前方的空气也最有可能正处于该表面自身的阴影中。消除由此产生的光晕靠的是 aerialPerspectiveSceneShadow；此上限则是针对 aerialPerspectiveSceneShadowRangeMeters 以外、不进行任何追踪的空气柱的第二道防线。0.8 是 Hillaire EGSR 2020 表 1 中的米氏各向异性值。将其向 mieAnisotropy 调高，可使远处几何体上朝向太阳方向的雾霭更强。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.sunShadowSoftnessDeg
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:246
+msgid "Decoupled sun shadow softness, as the distant light's angular half-angle in degrees. 0 = physical (use sunSize / 2, so shadow softness tracks the visible disc). When > 0 it overrides the sun light's half-angle WITHOUT changing the visible sun disc — larger = softer penumbra, for artistic soft shadows under a small sun."
+msgstr "独立的太阳阴影柔和度，以远距离光源的半角（单位：度）表示。0 = 物理值（使用 sunSize / 2，使阴影柔和度与可见的太阳圆盘一致）。值 > 0 时，会覆盖太阳光源的半角，但“不会”改变可见的太阳圆盘——值越大，半影越柔和，可用于在较小的太阳下获得艺术化的柔和阴影。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.sunIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:251
+msgid "Strength of Sun."
+msgstr "太阳的强度。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.sunElevation
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:252
+msgid "Sun elevation in degrees. Game-drivable per-frame; persists when saved unless overridden by a runtime push."
+msgstr "太阳高度角（单位：度）。可由游戏逐帧驱动；保存后会保留，除非被运行时推送的值覆盖。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.sunRotation
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:254
+msgid "Sun rotation in degrees. Game-drivable per-frame; persists when saved unless overridden by a runtime push."
+msgstr "太阳旋转角（单位：度）。可由游戏逐帧驱动；保存后会保留，除非被运行时推送的值覆盖。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.flipUpAxis
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:257
+msgid ""
+"Negate the world's up axis when converting into the atmosphere's internal Y-up frame. Some games have an up axis pointing the opposite way to what Remix assumes, which renders the sky exactly upside down - bright zenith beneath you, dark ground half overhead - because elevation is taken as asin(up).\n"
+"Note this is NOT the fix for a sky that looks rotated 90 degrees or sideways; that is rtx.zUp not matching the game's convention. Check that first: with a mid-elevation sun and the time cycle off, a zenith that sits off to one side is a zUp problem, a zenith under your feet is this one.\n"
+"Enabling this also REVERSES the direction the sun travels across the sky. Azimuth is unchanged, but reversing which way is up reverses the sense of rotation seen from the new zenith. sunRotation and northOffsetDegrees shift where the arc sits and cannot undo this, so if the sun ends up setting where it should rise, that is expected and the arc has to be re-placed rather than offset."
+msgstr ""
+"在转换到大气内部的 Y 轴向上坐标系时，将世界的向上轴取反。某些游戏的向上轴与 Remix 假设的方向相反，会导致天空完全上下颠倒（明亮的天顶在脚下，黑暗的地面占据头顶的半边天），因为高度角是按 asin(up) 计算的。\n"
+"注意：对于看起来旋转了 90 度或侧倒的天空，此选项“不是”解决办法；那是 rtx.zUp 与游戏的约定不一致所致。请先检查这一点：在太阳处于中等高度且关闭时间循环的情况下，天顶偏向一侧是 zUp 问题，天顶在脚下则是此问题。\n"
+"启用此选项还会“反转”太阳在天空中运行的方向。方位角不变，但反转向上方向后，从新的天顶看去的旋转方向也会反转。sunRotation 和 northOffsetDegrees 只能移动弧线的位置，无法撤销这一点，因此如果太阳最终在应升起的地方落下，这属于预期行为，需要重新放置弧线，而不是对其进行偏移。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.timeCycleEnable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:274
+msgid "Drive the sun from a Remix-side clock instead of the sunElevation / sunRotation options. Intended for games that have no day/night cycle of their own to push through the API. While enabled this OWNS the sun direction and both of those options (and any API push to them) are ignored."
+msgstr "使用 Remix 端的时钟驱动太阳，而不是使用 sunElevation / sunRotation 选项。适用于自身没有可通过 API 推送的昼夜循环的游戏。启用期间，太阳方向“完全”由此控制，上述两个选项（以及通过 API 对它们的任何推送）都将被忽略。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.timeOfDayHours
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:278
+msgid "Time of day in hours [0, 24). 12 = solar noon, 6 ~ sunrise, 18 ~ sunset at an equinox. When the cycle is running this is the START time - editing it re-seeds the running clock. When the cycle is off it is still used to place the sun, so it doubles as a manual time-of-day control."
+msgstr "一天中的时间，单位为小时 [0, 24)。12 = 太阳正午；在春分/秋分时，6 ~ 日出，18 ~ 日落。循环运行时，此值为“起始”时间——编辑它会重新设定正在运行的时钟。循环关闭时，仍会用它来放置太阳，因此它也可用作手动的时间控制。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.dayLengthMinutes
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:283
+msgid "Real-world minutes for one full 24-hour cycle. 24 gives a minute per in-game hour; raise for a slower day. Only used while timeCycleEnable is set."
+msgstr "完成一个完整 24 小时循环所需的现实时间（分钟）。设为 24 表示游戏中每小时对应现实中 1 分钟；增大此值可使一天过得更慢。仅在设置了 timeCycleEnable 时使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.latitudeDegrees
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:287
+msgid "Observer latitude in degrees, positive north. Sets how high the sun climbs and how tilted its arc is: 0 (equator) sends it near-vertically overhead, high latitudes keep it low and give long shallow sunrises and sunsets."
+msgstr "观察者所在纬度（单位：度），北纬为正。决定太阳升得多高以及其运行弧线的倾斜程度：0（赤道）时太阳几乎垂直经过头顶，高纬度时太阳始终较低，日出和日落漫长而平缓。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.dayOfYear
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:292
+msgid "Day of year [1, 365], which sets the solar declination and therefore the season. 80 is the March equinox (sun rises due east, sets due west, 12-hour day), 172 the June solstice, 355 the December solstice. At latitude 0 the season barely matters; near the poles it is the difference between midnight sun and polar night."
+msgstr "一年中的第几天 [1, 365]，决定太阳赤纬，从而决定季节。80 为三月春分（太阳正东升起、正西落下，白昼 12 小时），172 为六月夏至，355 为十二月冬至。在纬度 0 处，季节几乎没有影响；在极地附近，则决定了是极昼还是极夜。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.northOffsetDegrees
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:298
+msgid "Rotates the whole solar arc so the model's north lines up with the game world's north. Adjust until sunrise comes from the direction the game world treats as east."
+msgstr "旋转整条太阳运行弧线，使模型的北方与游戏世界的北方对齐。请调整至日出方向与游戏世界中视为东方的方向一致。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.airDensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:303
+msgid "Density of air molecules multiplier (1.0 = clear sky)."
+msgstr "空气分子密度倍数（1.0 = 晴朗天空）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.aerosolDensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:304
+msgid "Density of aerosols/dust multiplier (1.0 = typical)."
+msgstr "气溶胶/尘埃密度倍数（1.0 = 典型值）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.ozoneDensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:305
+msgid "Density of ozone layer multiplier (1.0 = typical)."
+msgstr "臭氧层密度倍数（1.0 = 典型值）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.planetRadius
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:306
+msgid "Planet radius in kilometers."
+msgstr "行星半径（单位：千米）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.atmosphereThickness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:307
+msgid "Atmosphere thickness in kilometers."
+msgstr "大气层厚度（单位：千米）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.mieAnisotropy
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:308
+msgid "Mie phase function anisotropy (g parameter, -1 to 1)."
+msgstr "米氏相位函数各向异性（g 参数，-1 到 1）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.rayleighScattering
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:310
+msgid "Base Rayleigh scattering coefficients (km^-1)."
+msgstr "基础瑞利散射系数 (km^-1)。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.mieScattering
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:311
+msgid "Base Mie scattering coefficients (km^-1)."
+msgstr "基础米氏散射系数 (km^-1)。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.mieAbsorption
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:312
+msgid "Base Mie absorption coefficients (km^-1). Aerosols absorb roughly as much as they scatter on Earth, so leaving this at zero puts aerosol extinction at about half its physical value — haze then brightens as it thickens instead of also darkening. Raising this relative to mieScattering darkens the haze, and making it chromatic tints it: this is the control that makes dust brown-and-dim or smoke grey-and-dark rather than simply denser. Scaled by aerosolDensity alongside mieScattering."
+msgstr "基础米氏吸收系数 (km^-1)。在地球上，气溶胶的吸收量与散射量大致相当，因此将此值保持为零会使气溶胶消光仅为其物理值的一半左右——雾霭变浓时会变亮，而不会同时变暗。相对于 mieScattering 增大此值会使雾霭变暗，而使其带有色彩则会为雾霭染色：正是这个控制项让尘埃呈现昏暗的棕色、让烟雾呈现深灰色，而不只是变得更浓。与 mieScattering 一样受 aerosolDensity 缩放。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.ozoneAbsorption
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:322
+msgid "Base Ozone absorption coefficients (km^-1)."
+msgstr "基础臭氧吸收系数 (km^-1)。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.ozoneLayerAltitude
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:323
+msgid "Altitude of the ozone tent profile's peak in kilometers."
+msgstr "臭氧帐篷形分布峰值所在的高度（单位：千米）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.ozoneLayerWidth
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:324
+msgid "Half-width of the ozone tent profile in kilometers, and therefore the vertical ozone column. The paper uses a 30 km wide tent, so 15."
+msgstr "臭氧帐篷形分布的半宽（单位：千米），从而决定垂直臭氧柱。论文使用 30 km 宽的帐篷形分布，因此为 15。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.sunIlluminance
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:325
+msgid "Base Sun illuminance color/intensity."
+msgstr "基础太阳照度颜色/强度。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.multiScatterPhysicalStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:326
+msgid "Blend between the analytical multiscatter fit (0) and the physical Hillaire multiscattering LUT (1). Default 1.0 = physical: the LUT is the correct directional, transmittance-aware hemisphere integration and gives a believable zenith->horizon gradient with warm horizon tones. 0 = the legacy analytical inline fit, which is a flat isotropic blue-biased fill that flattens the gradient and desaturates the warm horizon (kept only for A/B). Intermediate values blend."
+msgstr "在解析多重散射拟合 (0) 与物理的 Hillaire 多重散射 LUT (1) 之间混合。默认 1.0 = 物理：LUT 是正确的、考虑方向和透射率的半球积分，能产生可信的天顶->地平线渐变以及温暖的地平线色调。0 = 旧版内联解析拟合，它是一种平坦、各向同性、偏蓝的填充，会使渐变变平并降低温暖地平线的饱和度（仅保留用于 A/B 对比）。中间值则进行混合。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.multiScatterStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:327
+msgid "Artistic global scale on the atmosphere's multiscattering 'fill' term. The physical two-term model adds a broadband (pale-blue) multiscatter term that desaturates warm sunset color. Lower this (e.g. 0.3-0.6) to let warm single-scatter dominate for a punchier sunset; 1.0 = physical. Feeds the sky-view LUT, so clouds inherit it."
+msgstr "对大气多重散射“填充”项的艺术化全局缩放。物理的双项模型会加入一个宽频（淡蓝色）多重散射项，降低温暖日落色彩的饱和度。降低此值（例如 0.3-0.6）可让温暖的单次散射占主导，使日落更鲜明；1.0 = 物理值。此值会输入天空视图 LUT，因此云也会继承它。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.sunsetSaturation
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:328
+msgid "Artistic saturation adjustment applied to sky radiance, ramped in as the sun approaches the horizon (midday sky is untouched). 1.0 = no change (default — the physical multiscatter path now produces correct horizon color at the source, so the former 0.5 desaturation band-aid is retired); <1 desaturates the near-horizon sky toward neutral; >1 amplifies the warm horizon hues. Feeds the sky-view LUT, so clouds inherit it."
+msgstr "应用于天空辐射度的艺术化饱和度调整，随太阳接近地平线逐渐生效（正午天空不受影响）。1.0 = 不变（默认——物理多重散射路径现已能从源头产生正确的地平线颜色，因此以前作为权宜之计的 0.5 去饱和已弃用）；<1 会使近地平线天空的饱和度向中性降低；>1 会增强温暖的地平线色调。此值会输入天空视图 LUT，因此云也会继承它。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.skyIndirectRadianceScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:330
+msgid "Artistic multiplier for sky radiance gathered by diffuse indirect bounces only. 1.0 = physical (default). Raise it to brighten diffuse sky fill (the distant-light sun has a much higher radiance than the sky, so indirect lighting reads dull). Applies only to genuine diffuse sky gather; sky seen via reflection, refraction, alpha-cutout, or the primary view stays at physical brightness so reflections match the visible sky."
+msgstr "仅作用于漫反射间接反弹所收集的天空辐射度的艺术化倍数。1.0 = 物理值（默认）。增大此值可提亮漫反射天空补光（作为远距离光源的太阳辐射度远高于天空，因此间接光照看起来较暗淡）。仅适用于真正的漫反射天空收集；通过反射、折射、Alpha 镂空或主视图看到的天空保持物理亮度，使反射与可见天空一致。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.starBrightness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:339
+msgid "Overall brightness multiplier for stars. Game-drivable per-frame (plugins can fade stars in/out around sunset/sunrise); persists when saved unless overridden by a runtime push."
+msgstr "星星的整体亮度倍数。可由游戏逐帧驱动（插件可在日落/日出前后淡入/淡出星星）；保存后会保留，除非被运行时推送的值覆盖。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.starDensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:341
+msgid "Star density on a linear-feel slider: 0 = no stars, 1 = maximum stars. Internally maps via pow(starDensity, 4) * 0.05 to a per-cell visible-star fraction, so the useful range (~0.1% to 5% of cells) spans the whole slider instead of compressing into the top 1% (the prior behavior, which made 0.98/0.99/1.0 the only viable settings). 0.5 = ~0.3% stars, 0.7 = ~1.2%, 1.0 = ~5%."
+msgstr "以手感呈线性的滑块表示的星星密度：0 = 无星星，1 = 最多星星。内部通过 pow(starDensity, 4) * 0.05 映射为每个单元格的可见星星比例，因此有用的范围（约 0.1% 至 5% 的单元格）会分布在整个滑块上，而不是压缩在最顶端的 1% 内（以前的行为，导致只有 0.98/0.99/1.0 是可用的设置）。0.5 = ~0.3% 的星星，0.7 = ~1.2%，1.0 = ~5%。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.starTwinkleSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:347
+msgid "Speed of star twinkling animation (0 = no twinkle)."
+msgstr "星星闪烁动画的速度（0 = 不闪烁）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.nightSkyBrightness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:355
+msgid "Ambient night-sky brightness from airglow and zodiacal light."
+msgstr "来自气辉和黄道光的夜空环境亮度。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.nightSkyColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:357
+msgid "Base color tint of the night-sky airglow."
+msgstr "夜空气辉的基础染色。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.milkyWayEnabled
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:359
+msgid "Master toggle for the galactic-band Milky Way effects: increased star density inside the band, and the diffuse background dust glow. When disabled, the star field is uniformly distributed at the base density across the whole sky. Off by default -- stylized opt-in for users who want the band aesthetic."
+msgstr "银河带效果的总开关：银河带内的星星密度增加，以及漫射的背景尘埃辉光。禁用时，星空以基础密度均匀分布在整个天空中。默认关闭——这是一种风格化效果，供想要银河带美感的用户选择启用。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.milkyWayDensityBoost
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:364
+msgid "Density threshold reduction inside the galactic band. Higher = more (and dimmer) stars visible only in the band region, producing the dense-band look."
+msgstr "银河带内的密度阈值降低量。值越高，仅在银河带区域内可见的星星越多（也越暗），形成密集的带状外观。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.milkyWayBackgroundBrightness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:367
+msgid "Diffuse background glow brightness for the Milky Way band -- represents unresolved stars + dust haze. 0 disables the glow. Default 0.05 gives a subtle ambient."
+msgstr "银河带漫射背景辉光的亮度——代表无法分辨的恒星 + 尘埃雾霭。0 表示禁用辉光。默认值 0.05 可提供微妙的环境光。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.milkyWayBackgroundColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:370
+msgid "Outer-edge tint for the Milky Way glow (the cool blue periphery away from the galactic center, where young stars dominate). Default cool blue (0.5, 0.55, 0.75)."
+msgstr "银河辉光的外缘染色（远离银河中心、以年轻恒星为主的冷蓝色外围）。默认为冷蓝色 (0.5, 0.55, 0.75)。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.milkyWayCoreColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:373
+msgid "Bright core tint for the Milky Way glow (warm yellow-cream toward the galactic center where stellar density peaks). Default warm cream (1.0, 0.85, 0.55)."
+msgstr "银河辉光的明亮核心染色（朝向恒星密度最高的银河中心的暖黄奶油色）。默认为暖奶油色 (1.0, 0.85, 0.55)。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.milkyWayDustAmount
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:379
+msgid "How strongly dust-lane patches darken the Milky Way glow. 0 = no dust (smooth uniform band), 1 = full dust contrast. Default 0.6."
+msgstr "尘埃带斑块使银河辉光变暗的程度。0 = 无尘埃（平滑均匀的光带），1 = 完全尘埃对比度。默认值 0.6。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.starPsfSharpness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:383
+msgid "PSF Gaussian exponent for procedural stars. Controls the per-star spread in cube-grid-cell space (gridScale=400 -> 13.5 arcmin/cell). Lower = wider softer stars; higher = sharper pinpoints. At 1080p/90 deg FOV, k=20 yields ~1-pixel-FWHM (anti-aliased), k=800 yields ~0.08-pixel-FWHM (severe sub-pixel flicker on camera motion). 8-30 is the useful range for typical render resolutions; reduce starBrightness if widening the PSF makes stars too bright overall."
+msgstr "程序化星星的 PSF 高斯指数。控制每颗星星在立方体网格单元空间中的扩散范围（gridScale=400 -> 13.5 角分/单元）。值越低，星星越宽越柔和；值越高，星点越锐利。在 1080p/90 度 FOV 下，k=20 产生约 1 像素的 FWHM（抗锯齿），k=800 产生约 0.08 像素的 FWHM（摄像机移动时出现严重的亚像素闪烁）。对于典型的渲染分辨率，8-30 是有用的范围；如果加宽 PSF 使星星整体过亮，请降低 starBrightness。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.starCloudExtinctionPower
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:391
+msgid "Power exponent applied to cloud view-transmittance when extincting stars. Stars are HDR point sources; standard alpha compositing (T^1) leaves bright pinpoints visible through cumulus cores. Raising to 2.5 makes stars die as T^2.5, well below cloud body brightness at typical T<0.1 cores while leaving clear sky (T=1) unaffected. Lower = stars survive thicker clouds; 1.0 = no extra extinction (pure standard composite)."
+msgstr "消光星星时应用于云层视线透射率的幂指数。星星是 HDR 点光源；标准 Alpha 合成 (T^1) 会让明亮的星点透过积云核心仍然可见。提高到 2.5 会使星星按 T^2.5 衰减，在典型的 T<0.1 云核处远低于云体亮度，而晴朗天空 (T=1) 不受影响。值越低，星星越能透过更厚的云层；1.0 = 无额外消光（纯标准合成）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.starAmbientCouplingStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:398
+msgid "Coupling strength of starlight/airglow into the cloud-march nightLight term (O(1) knob; the sub-0.01 night-radiance scale is folded into the internal kStarCloudCoupling constant in the shader). Adds a faint per-ray ambient based on (nightSkyColor * starBrightness * this) so cloud bodies lift slightly under starry skies. Default 0.25 = user-tested night level; higher brightens, 0 disables the coupling. This is the largest uniform night cloud term, so lower it first if night clouds glow."
+msgstr "星光/气辉耦合到云层步进 nightLight 项中的强度（O(1) 量级的调节项；低于 0.01 的夜间辐射度缩放已并入着色器内部的 kStarCloudCoupling 常量）。基于 (nightSkyColor * starBrightness * 此值) 为每条光线添加微弱的环境光，使云体在星空下略微提亮。默认值 0.25 = 经用户测试的夜间亮度；值越高越亮，0 表示禁用耦合。这是最大的均匀夜间云层项，因此如果夜间云层发光，请首先降低此值。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.moonNeeStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:450
+msgid "World-side master multiplier on direct moon lighting (surface NEE + clouds + future volumetric). 0 = moon does not light the world; 1 = default physical-baseline magnitude; >1 = brighten across all world-side paths simultaneously. Per-path fine-tuning available via surfaceMoonBrightness / cloudMoonBrightness / haloMoonBrightness."
+msgstr "世界端直接月光照明的总倍数（表面 NEE + 云层 + 未来的体积效果）。0 = 月亮不照亮世界；1 = 默认的物理基准量级；>1 = 同时提亮世界端的所有路径。可通过 surfaceMoonBrightness / cloudMoonBrightness / haloMoonBrightness 对各路径进行微调。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.moonAtmosphericCouplingStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:455
+msgid "Sky-side multiplier on the moon's contribution to atmospheric scattering. 0 = no blue-dome around the moon (sky stays pure black); 1 = default physical-baseline; >1 = exaggerated for stylized scenes."
+msgstr "天空端月亮对大气散射贡献的倍数。0 = 月亮周围没有蓝色穹顶（天空保持纯黑）；1 = 默认物理基准；>1 = 夸张效果，适用于风格化场景。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.surfaceMoonBrightness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:465
+msgid "Per-path stylistic multiplier on surface NEE (ground moonlight). Default 50.0 = user-tested baseline for visible ground under FNV tonemapper at m.brightness=1.0; 1.0 = physically-pure (very dim under typical tonemappers); raise for brighter ground."
+msgstr "表面 NEE（地面月光）的单路径风格化倍数。默认值 50.0 = 在 FNV 色调映射器、m.brightness=1.0 下使地面可见的用户测试基准；1.0 = 纯物理值（在典型色调映射器下非常暗）；增大可使地面更亮。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudMoonBrightness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:470
+msgid "Per-path stylistic multiplier on cloud-moon directional lighting + ambient airglow. Default 0.2 = user-tested baseline for cloud silver-lining under FNV tonemapper at m.brightness=1.0; 1.0 = physically-pure; 0 = no moon-cloud illumination. Higher values produce a stronger silver-lining peak on the cloud directly in front of the moon."
+msgstr "云层月光定向光照 + 环境气辉的单路径风格化倍数。默认值 0.2 = 在 FNV 色调映射器、m.brightness=1.0 下产生云层银边的用户测试基准；1.0 = 纯物理值；0 = 月亮不照亮云层。值越高，月亮正前方云层上的银边峰值越强。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.haloMoonBrightness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:476
+msgid "Per-path stylistic multiplier on disk halo Gaussian glow. Default 15.0 = user-tested baseline for visible halo glow under FNV tonemapper at m.brightness=1.0; 1.0 = physically-pure; 0 = no halo."
+msgstr "月盘光晕高斯辉光的单路径风格化倍数。默认值 15.0 = 在 FNV 色调映射器、m.brightness=1.0 下使光晕辉光可见的用户测试基准；1.0 = 纯物理值；0 = 无光晕。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.moonCloudAnisotropy
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:488
+msgid "Henyey-Greenstein anisotropy for cloud-moon forward scatter. Higher = sharper silver-lining peak (concentrated on cloud directly in front of moon); lower = softer falloff. Default 0.85."
+msgstr "云层月光前向散射的 Henyey-Greenstein 各向异性。值越高，银边峰值越锐利（集中在月亮正前方的云层上）；值越低，衰减越柔和。默认值 0.85。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.moonSilverLiningIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:502
+msgid "Master multiplier on the combined cloud-moon silver-lining contribution (Lambert diffuse + HG phase). Composes with moonCloudDiffuseGain/PhaseGain for ratio tuning."
+msgstr "云层月光银边总贡献（Lambert 漫反射 + HG 相位）的总倍数。与 moonCloudDiffuseGain/PhaseGain 组合使用以调整比例。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.moonHaloGlowStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:506
+msgid "Master multiplier on the combined moon halo + ambient airglow contribution. Composes with moonHaloMagnitude / moonAmbientAirglow for ratio tuning."
+msgstr "月亮光晕 + 环境气辉总贡献的总倍数。与 moonHaloMagnitude / moonAmbientAirglow 组合使用以调整比例。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudEnabled
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:510
+msgid "Enable procedural cloud rendering."
+msgstr "启用程序化云渲染。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudDensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:511
+msgid "Cloud opacity/density multiplier."
+msgstr "云的不透明度/密度倍数。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudAltitude
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:512
+msgid "Cloud layer altitude in kilometers."
+msgstr "云层高度（单位：千米）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:513
+msgid "Base cloud color (albedo)."
+msgstr "云的基础颜色（反照率）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudWindSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:514
+msgid "Cloud drift speed in km/s. Clouds scroll with this velocity."
+msgstr "云的漂移速度 (km/s)。云会以此速度滚动。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudWindDirection
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:515
+msgid "Cloud wind direction in degrees (0 = +X, 90 = +Z)."
+msgstr "云的风向（单位：度；0 = +X，90 = +Z）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudEvolutionSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:516
+msgid "Cloud field-evolution (morph) speed in km/s. Slowly scrolls the base 3D noise sample position through the volume — dominated by a vertical scroll through the decorrelated, tile-wrapping Y axis — so cloud formations form and dissolve in place instead of translating rigidly with the wind. Decorrelated from wind, so it also breaks the wind tile-repeat. 0 = field frozen (legacy rigid behavior)."
+msgstr "云场演变（变形）速度 (km/s)。使基础 3D 噪声采样位置在体积中缓慢滚动——主要是沿去相关、平铺环绕的 Y 轴垂直滚动——从而使云团原地形成和消散，而不是随风整体平移。由于与风去相关，它也能打破风造成的平铺重复。0 = 云场冻结（旧版刚性行为）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudShadowStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:531
+msgid "How strongly overcast clouds dim ground and atmosphere lighting [0..1]. 1.0 = full physical voxel-grid shadow contribution from cloudVoxelShadowsEnable; 0 = shadows fully muted (voxel grid still runs but its output is mixed away)."
+msgstr "阴天云层使地面和大气光照变暗的程度 [0..1]。1.0 = 来自 cloudVoxelShadowsEnable 的完整物理体素网格阴影贡献；0 = 完全关闭阴影（体素网格仍会运行，但其输出会被混合掉）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudThickness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:537
+msgid "Vertical depth of the cloud slab in km."
+msgstr "云层板的垂直厚度 (km)。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudMsScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:562
+msgid "Multi-scatter strength multiplier on the Nubis Cubed sigma_ms term [0..2]. 1.0 = paper baseline. sigma_ms is an EXTINCTION on the body lobe (exp(-sigma_ms * D_sun)), so higher = darker shadowed bulk / more shading contrast, lower = brighter, flatter body fill. (Doc fixed 2026-07-14; the old text had the direction inverted.)"
+msgstr "Nubis Cubed sigma_ms 项的多重散射强度倍数 [0..2]。1.0 = 论文基准。sigma_ms 是作用于云体波瓣的“消光”(exp(-sigma_ms * D_sun))，因此值越高，处于阴影中的云体越暗、明暗对比越强；值越低，云体填充越亮、越平。（文档已于 2026-07-14 修正；旧文本把方向写反了。）"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudTypeMean
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:569
+msgid "Mean cloud type across the sky [0,1]: 0=stratus, 0.5=stratocumulus, 1=cumulus."
+msgstr "整个天空的平均云类型 [0,1]：0=层云，0.5=层积云，1=积云。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudTypeSpread
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:571
+msgid "Spatial variation amplitude for cloud type [0,1]. 0=uniform, 1=full range across the sky."
+msgstr "云类型的空间变化幅度 [0,1]。0=均匀，1=在整个天空中取完整范围。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudTypeNoiseScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:573
+msgid "Region size frequency for type noise. Numerically smaller = larger spatial features. Capped at 0.0034 in the UI because faster variation puts visible 2D-noise cell structure at sub-cumulus scales (regular grid of cumulus blobs)."
+msgstr "类型噪声的区域大小频率。数值越小，空间特征越大。界面中上限为 0.0034，因为变化更快时会在小于积云的尺度上出现可见的 2D 噪声单元结构（规则排列的积云团）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudCoverageMean
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:577
+msgid "Mean cloud coverage across the sky [0,1]: 0=clear, 1=overcast."
+msgstr "整个天空的平均云量 [0,1]：0=晴朗，1=阴天。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudCoverageSpread
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:579
+msgid "Spatial variation amplitude for coverage [0,1]. 0=uniform, 1=full range."
+msgstr "云量的空间变化幅度 [0,1]。0=均匀，1=完整范围。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudCoverageNoiseScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:581
+msgid "Region size frequency for coverage noise. Independent from type noise scale."
+msgstr "云量噪声的区域大小频率。与类型噪声缩放相互独立。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudCellSizeKm
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:597
+msgid "Average cloud-cluster footprint in km [0.5..6] for the placement map bake. Smaller = many small clouds; larger = fewer, broader banks. Re-bakes the placement map live on change (the effective value snaps so an integer number of clusters fits the noise tile)."
+msgstr "放置图烘焙所用的平均云团占地尺寸 (km) [0.5..6]。值越小，小块云越多；值越大，云带越少越宽。更改后会实时重新烘焙放置图（实际值会对齐，使噪声图块中正好容纳整数个云团）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.nvdfProfileDepthKm
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:627
+msgid "Nubis3: depth into the cloud body (km) over which the dimensional profile ramps 0 -> 1 [0.1..3]. Small = dense hard-shelled clouds; large = soft translucent-edged bodies. Applies live."
+msgstr "Nubis3：维度剖面从 0 -> 1 过渡所跨越的云体内部深度 (km) [0.1..3]。值小 = 致密、外壳坚硬的云；值大 = 边缘柔和半透明的云体。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.nubis3ErosionStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:638
+msgid "Nubis3: scale on the wispy/billowy noise composite that erodes the dimensional profile [0..2]. 0 = smooth un-eroded bodies (pure SDF blobs); 1 = paper-faithful erosion; higher = ragged heavily-carved clouds. Applies live."
+msgstr "Nubis3：侵蚀维度剖面的丝缕状/团簇状噪声组合的缩放 [0..2]。0 = 平滑、未侵蚀的云体（纯 SDF 团块）；1 = 忠实于论文的侵蚀；更高 = 参差不齐、被大量雕刻的云。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.nvdfBodyErosionStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:648
+msgid "Nubis3: strength of the 3D noise carve applied to the cloud BODIES in the NVDF occupancy bake [0..1.5]. The carve shifts the placement waterline per voxel, baking concavity (overhangs, notches, lumps) into the otherwise-convex column bodies — the anti-blobby body lever. 0 = smooth convex bodies. Changing it re-bakes the SDF (amortized, ~6 frames)."
+msgstr "Nubis3：在 NVDF 占用烘焙中应用于云“体”的 3D 噪声雕刻强度 [0..1.5]。雕刻会逐体素移动放置水位线，将凹陷（悬垂、缺口、凸块）烘焙进原本凸起的柱状云体——这是避免云体呈团块状的调节项。0 = 平滑的凸形云体。更改此值会重新烘焙 SDF（分摊进行，约 6 帧）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.nubis3ShapeVarietyKm
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:661
+msgid "Nubis3: mid-frequency SHAPE displacement amplitude in km [0..1.5] (the GT7 mid-band role). Pushes/pulls the body iso-surface by up to half this at ~2.4 km wavelengths — lobes, notches and full splits that turn round singular blobs into varied cloud clusters. Whole-body reshaping, not edge detail; coverage-neutral on average. 0 = off. Applies live, no rebake."
+msgstr "Nubis3：中频“形状”置换幅度 (km) [0..1.5]（相当于 GT7 中频段的作用）。以约 2.4 km 的波长将云体等值面推/拉最多此值的一半——形成凸瓣、缺口乃至完全分裂，把圆而单一的团块变成形态各异的云簇。这是对整个云体的重塑，而非边缘细节；平均而言不影响云量。0 = 关闭。实时生效，无需重新烘焙。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLightingLodThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:669
+msgid "Nubis3: contribution-weighted lighting LOD [0..0.25]. A march sample's contribution weight is view transmittance x aerial haze x its own opacity — exactly the factor its color is multiplied by in the composite. Samples below this threshold skip the expensive near-field live sun refinement (two full density-sampler calls, ~9 of ~16 texture taps per dense sample) and the moon shadow march, falling back to the D_sun grid and unshadowed moonlight — the same fallbacks the existing thin-sample density gates already use, so this only coarsens lighting that was designed to degrade that way and never removes cloud material. Targets deep-in-cloud and distance-dimmed samples, which pay full price while contributing almost nothing to the pixel. Raise until edges or crevice contrast visibly soften, then back off. 0 = disabled (every sample fully refined). Applies live."
+msgstr "Nubis3：按贡献加权的光照 LOD [0..0.25]。步进采样的贡献权重为视线透射率 x 空气雾霭 x 其自身不透明度——正是合成时其颜色所乘的系数。低于此阈值的采样会跳过开销较大的近场实时太阳精细计算（两次完整的密度采样器调用，约占每个致密采样约 16 次纹理读取中的 9 次）以及月光阴影步进，转而回退到 D_sun 网格和无阴影月光——这与现有的稀薄采样密度门限所使用的回退方式相同，因此只会降低本就设计为可以这样降级的光照精度，绝不会移除云的物质。针对的是位于云深处和因距离而变暗的采样，它们付出全部开销，却几乎不为像素提供贡献。请逐渐增大此值，直到边缘或缝隙对比度明显变柔和，然后再调回一些。0 = 禁用（所有采样都完整精细计算）。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.nubis3EdgeErosion
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:693
+msgid "Nubis3: edge wisp cut [0..3]. Extra erosion shaped by the wispy noise channel, concentrated at the silhouette and fading by mid-shell — cuts trailing wisp shapes out of cloud edges while billowy cores keep rounded cauliflower edges. 0 = uniform erosion only. Applies live."
+msgstr "Nubis3：边缘丝缕切割 [0..3]。由丝缕噪声通道塑造的额外侵蚀，集中在轮廓处，并在外壳中部逐渐减弱——从云的边缘切出拖尾的丝缕形状，而团簇状的核心则保持圆润的花椰菜状边缘。0 = 仅均匀侵蚀。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudViewStepKm
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:724
+msgid "Distance between cloud samples along each view ray, in km [0.1..1]. Fixes the horizontal banding near the horizon (sightlines there cross 50+ km of cloud layer, which the legacy fixed 32-sample march could not resolve). PERFORMANCE: cost scales with samples per ray — overhead views are unchanged, horizon-heavy views can cost up to cloudViewSamplesMax/32 times more cloud time (2x at defaults). Raise the spacing or lower the cap to trade quality for speed; 0 = legacy fixed count (banding returns). Applies live."
+msgstr "沿每条视线的云采样间距 (km) [0.1..1]。可修复地平线附近的水平条带（那里的视线会穿过 50 km 以上的云层，旧版固定 32 次采样的步进无法解析）。性能：开销随每条光线的采样数增长——俯视视角不受影响，以地平线为主的视角最多可使云的耗时增加到 cloudViewSamplesMax/32 倍（默认设置下为 2 倍）。增大间距或降低上限可牺牲质量换取速度；0 = 旧版固定次数（条带会重新出现）。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudViewSamplesMax
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:735
+msgid "Hard cap on cloud samples per ray [32..256] — the performance governor for cloudViewStepKm. 64 resolves the default spacing out to ~6 km of cloud span; lower costs less but lets some banding back in at the far horizon. 32 = legacy cost ceiling. Applies live."
+msgstr "每条光线云采样数的硬上限 [32..256]——这是 cloudViewStepKm 的性能调节器。64 可在默认间距下解析约 6 km 的云层跨度；更低的值开销更小，但会让远处地平线重新出现一些条带。32 = 旧版开销上限。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudUndersideLightSigma
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:741
+msgid "Extinction of the light filtering down through each cloud, per km of overlying water [0..0.5]. Drives the analytic per-column underside light field: brightness varies continuously with the water above every point (dark cores, bright thin spots, smooth gradients) instead of one flat-lit sheet. Higher = darker, more dramatic undersides; 0 = underside darkening off (flat-lit base). Overall strength and the sun-elevation fade are set by Bottom Darkening. Applies live."
+msgstr "穿过每片云向下透射的光线的消光量，以上方每千米水量计 [0..0.5]。驱动解析的逐柱底面光场：亮度随每个点上方的水量连续变化（暗的核心、亮的稀薄处、平滑的渐变），而不是一整片均匀照亮的平面。值越高，底面越暗、越有戏剧性；0 = 关闭底面变暗（底部均匀照亮）。整体强度和随太阳高度的淡化由“底部变暗”设置。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudMicroAoStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:765
+msgid "Billow-scale shading from the edge-detail field [0..1]: grown cauliflower knuckles brighten, carved crevices darken, so the edge detail reads inside the cloud body instead of only at the silhouette. Applies to ambient + multi-scatter body light; silver linings are exempt. 0 = off (legacy smooth shading)."
+msgstr "来自边缘细节场的团簇尺度着色 [0..1]：生长出的花椰菜状凸起变亮，雕刻出的缝隙变暗，使边缘细节在云体内部也能体现，而不仅在轮廓处。作用于环境光 + 多重散射云体光照；银边不受影响。0 = 关闭（旧版平滑着色）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.lightningEnable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:784
+msgid "Lightning master switch. With this on, lightning is driven entirely by lightningStrikesPerMinute (default 0 = no strikes) - the weather presets raise the rate for storm archetypes. Turn this off to mute lightning everywhere, including storm presets and the Test Strike button."
+msgstr "闪电总开关。开启后，闪电完全由 lightningStrikesPerMinute 驱动（默认 0 = 无闪电）——天气预设会为风暴类型提高频率。关闭此项可在所有地方屏蔽闪电，包括风暴预设和“测试闪电”按钮。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.lightningStrikesPerMinute
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:790
+msgid "Mean lightning strike rate per minute [0..60]. Inter-strike gaps are randomized (Poisson-like) so strikes cluster and lull naturally. 0 = no automatic strikes (Test Strike still works). Driven by the weather-preset system when a preset is active (thunderstorm 12/min, rainstorm 4/min)."
+msgstr "每分钟的平均闪电次数 [0..60]。闪电间隔是随机的（类似泊松分布），因此闪电会自然地密集出现或暂歇。0 = 无自动闪电（“测试闪电”仍然有效）。启用预设时由天气预设系统驱动（雷暴 12 次/分钟，暴雨 4 次/分钟）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.lightningFlashIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:796
+msgid "Radiance scale of the in-cloud flash glow. Higher = the deck lights up brighter and the glow reaches further through the cloud. Tune against your sky brightness; the flash competes with direct sunlight, so night storms need far less."
+msgstr "云内闪光辉光的辐射度缩放。值越高，云层被照得越亮，辉光在云中传播得越远。请根据天空亮度调整；闪光会与直射阳光相互竞争，因此夜间风暴所需的值要小得多。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.lightningSceneLightIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:801
+msgid "Radiance of the transient sphere light that flashes the SCENE at the strike position (independent of the in-cloud glow's intensity). 0 = cloud-only lightning (no ground flash)."
+msgstr "在闪电位置照亮“场景”的瞬时球形光源的辐射度（与云内辉光的强度无关）。0 = 仅云内闪电（无地面闪光）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.lightningRangeKm
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:806
+msgid "Maximum strike distance from the camera in km [1.5..30]. Strikes distribute uniformly by area between 1 km and this range."
+msgstr "闪电距摄像机的最大距离 (km) [1.5..30]。闪电在 1 km 到此范围之间按面积均匀分布。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.lightningColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:810
+msgid "Lightning flash color (linear RGB), shared by the in-cloud glow and the scene flash. Default is a cool blue-white."
+msgstr "闪电闪光颜色（线性 RGB），由云内辉光和场景闪光共用。默认为冷蓝白色。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudBottomDarkening
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:824
+msgid "Strength of the cloud-underside darkening [0..1]. Scales the analytic per-column light field (shaped by Underside Shading) applied to the multi-scatter and ambient terms; the direct sun beam (silver lining) is unaffected. The darkening is strongest with the sun overhead and fades out toward the horizon, where the low sun rakes under the deck and lights the bases (sunset glow). 0 = off (uniformly lit undersides)."
+msgstr "云底变暗的强度 [0..1]。缩放应用于多重散射和环境光项的解析逐柱光场（由“底面着色”塑造）；直射阳光光束（银边）不受影响。太阳位于头顶时变暗效果最强，并向地平线方向逐渐减弱——此时低角度的太阳从云层下方掠过，照亮云底（日落辉光）。0 = 关闭（云底均匀照亮）。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudSkyAmbientFill
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:832
+msgid "How strongly cloud undersides pick up the open sky around them [0..1]. Adds a sky-dome fill - the overhead sky color, bypassing the bottom-darkening since that skylight reaches the base from below/around rather than through the cloud. Lifts gloomy undersides under a bright daytime sky and tints them with the actual sky color; naturally fades at sunset (the overhead sky is dim then). Higher = brighter, more sky-colored bases; 0 = off (legacy, undersides ignore the open sky). Applies live."
+msgstr "云底从周围开阔天空获取光照的程度 [0..1]。添加天穹补光——即头顶天空的颜色，并绕过底部变暗，因为这部分天光是从下方/周围到达云底，而不是穿过云层。在明亮的白天天空下提亮阴沉的云底，并以实际天空颜色为其染色；日落时自然减弱（此时头顶天空较暗）。值越高，云底越亮、越接近天空颜色；0 = 关闭（旧版，云底忽略开阔天空）。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudAmbientShadowStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:841
+msgid "Dramatic shading [0..1]: how much the sky-ambient fill is attenuated by sun-shadow depth inside the cloud. The ambient term otherwise refloods sun-shadowed bulk with bright daytime sky light, flattening the cloud; with this, shaded cores fall toward dark grey while sunlit faces and silver linings keep their full ambient - the high-contrast puffy-cumulus read. The sky-dome underside fill (Sky Ambient Fill) is exempt so midday bases keep their open-sky floor. 0 = off (legacy flat ambient). Applies live."
+msgstr "戏剧化着色 [0..1]：云内太阳阴影深度对天空环境补光的衰减程度。否则环境光项会用明亮的白天天光重新填满处于太阳阴影中的云体，使云看起来扁平；启用后，处于阴影中的核心会趋向深灰色，而受阳光照射的面和银边保留完整的环境光——呈现高对比度的蓬松积云效果。天穹对云底的补光（“天空环境补光”）不受影响，因此正午的云底仍保有来自开阔天空的基础亮度。0 = 关闭（旧版平坦环境光）。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudAerialHazePerKm
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:862
+msgid "Per-km haze extinction applied to cloud RADIANCE (effect A of the aerial-perspective path). Dims distant cloud samples toward atmospheric color so they read as 'softer / duller with distance.' Visual softness control - does NOT prevent the horizon white wall by itself. 0 = no haze. Default 0.05."
+msgstr "应用于云“辐射度”的每千米雾霭消光（空气透视路径的效果 A）。使远处的云采样向大气颜色变暗，让云看起来“随距离变得更柔和/更暗淡”。这是视觉柔和度控制——仅靠它“无法”消除地平线处的白墙。0 = 无雾霭。默认值 0.05。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudAerialFadePerKm
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:868
+msgid "Per-km fade extinction applied to cloud ALPHA accumulation (effect B of the aerial-perspective path). Distant samples stop piling up extinction so horizon-grazing rays don't form a solid white wall. Does NOT affect cloud appearance close to camera. 0 = no fade (legacy white-wall behavior). Default 0.05."
+msgstr "应用于云“Alpha”累积的每千米淡出消光（空气透视路径的效果 B）。远处的采样不再累积消光，使掠过地平线的光线不会形成一堵实心白墙。“不会”影响靠近摄像机的云的外观。0 = 无淡出（旧版白墙行为）。默认值 0.05。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudPhaseG1
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:875
+msgid "Primary HG asymmetry; strong forward-scatter, drives silver lining at backlit edges."
+msgstr "主 HG 不对称参数；强前向散射，形成逆光边缘的银边。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudRenderResolutionScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:908
+msgid "Resolution scale of the cloud render target relative to the internal (DLSS-input) resolution [0.25..1]. 0.5 = quarter the pixels (~4x cheaper cloud march); 1.0 = native (legacy, bit-exact). Applies on the next frame; live-tunable."
+msgstr "云渲染目标相对于内部（DLSS 输入）分辨率的缩放比例 [0.25..1]。0.5 = 像素数为四分之一（云步进开销约为原来的 1/4）；1.0 = 原生（旧版，逐位一致）。下一帧生效；可实时调整。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudHistoryWeight
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:913
+msgid "EMA history weight of the cloud temporal smoother [0..0.98]. Higher = smoother/softer clouds that respond slowly; lower = crisper, faster-responding clouds with more visible per-frame jitter. 0 disables the temporal blend entirely (raw jittered march). 0.92 = the previous hardcoded value. Applies live."
+msgstr "云时域平滑器的 EMA 历史权重 [0..0.98]。值越高，云越平滑柔和，但响应较慢；值越低，云越清晰、响应越快，但每帧抖动更明显。0 表示完全禁用时域混合（原始的抖动步进）。0.92 = 以前硬编码的值。实时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudSecondaryLutEnable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:920
+msgid "Supply clouds to secondary rays (indirect bounces, PSR, reflections) from a small per-frame baked dome LUT instead of a per-ray cloud march. Large performance win on cloudy skies, and reflected/indirect clouds match the primary Nubis look. Disable to make secondary sky-miss rays cloudless."
+msgstr "通过每帧烘焙的小型穹顶 LUT 为次级光线（间接反弹、PSR、反射）提供云，而不是逐光线进行云步进。在多云天空下能大幅提升性能，且反射/间接光中的云与主视图的 Nubis 外观一致。禁用后，未命中而射向天空的次级光线将看不到云。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2Enable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1020
+msgid "When true, cloud_render.comp.slang marches a second 'echo' cloud deck above the primary slab — the same cloud-slab density model at a higher, gapped altitude, marched cheaply (low step budget, analytic sun shadow, no moon path). Layer 2 has its own altitude / thickness / type / coverage / density-scale / noise-seed knobs (the cloudLayer2* options below); the seed decorrelates the deck's coverage/type field from layer 1 so it reads as a related-but-different cloudscape. Voxel-grid terrain shadows + ground-shadow NEE remain layer-1-only."
+msgstr "为 true 时，cloud_render.comp.slang 会在主云层板上方步进第二个“回声”云层——使用相同的云层板密度模型，位于更高且有间隔的高度，并以低开销方式步进（较少的步数预算、解析太阳阴影、无月光路径）。第 2 层有自己的高度/厚度/类型/云量/密度缩放/噪声种子调节项（即下方的 cloudLayer2* 选项）；种子使该云层的云量/类型场与第 1 层去相关，从而呈现出相关但不同的云景。体素网格地形阴影 + 地面阴影 NEE 仍仅适用于第 1 层。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2Altitude
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1030
+msgid "Altitude (km) of the layer-2 deck base. The gap between the layer-1 top (cloudAltitude + cloudThickness) and this value is the clear-sky band separating the two decks."
+msgstr "第 2 层云底的高度 (km)。第 1 层顶部 (cloudAltitude + cloudThickness) 与此值之间的间隔，就是分隔两层云的晴空带。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2Thickness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1034
+msgid "Vertical depth (km) of the layer-2 deck."
+msgstr "第 2 层云的垂直厚度 (km)。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2TypeMean
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1036
+msgid "[0,1] mean cloud type for layer 2. Low values (~0.05) sample the LUT's stratus-shaped column — appropriate for cirrus."
+msgstr "第 2 层的平均云类型 [0,1]。较低的值（~0.05）会采样 LUT 中层云形状的列——适合卷云。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2CoverageMean
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1039
+msgid "[0,1] mean coverage for layer 2. Defaults sparser than layer 1 so cirrus reads as wispy patches rather than overcast."
+msgstr "第 2 层的平均云量 [0,1]。默认比第 1 层更稀疏，使卷云呈现为丝缕状的斑块，而不是阴天。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2DensityScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1050
+msgid "Per-step density multiplier applied to layer 2 only. Lower values keep the echo deck from competing visually with the cumulus deck below."
+msgstr "仅应用于第 2 层的每步密度倍数。较低的值可避免回声云层在视觉上与下方的积云层相互竞争。"
+
+#. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2Color
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1065
+msgid "Base color (albedo) of the layer-2 echo deck, independent of the main cloudColor. Defaults to the same near-white so the deck matches layer 1 until changed; tint it to differentiate the upper deck (e.g. cooler high cirrus). The deck shares all other look knobs with layer 1 (phase, multi-scatter, detail, etc.)."
+msgstr "第 2 层回声云层的基础颜色（反照率），独立于主 cloudColor。默认使用相同的近白色，因此在更改之前该层与第 1 层一致；可为其染色以区分上层云（例如色调更冷的高空卷云）。该层与第 1 层共用所有其他外观调节项（相位、多重散射、细节等）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:88
+msgid "Sky Mode"
+msgstr "天空模式"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:90
+msgid "Skybox Rasterization"
+msgstr "天空盒光栅化"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:91
+msgid "Numos"
+msgstr "Numos"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:143
+msgid "Angular Radius"
+msgstr "角半径"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:144
+msgid "Brightness"
+msgstr "亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:147
+msgid "Elevation"
+msgstr "高度角"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:148
+msgid "Moon elevation in degrees. Game-drivable per-frame; slider edits persist when saved unless overridden by a runtime push."
+msgstr "月亮高度角（单位：度）。可由游戏逐帧驱动；滑块的修改在保存后会保留，除非被运行时推送的值覆盖。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:149
+msgid "Rotation"
+msgstr "旋转角"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:150
+msgid "Moon rotation/azimuth in degrees. Same persistence rules as Elevation."
+msgstr "月亮旋转角/方位角（单位：度）。保留规则与“高度角”相同。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:151
+msgid "Phase"
+msgstr "月相"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:152
+msgid "Moon phase: 0 = new, 0.25 = first quarter, 0.5 = full, 0.75 = third quarter. Same persistence rules as Elevation."
+msgstr "月相：0 = 新月，0.25 = 上弦月，0.5 = 满月，0.75 = 下弦月。保留规则与“高度角”相同。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:154
+msgid "Appearance"
+msgstr "外观"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:155
+msgid "Rocky"
+msgstr "岩石"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:155
+msgid "Volcanic"
+msgstr "火山"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:157
+msgid "Surface Style"
+msgstr "表面风格"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:160
+msgid "Procedural surface preset. Knobs below tune the chosen style."
+msgstr "程序化表面预设。下方的调节项用于微调所选风格。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:162
+msgid "Crater Density"
+msgstr "陨石坑密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:169 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1109
+msgid "Detail"
+msgstr "细节"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:182
+msgid "Combined surface detail: smooth/coarse <- 0.0 ... 1.0 (default) ... 2.0 -> punchy/fine. Drives Surface Contrast and Surface Noise Scale via a two-segment linear curve. Power users can .conf-tune surfaceContrast / surfaceNoiseScale individually for off-curve combinations."
+msgstr "综合表面细节：平滑/粗糙 <- 0.0 ... 1.0（默认）... 2.0 -> 鲜明/精细。通过两段线性曲线驱动“表面对比度”和“表面噪声缩放”。高级用户可在 .conf 中分别调整 surfaceContrast / surfaceNoiseScale，以获得曲线之外的组合。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:186
+msgid "Dark Side Brightness"
+msgstr "暗面亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:198
+msgid "Sun"
+msgstr "太阳"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:202
+msgid "Sun Size"
+msgstr "太阳大小"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:204
+msgid "Angular diameter of the sun light in degrees (Earth's sun is ~0.545 deg). The light's half-angle = Sun Size / 2, which sets shadow softness and the sun's size in reflective highlights. Numos draws no separate sun disc. Greyed out while Shadow Softness > 0 (the override owns the half-angle)."
+msgstr "太阳光源的角直径（单位：度；地球上的太阳约为 0.545 度）。光源的半角 = 太阳大小 / 2，它决定阴影的柔和度以及太阳在反射高光中的大小。Numos 不会单独绘制太阳圆盘。当“阴影柔和度”> 0 时此项变灰（半角由该覆盖值控制）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:211
+msgid "Shadow Softness"
+msgstr "阴影柔和度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:213
+msgid "Override for the sun light's angular half-angle, in degrees. 0 = physical: track Sun Size / 2 (leave here unless you need the override). When > 0 it owns the half-angle and Sun Size greys out - larger = softer penumbra. Kept separate from Sun Size so a game/API-driven physical sun size can stay untouched while shadows are art-directed."
+msgstr "覆盖太阳光源的半角（单位：度）。0 = 物理值：跟随“太阳大小”/ 2（除非需要覆盖，否则保持此值）。值 > 0 时由它控制半角，“太阳大小”变灰——值越大，半影越柔和。与“太阳大小”分开设置，以便在对阴影进行艺术调整的同时，保持由游戏/API 驱动的物理太阳大小不变。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:220
+msgid "Sun Intensity"
+msgstr "太阳强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:221
+msgid "Strength of Sun"
+msgstr "太阳的强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:231
+#, c-format
+msgid "Sun Elevation   %7.2f deg"
+msgstr "太阳高度角  %7.2f 度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:232
+#, c-format
+msgid "Sun Rotation    %7.2f deg"
+msgstr "太阳旋转角  %7.2f 度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:234
+msgid "Driven by the Time Cycle below. Disable it to control the sun directly again."
+msgstr "由下方的“时间循环”驱动。禁用它即可重新直接控制太阳。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:236
+msgid "Sun Elevation"
+msgstr "太阳高度角"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:237
+msgid "Sun angle from horizon"
+msgstr "太阳相对地平线的角度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:239
+msgid "Sun Rotation"
+msgstr "太阳旋转角"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:240
+msgid "Rotation of sun around zenith"
+msgstr "太阳绕天顶的旋转"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:244
+msgid "Flip Up Axis"
+msgstr "翻转向上轴"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:246
+msgid ""
+"Fixes a sky rendered exactly upside down - bright zenith beneath you, dark ground half overhead - in games whose up axis points the opposite way to what Remix assumes.\n"
+"\n"
+"NOT the fix for a sky that looks rotated or sideways; that is rtx.zUp not matching the game. To tell them apart: turn the Time Cycle off, set Sun Elevation to about 45, and look straight up. Zenith off to one side = zUp problem. Zenith under your feet = this.\n"
+"\n"
+"Also reverses the direction the sun travels across the sky - flipping which way is up reverses the sense of rotation seen from the new zenith. Sun Rotation / North Offset move where the arc sits but cannot undo that."
+msgstr ""
+"在向上轴方向与 Remix 假设相反的游戏中，修复完全上下颠倒的天空（明亮的天顶在脚下，黑暗的地面占据头顶的半边天）。\n"
+"\n"
+"对于看起来旋转或侧倒的天空，此选项“不是”解决办法；那是 rtx.zUp 与游戏不一致所致。区分方法：关闭“时间循环”，将“太阳高度角”设为约 45，然后正视上方。天顶偏向一侧 = zUp 问题。天顶在脚下 = 此问题。\n"
+"\n"
+"此选项还会反转太阳在天空中运行的方向——翻转向上方向会使从新天顶看去的旋转方向反转。“太阳旋转角”/“北向偏移”可以移动弧线的位置，但无法撤销这一点。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:255
+msgid "Time Cycle"
+msgstr "时间循环"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:256
+msgid "Enable Time Cycle"
+msgstr "启用时间循环"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:258
+msgid "Drive the sun from a Remix-side clock instead of Sun Elevation / Sun Rotation. The intended workflow is for the game to push the sun through the Remix API, but plenty of games have no day/night cycle to push - this gives them one. While enabled it OWNS the sun direction, and Sun Elevation / Sun Rotation (including API pushes) are ignored."
+msgstr "使用 Remix 端的时钟驱动太阳，而不是使用“太阳高度角”/“太阳旋转角”。预期的工作流程是由游戏通过 Remix API 推送太阳，但许多游戏没有可推送的昼夜循环——此功能可为它们提供昼夜循环。启用期间，太阳方向“完全”由此控制，“太阳高度角”/“太阳旋转角”（包括 API 推送）都将被忽略。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:266
+#, c-format
+msgid "Current time    %02d:%02d"
+msgstr "当前时间    %02d:%02d"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:268
+msgid "Time Of Day"
+msgstr "时刻"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:270
+msgid "Hours, 0-24. 12 is solar noon. While the cycle runs this is the START time and editing it re-seeds the running clock; while the cycle is off it places the sun directly, so it doubles as a manual time-of-day control."
+msgstr "小时，0-24。12 为太阳正午。循环运行时，此值为“起始”时间，编辑它会重新设定正在运行的时钟；循环关闭时，它会直接放置太阳，因此也可用作手动的时间控制。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:274
+msgid "Day Length"
+msgstr "一天时长"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:276
+msgid "Real-world minutes for one full 24-hour cycle. 24 gives a minute per in-game hour."
+msgstr "完成一个完整 24 小时循环所需的现实时间（分钟）。设为 24 表示游戏中每小时对应现实中 1 分钟。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:278
+msgid "Latitude"
+msgstr "纬度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:280
+msgid "Observer latitude, positive north. Sets how high the sun climbs and how tilted its arc is: 0 sends it near-vertically overhead, high latitudes keep it low with long shallow sunrises and sunsets."
+msgstr "观察者所在纬度，北纬为正。决定太阳升得多高以及其运行弧线的倾斜程度：0 时太阳几乎垂直经过头顶，高纬度时太阳始终较低，日出和日落漫长而平缓。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:284
+msgid "Day Of Year"
+msgstr "一年中的第几天"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:286
+msgid "Sets the solar declination, i.e. the season. 80 = March equinox (due-east sunrise, 12-hour day), 172 = June solstice, 355 = December solstice."
+msgstr "设置太阳赤纬，即季节。80 = 三月春分（太阳从正东升起，白昼 12 小时），172 = 六月夏至，355 = 十二月冬至。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:289
+msgid "North Offset"
+msgstr "北向偏移"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:291
+msgid "Rotates the whole solar arc so the model's north matches the game world's. Adjust until sunrise arrives from the direction the game treats as east."
+msgstr "旋转整条太阳运行弧线，使模型的北方与游戏世界的北方一致。请调整至日出方向与游戏中视为东方的方向一致。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:303
+msgid "Stars"
+msgstr "星星"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:304
+msgid "Star Brightness"
+msgstr "星星亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:306
+msgid "Star Density"
+msgstr "星星密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:308
+msgid "Threshold: 0 = all stars visible, 1 = no stars."
+msgstr "阈值：0 = 所有星星可见，1 = 无星星。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:309
+msgid "Star Twinkle Speed"
+msgstr "星星闪烁速度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:317
+msgid "Milky Way"
+msgstr "银河"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:320
+msgid "Master toggle for galactic-band effects: in-band density boost, band-specific star colors, and the diffuse background glow. When off, stars distribute uniformly."
+msgstr "银河带效果的总开关：带内密度增强、带内特有的星星颜色以及漫射背景辉光。关闭时，星星均匀分布。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:322
+msgid "Density Boost"
+msgstr "密度增强"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:325
+msgid "Extra star density inside the galactic band. Higher = more (dim) band stars."
+msgstr "银河带内额外的星星密度。值越高，带内（较暗的）星星越多。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:326
+msgid "Glow Brightness"
+msgstr "辉光亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:329
+msgid "Diffuse band-glow brightness (the soft dust haze across the Milky Way). 0 disables the glow."
+msgstr "银河带漫射辉光的亮度（横贯银河的柔和尘埃雾霭）。0 表示禁用辉光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:330
+msgid "Outer Color"
+msgstr "外缘颜色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:332
+msgid "Cool outer-edge tint of the band (where young stars dominate). Default cool blue."
+msgstr "银河带外缘的冷色调染色（以年轻恒星为主的区域）。默认为冷蓝色。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:333
+msgid "Core Color"
+msgstr "核心颜色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:336
+msgid "Warm bright-core tint at the galactic center. Default warm cream/yellow. HDR — values above 1.0 push beyond LDR gamut for a brighter core."
+msgstr "银河中心明亮核心的暖色调染色。默认为暖奶油色/黄色。HDR——高于 1.0 的值会超出 LDR 色域，使核心更亮。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:340
+msgid "Dust Amount"
+msgstr "尘埃量"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:343
+msgid "How strongly dust patches darken the glow. 0 = no dust, 1 = full dust contrast."
+msgstr "尘埃斑块使辉光变暗的程度。0 = 无尘埃，1 = 完全尘埃对比度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:350
+msgid "Star Appearance"
+msgstr "星星外观"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:351
+msgid "Star PSF Sharpness"
+msgstr "星星 PSF 锐度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:354
+msgid "Gaussian PSF exponent. Lower = bigger softer stars, higher = sharper pinpoints."
+msgstr "高斯 PSF 指数。值越低，星星越大越柔和；值越高，星点越锐利。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:355
+msgid "Star Cloud Extinction Power"
+msgstr "星星云层消光幂"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:358
+msgid "Exponent on cloud view-transmittance when extincting stars. Higher = stars die through clouds faster."
+msgstr "消光星星时云层视线透射率的指数。值越高，星星穿过云层时消失得越快。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:359
+msgid "Star Ambient Coupling"
+msgstr "星星环境耦合"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:362
+msgid "Star/airglow coupling into cloud-march nightLight, as a multiple of the calibrated night level (1.0 = calibrated, ~2 doubles it). 0 = disabled."
+msgstr "星光/气辉耦合到云层步进 nightLight 中的强度，以校准夜间亮度的倍数表示（1.0 = 校准值，~2 为两倍）。0 = 禁用。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:370
+msgid "Global Lighting"
+msgstr "整体光照"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:372
+msgid "Atmospheric Coupling"
+msgstr "大气耦合"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:376
+msgid "Multiplier on the moon's contribution to atmospheric scattering. 0 = no blue-dome around the moon; 1 = default; >1 = exaggerated."
+msgstr "月亮对大气散射贡献的倍数。0 = 月亮周围没有蓝色穹顶；1 = 默认；>1 = 夸张效果。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:385
+msgid "Surface Brightness"
+msgstr "表面亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:388
+msgid "Moonlight level on the ground / scene (surface path only; clouds are Cloud Brightness below). Default 50 is the FNV tonemapper calibration. The conf-only moonNeeStrength master scales both paths and is driven by weather presets."
+msgstr "地面/场景上的月光亮度（仅表面路径；云层请使用下方的“云层亮度”）。默认值 50 是针对 FNV 色调映射器的校准值。仅能在 conf 中设置的总控 moonNeeStrength 会同时缩放两条路径，并由天气预设驱动。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:393
+msgid "Cloud Brightness"
+msgstr "云层亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:396
+msgid "Overall cloud-moon lighting: the directional silver-lining term AND the ambient airglow together. For forward-glow emphasis only, use Silver Lining Intensity (Cloud-Look & Halo Shape) instead of stacking this."
+msgstr "云层月光的整体光照：同时包括定向银边项“和”环境气辉。如果只想强调前向辉光，请使用“银边强度”（位于“云层外观与光晕形状”中），而不要叠加此值。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:406
+msgid "Cloud-Look & Halo Shape"
+msgstr "云层外观与光晕形状"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:407
+msgid "Silver Lining Intensity"
+msgstr "银边强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:410
+msgid "Forward-glow emphasis ONLY: scales the directional silver-lining term (Lambert diffuse + HG phase) in front of the moon and nothing else. The overall cloud-moon level (incl. airglow) is Cloud Brightness (Global Lighting) - set that first, then emphasize here. 0 = no silver lining. Diffuse-vs-phase ratio: .conf moonCloudDiffuseGain / moonCloudPhaseGain."
+msgstr "“仅”用于强调前向辉光：只缩放月亮前方的定向银边项（Lambert 漫反射 + HG 相位），不影响其他任何内容。云层月光的整体亮度（包括气辉）由“云层亮度”（位于“整体光照”中）控制——请先设置它，再在此处进行强调。0 = 无银边。漫反射与相位的比例：.conf 中的 moonCloudDiffuseGain / moonCloudPhaseGain。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:417
+msgid "Silver Lining Sharpness"
+msgstr "银边锐度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:420
+msgid "Tightness of the silver-lining glow peak. Higher = sharper pinpoint; lower = softer falloff. Henyey-Greenstein g for cloud-moon forward scatter. Default 0.85."
+msgstr "银边辉光峰值的集中程度。值越高，光点越锐利；值越低，衰减越柔和。即云层月光前向散射的 Henyey-Greenstein g 值。默认值 0.85。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:423
+msgid "Halo Glow"
+msgstr "光晕辉光"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:426
+msgid "MASTER over the moon's glow: scales the disk halo AND the cloud ambient airglow together. 0 = no halo / airglow. 1 = default. Halo-vs-airglow ratio: Halo Brightness below (halo-only trim), or .conf moonHaloMagnitude / moonAmbientAirglow."
+msgstr "月亮辉光的“总控”：同时缩放月盘光晕“和”云层环境气辉。0 = 无光晕/气辉。1 = 默认。光晕与气辉的比例：使用下方的“光晕亮度”（仅调整光晕），或 .conf 中的 moonHaloMagnitude / moonAmbientAirglow。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:433
+msgid "Halo Brightness"
+msgstr "光晕亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:436
+msgid "Halo-only trim under the Halo Glow master: scales the disk halo Gaussian WITHOUT touching the cloud airglow - sets the halo : airglow ratio. Default 15 is the FNV tonemapper calibration (1 = physically pure)."
+msgstr "“光晕辉光”总控下仅针对光晕的微调：缩放月盘光晕高斯项，但“不”影响云层气辉——用于设置光晕 : 气辉的比例。默认值 15 是针对 FNV 色调映射器的校准值（1 = 纯物理值）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:554
+msgid ""
+"Skybox Rasterization: Traditional skybox rendering\n"
+"Numos: Hillaire atmospheric scattering"
+msgstr ""
+"天空盒光栅化：传统天空盒渲染\n"
+"Numos：Hillaire 大气散射"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:557
+msgid "Sky Brightness"
+msgstr "天空亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:561
+#, c-format
+msgid "Atmosphere Presets:"
+msgstr "大气预设："
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:571
+msgid "Earth (Default)"
+msgstr "地球（默认）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:586
+msgid "Physically accurate Earth atmosphere parameters from Hillaire paper"
+msgstr "来自 Hillaire 论文的物理准确的地球大气参数"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:589
+msgid "Mars"
+msgstr "火星"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:605
+msgid "Mars-like atmosphere: thin, dusty, yellowish sky with blue sunsets"
+msgstr "类火星大气：稀薄、多尘、偏黄的天空，日落呈蓝色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:608
+msgid "Clear Sky"
+msgstr "晴朗天空"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:622
+msgid "Crystal clear atmosphere with minimal haze"
+msgstr "清澈透明的大气，雾霭极少"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:624
+msgid "Polluted/Hazy"
+msgstr "污染/雾霾"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:639
+msgid "Heavy atmospheric haze with strong light scattering"
+msgstr "浓重的大气雾霾，光散射强烈"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:642
+msgid "Alien World"
+msgstr "外星世界"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:658
+msgid "Fictional alien atmosphere with green-tinted scattering"
+msgstr "虚构的外星大气，散射带绿色调"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:661
+msgid "Desert Planet"
+msgstr "沙漠星球"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:675
+msgid "Hot, arid world with sandy atmospheric dust"
+msgstr "炎热干旱的世界，大气中充满沙尘"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:681
+msgid "Weather Presets"
+msgstr "天气预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:690
+#, c-format
+msgid "Active weather-owned controls below show the effective blended value and are read-only. Edit them in Weather Presets."
+msgstr "下方由当前天气控制的选项显示的是实际混合后的值，且为只读。请在“天气预设”中编辑它们。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:700
+msgid "Atmosphere"
+msgstr "大气"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:707
+msgid "Air"
+msgstr "空气"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:709
+msgid "Density of air molecules"
+msgstr "空气分子密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:712 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_global_volumetrics.cpp:370
+msgid "Dust"
+msgstr "沙尘"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:714
+msgid "Density of aerosols/dust"
+msgstr "气溶胶/尘埃密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:716
+msgid "Ozone"
+msgstr "臭氧"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:717
+msgid "Density of ozone layer"
+msgstr "臭氧层密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:719
+msgid "Aerial Perspective"
+msgstr "空气透视"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:722
+msgid "Apply the atmosphere's in-scatter and extinction to scene geometry, which is what gives distant buildings and terrain their haze and desaturation - the strongest distance cue an outdoor scene has. With this off, everything past the global volumetrics froxel range renders at full saturation and contrast. Hands off to the volumetrics grid at its range so the two do not double count."
+msgstr "将大气的内散射和消光应用于场景几何体，远处的建筑和地形正是因此才呈现出雾霭感和较低的饱和度——这是户外场景中最强的距离线索。关闭后，超出全局体积效果 froxel 范围的一切都会以完全的饱和度和对比度渲染。在体积效果网格的范围边界处与其衔接，因此两者不会重复计算。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:729
+msgid "Range"
+msgstr "范围"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:732
+msgid "Depth covered by the 32-slice aerial perspective volume. Reduce for denser atmospheres to spend the slices over a shorter, more accurate range."
+msgstr "32 切片空气透视体积覆盖的深度。对于较浓的大气，可减小此值，把切片用在更短、更精确的范围内。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:735
+msgid "Near Fade Start"
+msgstr "近处淡入起点"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:739
+msgid ""
+"Distance below which this volume is not applied to a surface at all - its fogStart.\n"
+"\n"
+"The volume starts integrating at the global volumetrics handoff (20 m by default), which is the right bound for the physics but far too near to be the bound on what it may paint. Its scene shadowing is resolved on a 32x32 screen grid, so a surface just past the handoff reads a column blended from neighbours up to ~60 px away; where those look past it into sunlit air, the forward-scatter lobe lands on it as a halo bleeding through walls and terrain.\n"
+"\n"
+"Raise this if halos still reach interior geometry, lower it if near-field haze is visibly missing. Clear-air extinction over the first few hundred metres is negligible, so there is very little real haze to lose here."
+msgstr ""
+"低于此距离的表面完全不应用此体积——即它的 fogStart。\n"
+"\n"
+"该体积从全局体积效果的交接处（默认 20 m）开始积分，这对物理计算而言是正确的边界，但作为其可绘制范围的边界则太近了。其场景阴影在 32x32 的屏幕网格上解析，因此刚好位于交接处之外的表面会读取由最远约 60 px 外的相邻单元混合而成的空气柱；当这些相邻单元越过该表面看向被阳光照亮的空气时，前向散射波瓣会作为光晕落在该表面上，透过墙壁和地形渗出。\n"
+"\n"
+"如果光晕仍会出现在室内几何体上，请增大此值；如果近场雾霭明显缺失，请减小此值。晴朗空气在最初几百米内的消光可以忽略不计，因此这里损失的真实雾霭非常少。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:750
+msgid "Near Fade End"
+msgstr "近处淡入终点"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:754
+msgid "Distance at which this volume reaches full strength. Between the fade start and here it ramps in smoothly, so a receding floor or road shows no band where the volume takes over. At or below the start distance the transition becomes a hard step."
+msgstr "此体积达到完全强度时的距离。在淡入起点与此处之间平滑过渡，因此向远处延伸的地面或道路不会在体积接管处出现条带。若小于或等于起始距离，过渡将变为硬切换。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:758
+msgid "Resolution"
+msgstr "分辨率"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:762
+msgid ""
+"Screen-space resolution of this volume, on both axes.\n"
+"\n"
+"Resolves how the haze varies with view DIRECTION. Most of that is smooth, but the Mie aureole around the sun is not, and undersampling it reads as coarse banding in the haze near the sun. At 32 one texel spans roughly 60x34 px at 1080p.\n"
+"\n"
+"Cost is quadratic in this value, and arithmetic only - the bake traces no rays unless scene shadows are enabled below."
+msgstr ""
+"此体积在屏幕空间中的分辨率（两个轴相同）。\n"
+"\n"
+"决定雾霭随视线“方向”如何变化。大部分变化是平滑的，但太阳周围的米氏日晕并非如此，采样不足会在太阳附近的雾霭中表现为粗糙的色带。值为 32 时，在 1080p 下一个纹素大约覆盖 60x34 px。\n"
+"\n"
+"开销与此值成平方关系，且仅为算术运算——除非在下方启用了场景阴影，否则烘焙不会追踪任何光线。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:769
+msgid "Depth Slices"
+msgstr "深度切片数"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:773
+msgid ""
+"Depth slices in this volume.\n"
+"\n"
+"Separate from the resolution above because this axis resolves how the haze varies with DISTANCE, and the exponential slice distribution already gives every slice the same relative depth resolution - so it needs far fewer samples than the screen axes do. Cost is linear in this value."
+msgstr ""
+"此体积中的深度切片数。\n"
+"\n"
+"与上方的分辨率分开设置，因为此轴决定雾霭随“距离”如何变化，而指数切片分布已使每个切片具有相同的相对深度分辨率——因此所需的采样远少于屏幕轴。开销与此值成线性关系。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:779
+msgid "Scene Shadows"
+msgstr "场景阴影"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:782
+msgid ""
+"Trace the scene for sun occlusion of the air column this volume integrates.\n"
+"\n"
+"Off by default. This volume is applied only to pixels that hit geometry, so any shadowing of the column is clipped exactly to the occluder's silhouette - one pixel to the side the ray reaches sky, gets no aerial perspective, and so gets no darkening. It reads as the object's outline stamped on the haze rather than a shadow cast through it, and no resolution or sample count changes that.\n"
+"\n"
+"Shadow shafts belong to the global volumetrics grid, which integrates for every pixel including sky misses and so carries shadows across silhouettes without a seam. This volume begins where rtx.volumetrics.froxelMaxDistanceMeters ends, so widening that range hands more of the shadowed near field to the system that resolves it correctly."
+msgstr ""
+"追踪场景，计算此体积所积分的空气柱受到的太阳遮挡。\n"
+"\n"
+"默认关闭。此体积仅应用于命中几何体的像素，因此空气柱的任何阴影都会被精确裁剪到遮挡物的轮廓内——偏移一个像素，光线就会到达天空，不会获得空气透视，因此也不会被压暗。看起来就像物体的轮廓被印在雾霭上，而不是投射穿过雾霭的阴影，无论分辨率或采样数多高都无法改变这一点。\n"
+"\n"
+"阴影光束属于全局体积效果网格，它会对包括天空未命中在内的每个像素进行积分，因此其阴影可以无缝地跨越轮廓。此体积从 rtx.volumetrics.froxelMaxDistanceMeters 结束处开始，因此扩大该范围就能把更多处于阴影中的近场交给能够正确解析它的系统。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:787
+msgid "Shadow Range"
+msgstr "阴影范围"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:791
+msgid "How far from the camera scene geometry may shadow the column. Samples past this trace nothing and count as sunlit, which is what the air above the rooftops actually is. Raise it for scenes with occluders far larger than a kilometre; lower it to spend fewer rays."
+msgstr "距摄像机多远以内的场景几何体可以为空气柱投射阴影。超出此距离的采样不进行追踪，并视为受阳光照射，这正是屋顶上方空气的实际情况。对于遮挡物远大于一千米的场景，请增大此值；减小此值可减少光线数量。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:797
+msgid "Off (production)"
+msgstr "关闭（正式使用）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:798
+msgid "1: Force occluded (no trace)"
+msgstr "1：强制遮挡（不追踪）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:799
+msgid "2: Trace, inverted"
+msgstr "2：追踪并反转"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:801
+msgid "Scene Shadow Diagnostic"
+msgstr "场景阴影诊断"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:805
+msgid ""
+"Takes apart the ways scene shadowing can silently do nothing - they all look the same on screen otherwise.\n"
+"\n"
+"1 occludes the column without consulting the scene: the halo MUST vanish. If it does not, the constant or the dispatch is broken and the ray tracing is beside the point.\n"
+"\n"
+"2 traces and inverts: the halo must survive ONLY where a ray found geometry. A screen that stays uniformly lit means the rays are hitting nothing."
+msgstr ""
+"逐一排查场景阴影可能静默失效的各种情况——否则它们在屏幕上看起来都一样。\n"
+"\n"
+"1 不参考场景直接遮挡空气柱：光晕“必须”消失。如果没有消失，则说明常量或调度有问题，与光线追踪无关。\n"
+"\n"
+"2 追踪并反转：光晕必须“仅”在光线找到几何体的位置保留。如果整个屏幕保持均匀照亮，则说明光线没有命中任何物体。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:814
+msgid "Forward Scatter Cap"
+msgstr "前向散射上限"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:818
+msgid ""
+"Caps the Mie anisotropy the aerial perspective volume may use. The sky keeps the full Mie Anisotropy under Advanced, so this does not touch the glow around the sun itself.\n"
+"\n"
+"A strongly forward-scattering lobe is brightest looking straight into the sun, which is also where the air in front of a surface is most likely to sit in that surface's own shadow. Scene Shadows above is what removes the resulting halo; this cap is the second line of defence for the column beyond Shadow Range, where nothing is traced. Raise it toward Mie Anisotropy for a stronger sunward haze wash on distant geometry."
+msgstr ""
+"限制空气透视体积可使用的米氏各向异性。天空仍使用“高级”中完整的“米氏各向异性”，因此这不会影响太阳本身周围的辉光。\n"
+"\n"
+"强前向散射波瓣在直视太阳时最亮，而此时表面前方的空气也最有可能正处于该表面自身的阴影中。消除由此产生的光晕靠的是上方的“场景阴影”；此上限则是针对“阴影范围”以外、不进行任何追踪的空气柱的第二道防线。将其向“米氏各向异性”调高，可使远处几何体上朝向太阳方向的雾霭更强。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:831 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_global_volumetrics.cpp:473
+msgid "Planet Radius"
+msgstr "行星半径"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:832
+msgid "Atmosphere Thickness"
+msgstr "大气层厚度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:833
+msgid "Mie Anisotropy"
+msgstr "米氏各向异性"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:836
+msgid "Sun Color (Base)"
+msgstr "太阳颜色（基础）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:836
+msgid "Sun Illuminance"
+msgstr "太阳照度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:839
+msgid "Sun spectral color (Hillaire base illuminance, chromaticity)."
+msgstr "太阳光谱颜色（Hillaire 基础照度，色度）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:840
+msgid "Sun base illuminance magnitude (overall sun-power level)."
+msgstr "太阳基础照度量级（太阳整体功率水平）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:845
+msgid "Air Color (Base)"
+msgstr "空气颜色（基础）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:845
+msgid "Air Scattering Strength"
+msgstr "空气散射强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:848
+msgid "Air molecule scattering chromaticity (Rayleigh per-channel scattering coefficients). Larger blue = cooler sky."
+msgstr "空气分子散射色度（瑞利逐通道散射系数）。蓝色越大，天空越偏冷色调。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:850
+msgid "Air scattering magnitude. Higher = more atmospheric scattering overall."
+msgstr "空气散射量级。值越高，整体大气散射越多。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:855
+msgid "Dust Color (Base)"
+msgstr "尘埃颜色（基础）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:855
+msgid "Dust Scattering Strength"
+msgstr "尘埃散射强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:858
+msgid "Aerosol / dust scattering chromaticity (Mie per-channel coefficients)."
+msgstr "气溶胶/尘埃散射色度（米氏逐通道系数）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:859
+msgid "Dust scattering magnitude. Higher = hazier atmosphere."
+msgstr "尘埃散射量级。值越高，大气越朦胧。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:863
+msgid "Dust Absorption Strength"
+msgstr "尘埃吸收强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:863
+msgid "Dust Absorption Tint (Base)"
+msgstr "尘埃吸收染色（基础）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:866
+msgid "Aerosol / dust ABSORPTION chromaticity. Aerosols absorb as well as scatter, and this is the half that darkens rather than brightens. Tinting it is what makes dust brown-and-dim or smoke grey-and-dark instead of merely denser; a blue-weighted absorption is what inverts a Mars-like sky and its sunsets."
+msgstr "气溶胶/尘埃的“吸收”色度。气溶胶既会散射也会吸收，而吸收是使其变暗而非变亮的那一半。为其染色，正是让尘埃呈现昏暗的棕色、让烟雾呈现深灰色而不只是变得更浓的关键；偏蓝的吸收则会使类火星的天空及其日落颜色反转。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:870
+msgid "Dust absorption magnitude. Raise relative to Dust Scattering Strength to darken haze as it thickens; Earth's aerosols sit at roughly 4.4e-3 /km, comparable to their scattering."
+msgstr "尘埃吸收量级。相对于“尘埃散射强度”增大此值，可使雾霭在变浓时变暗；地球气溶胶约为 4.4e-3 /km，与其散射相当。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:875
+msgid "Ozone Absorption Strength"
+msgstr "臭氧吸收强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:875
+msgid "Ozone Tint (Base)"
+msgstr "臭氧染色（基础）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:878
+msgid "Ozone absorption chromaticity (per-channel coefficients). Affects twilight color and high-altitude tint."
+msgstr "臭氧吸收色度（逐通道系数）。影响暮光颜色和高空色调。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:880
+msgid "Ozone absorption magnitude."
+msgstr "臭氧吸收量级。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:882
+msgid "Ozone Layer Altitude"
+msgstr "臭氧层高度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:883
+msgid "Ozone Layer Width"
+msgstr "臭氧层宽度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:885
+msgid "Half-width of the ozone tent profile, and therefore the vertical ozone column in km (the paper uses a 30 km wide tent, so 15)."
+msgstr "臭氧帐篷形分布的半宽，从而决定垂直臭氧柱 (km)（论文使用 30 km 宽的帐篷形分布，因此为 15）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:888
+msgid "Multiscatter Physical Strength"
+msgstr "多重散射物理强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:890
+msgid "0 = artistic multiscattering (analytical inline fit; preset color stays faithful, easy to style). 1 = physical multiscattering (the Hillaire EGSR 2020 Psi_ms LUT: second-order scattering plus the 1/(1-f_ms) series for every higher order, with the ground bounce evaluated in-march. Its colour is derived from the atmosphere's composition rather than assumed, so it is harder to art-direct but correct). Intermediate values blend."
+msgstr "0 = 艺术化多重散射（内联解析拟合；预设颜色保持原样，易于风格化）。1 = 物理多重散射（Hillaire EGSR 2020 的 Psi_ms LUT：二阶散射加上用于所有更高阶的 1/(1-f_ms) 级数，并在步进中计算地面反弹。其颜色由大气成分推导而来而非假定，因此较难进行艺术调整，但结果正确）。中间值则进行混合。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:899
+msgid "Multiscatter Strength"
+msgstr "多重散射强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:901
+msgid "Global scale on the multiscattering 'fill' term. The physical model adds a broadband (pale-blue) multiscatter term that desaturates warm sunset color. Lower (e.g. 0.3-0.6) to let warm single-scatter dominate for a punchier sunset; 1.0 = physical. Feeds the sky-view LUT, so clouds inherit it."
+msgstr "对多重散射“填充”项的全局缩放。物理模型会加入一个宽频（淡蓝色）多重散射项，降低温暖日落色彩的饱和度。降低此值（例如 0.3-0.6）可让温暖的单次散射占主导，使日落更鲜明；1.0 = 物理值。此值会输入天空视图 LUT，因此云也会继承它。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:905
+msgid "Sunset Saturation"
+msgstr "日落饱和度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:907
+msgid "Saturation boost on sky radiance, ramped in only as the sun nears the horizon (midday sky untouched). >1 amplifies the warm horizon hues the physical model renders accurately but undersaturated; 1.0 = no change. Feeds the sky-view LUT, so clouds inherit the warmer ambient."
+msgstr "对天空辐射度的饱和度增强，仅在太阳接近地平线时逐渐生效（正午天空不受影响）。>1 会增强物理模型渲染准确但饱和度不足的温暖地平线色调；1.0 = 不变。此值会输入天空视图 LUT，因此云也会继承更温暖的环境光。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:912
+msgid "Sky Indirect Scale"
+msgstr "天空间接光缩放"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:916
+msgid "Multiplier for sky radiance gathered by diffuse indirect bounces only. 1.0 = physical. Raise it to brighten diffuse sky fill (the distant-light sun out-radiates the sky, so indirect lighting reads dull). Sky seen via reflection, refraction, alpha-cutout, or the primary view stays at physical brightness, so reflections keep matching the visible sky."
+msgstr "仅作用于漫反射间接反弹所收集的天空辐射度的倍数。1.0 = 物理值。增大此值可提亮漫反射天空补光（作为远距离光源的太阳辐射度高于天空，因此间接光照看起来较暗淡）。通过反射、折射、Alpha 镂空或主视图看到的天空保持物理亮度，因此反射始终与可见天空一致。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:942
+msgid "Night Sky"
+msgstr "夜空"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:944
+msgid "Night Sky Brightness"
+msgstr "夜空亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:947
+msgid "Airglow / ambient night-sky brightness."
+msgstr "气辉/夜空环境亮度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:949
+msgid "Night Sky Color"
+msgstr "夜空颜色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:952
+msgid "Tint of the ambient night-sky / airglow contribution. Magnitude is set by Night Sky Brightness above."
+msgstr "夜空环境光/气辉贡献的染色。强度由上方的“夜空亮度”设置。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:962
+msgid "Moons"
+msgstr "月亮"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:981
+msgid "Clouds"
+msgstr "云"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:982
+msgid "Enable Clouds"
+msgstr "启用云"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:990
+msgid "Basic"
+msgstr "基础"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:992
+msgid "Coverage"
+msgstr "云量"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:996
+msgid "How much of the sky has clouds. 0 = clear, 1 = overcast."
+msgstr "天空中云的覆盖程度。0 = 晴朗，1 = 阴天。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:998
+msgid "Cloud Type"
+msgstr "云类型"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1002
+msgid "Erosion character of the clouds: 0 = wispy / stratiform carving, 1 = billowy cumulus lumps. (Under the Nubis3 SDF model, vertical cloud shape comes from the baked bodies - this styles how they are carved, it no longer re-profiles stratus -> cumulus.)"
+msgstr "云的侵蚀特征：0 = 丝缕状/层状雕刻，1 = 团簇状积云团块。（在 Nubis3 SDF 模型下，云的垂直形状来自烘焙的云体——此项决定云体的雕刻风格，不再将层云 -> 积云重新塑形。）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1008
+msgid "Density"
+msgstr "密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1012
+msgid "Cloud opacity. Higher = thicker / darker clouds."
+msgstr "云的不透明度。值越高，云越厚/越暗。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1013
+msgid "Altitude"
+msgstr "高度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1016
+msgid "Cloud layer altitude (km above the ground)."
+msgstr "云层高度（距地面的千米数）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1018
+msgid "Depth"
+msgstr "厚度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1022
+msgid "Vertical depth of the cloud layer in km."
+msgstr "云层的垂直厚度 (km)。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1027
+msgid "Base cloud albedo (RGB). Click the swatch for a color picker."
+msgstr "云的基础反照率 (RGB)。点击色块可打开取色器。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1041
+msgid "Shape"
+msgstr "形状"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1042
+msgid "Shape Variety"
+msgstr "形状多样性"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1045
+msgid "Mid-frequency (~2.4 km) push/pull of the whole body surface — lobes, notches and full splits that break round singular blobs into varied cloud clusters (the GT7 mid-band role). Live, no rebake. Higher costs some empty-space-skip perf."
+msgstr "对整个云体表面进行中频（约 2.4 km）推/拉——形成凸瓣、缺口乃至完全分裂，把圆而单一的团块打散成形态各异的云簇（相当于 GT7 中频段的作用）。实时生效，无需重新烘焙。值越高，空白区域跳过优化的性能损失越多。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1049
+msgid "Lighting LOD"
+msgstr "光照 LOD"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1052
+msgid "Skips the expensive Sun Shadow (Near) refinement and the moon shadow march on samples that barely reach the pixel — weight = view transmittance x aerial haze x the sample's own opacity. Recovers most of Sun Shadow (Near)'s cost while keeping the lobe shading where it is actually visible. Raise until crevice contrast or edges visibly soften, then back off. 0 = off."
+msgstr "对几乎不影响像素的采样，跳过开销较大的“太阳阴影（近处）”精细计算和月光阴影步进——权重 = 视线透射率 x 空气雾霭 x 采样自身的不透明度。可节省“太阳阴影（近处）”的大部分开销，同时在真正可见的地方保留波瓣着色。请逐渐增大此值，直到缝隙对比度或边缘明显变柔和，然后再调回一些。0 = 关闭。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1058
+msgid "Edge Wisp Cut"
+msgstr "边缘丝缕切割"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1061
+msgid "Extra erosion shaped by the wispy noise, concentrated at the silhouette — cuts trailing wisp shapes out of cloud edges. Billowy cores keep rounded edges. 0 = off."
+msgstr "由丝缕噪声塑造的额外侵蚀，集中在轮廓处——从云的边缘切出拖尾的丝缕形状。团簇状的核心保持圆润的边缘。0 = 关闭。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1064
+msgid "Erosion Strength"
+msgstr "侵蚀强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1067
+msgid "Wispy/billowy erosion of the body profile. 0 = smooth SDF blobs; 1 = paper-faithful; higher = ragged carved clouds."
+msgstr "对云体剖面的丝缕状/团簇状侵蚀。0 = 平滑的 SDF 团块；1 = 忠实于论文；更高 = 参差不齐、被雕刻的云。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1069
+msgid "Body Erosion"
+msgstr "云体侵蚀"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1072
+msgid "3D noise carve baked into the cloud BODIES (the anti-blobby body lever): shifts the placement waterline per voxel so columns bake in overhangs, notches and lumps instead of convex blobs. 0 = smooth bodies. Re-bakes the SDF on change (amortized, ~6 frames)."
+msgstr "烘焙进云“体”的 3D 噪声雕刻（避免云体呈团块状的调节项）：逐体素移动放置水位线，使柱状云体烘焙出悬垂、缺口和凸块，而不是凸形团块。0 = 平滑的云体。更改后会重新烘焙 SDF（分摊进行，约 6 帧）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1077
+msgid "Cloud Cell Size"
+msgstr "云团尺寸"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1080
+msgid "Average footprint of a cloud cluster in km. Smaller = many small clouds; larger = fewer, broader cloud banks. Re-bakes the placement map live on change."
+msgstr "云团的平均占地尺寸 (km)。值越小，小块云越多；值越大，云带越少越宽。更改后会实时重新烘焙放置图。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1083
+msgid "Profile Depth"
+msgstr "剖面深度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1086
+msgid "Depth into the body over which the dimensional profile ramps 0 -> 1. Small = hard-shelled dense clouds; large = soft translucent edges."
+msgstr "维度剖面从 0 -> 1 过渡所跨越的云体内部深度。值小 = 外壳坚硬的致密云；值大 = 柔和的半透明边缘。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1110
+msgid "Detail Shading"
+msgstr "细节着色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1113
+msgid "Shades the carved detail: grown knuckles brighten, carved crevices darken, so the detail reads INSIDE the cloud body instead of only at the silhouette. Silver linings are exempt. 0 = off (smooth legacy shading)."
+msgstr "为雕刻出的细节着色：生长出的凸起变亮，雕刻出的缝隙变暗，使细节在云体“内部”也能体现，而不仅在轮廓处。银边不受影响。0 = 关闭（旧版平滑着色）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1121
+msgid "Forward Scatter"
+msgstr "前向散射"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1124
+msgid "Strength of the silver-lining glow when looking toward the sun. Higher = sharper rim of bright light around backlit clouds."
+msgstr "朝向太阳看时银边辉光的强度。值越高，逆光云周围的亮边越锐利。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1129
+msgid "Multi-Scatter"
+msgstr "多重散射"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1132
+msgid "Extinction scale on the multi-scatter body lobe. 1.0 = Nubis Cubed paper baseline; HIGHER = darker sun-shadowed bulk (more shading contrast), LOWER = brighter, flatter body fill. (Tooltip direction fixed 2026-07-14.)"
+msgstr "多重散射云体波瓣的消光缩放。1.0 = Nubis Cubed 论文基准；“更高” = 处于太阳阴影中的云体更暗（明暗对比更强），“更低” = 云体填充更亮、更平。（提示中的方向已于 2026-07-14 修正。）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1137
+msgid "Ground Shadow"
+msgstr "地面阴影"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1141
+msgid "How strongly clouds cast shadows on terrain. 0 = no cloud shadows, 1 = full voxel-grid cumulus-shaped shadow patches."
+msgstr "云在地形上投射阴影的强度。0 = 无云影，1 = 完整的体素网格积云形阴影斑块。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1144
+msgid "Bottom Darkening"
+msgstr "底部变暗"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1148
+msgid "Overall strength of the cloud-underside darkening. Scales the analytic per-column light field on the multi-scatter and ambient terms; the direct sun beam (silver lining) is unaffected. Strongest with the sun overhead and fades out toward the horizon, where the low sun lights the bases directly (sunset glow). 0 = uniformly lit (paper baseline). The falloff SHAPE is the conf-only cloudUndersideLightSigma (per-preset: Weather > Clouds > Lighting > Underside Shading)."
+msgstr "云底变暗的整体强度。缩放多重散射和环境光项上的解析逐柱光场；直射阳光光束（银边）不受影响。太阳位于头顶时最强，并向地平线方向逐渐减弱——此时低角度的太阳直接照亮云底（日落辉光）。0 = 均匀照亮（论文基准）。衰减的“形状”由仅能在 conf 中设置的 cloudUndersideLightSigma 决定（按预设：天气 > 云 > 光照 > 底面着色）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1158
+msgid "Ambient Shadowing"
+msgstr "环境光阴影"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1161
+msgid "How much sun-shadow depth darkens the cloud's ambient fill. The sky-ambient otherwise refloods shaded bulk with bright daytime sky, flattening the cloud; with this, shadowed cores fall toward dark grey while sunlit faces and silver linings keep their full ambient - the dramatic high-contrast cumulus read. Sky Fill is exempt (it is the underside floor). 0 = off (flat legacy ambient)."
+msgstr "太阳阴影深度使云的环境补光变暗的程度。否则天空环境光会用明亮的白天天光重新填满处于阴影中的云体，使云看起来扁平；启用后，处于阴影中的核心会趋向深灰色，而受阳光照射的面和银边保留完整的环境光——呈现戏剧化的高对比度积云效果。“天空补光”不受影响（它是云底的基础亮度）。0 = 关闭（旧版平坦环境光）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1168
+msgid "Sky Fill"
+msgstr "天空补光"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1171
+msgid "How strongly cloud undersides pick up the open sky around them. Adds the overhead sky color as fill light that bypasses Bottom Darkening (skylight reaches the base from below/around, not through the cloud), so a bright daytime sky lifts gloomy undersides and tints them with the real sky color. Fades on its own at sunset. Higher = brighter, more sky-colored bases; 0 = undersides ignore the open sky."
+msgstr "云底从周围开阔天空获取光照的程度。将头顶天空的颜色作为补光加入，并绕过“底部变暗”（天光从下方/周围到达云底，而不是穿过云层），因此明亮的白天天空会提亮阴沉的云底，并以真实的天空颜色为其染色。日落时会自动减弱。值越高，云底越亮、越接近天空颜色；0 = 云底忽略开阔天空。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1191
+msgid "Cloud Motion"
+msgstr "云的运动"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1192
+msgid "Wind Speed"
+msgstr "风速"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1196
+msgid "How fast the whole cloud field drifts across the sky (m/s). Real decks drift ~5-30 m/s. (Stored as km/s in the conf.)"
+msgstr "整个云场在天空中漂移的速度 (m/s)。真实云层的漂移速度约为 5-30 m/s。（在 conf 中以 km/s 存储。）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1199
+msgid "Wind Direction"
+msgstr "风向"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1203
+msgid "Compass direction the wind blows toward in degrees. 0 = +X, 90 = +Z."
+msgstr "风吹向的罗盘方向（单位：度）。0 = +X，90 = +Z。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1208
+msgid "Morph Speed"
+msgstr "变形速度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1211
+msgid "How fast the carved cloud detail churns in place (m/s), decorrelated from wind. Under the Nubis3 SDF model the cloud BODIES change only on amortized re-bakes - this animates the erosion / edge detail, not whole formations. 0 = detail frozen. (Stored as km/s in the conf.)"
+msgstr "雕刻出的云细节原地翻涌的速度 (m/s)，与风去相关。在 Nubis3 SDF 模型下，云“体”只会在分摊的重新烘焙时改变——此项驱动的是侵蚀/边缘细节的动画，而不是整个云团。0 = 细节冻结。（在 conf 中以 km/s 存储。）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1224
+#, c-format
+msgid "Slow weather-scale wind/coverage wander: Weather -> Weather Variation"
+msgstr "缓慢的天气尺度风/云量漂移：天气 -> 天气变化"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1232
+msgid "Lightning"
+msgstr "闪电"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1233
+msgid "Enable Lightning"
+msgstr "启用闪电"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1235
+msgid "Master switch (on by default). Lightning only actually fires when Strikes Per Minute > 0 - raised automatically by storm weather presets. Uncheck to mute lightning everywhere, storm presets included."
+msgstr "总开关（默认开启）。只有当“每分钟闪电次数”> 0 时才会真正产生闪电——风暴天气预设会自动提高该值。取消勾选可在所有地方屏蔽闪电，包括风暴预设。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1240
+msgid "Test Strike"
+msgstr "测试闪电"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1244
+msgid "Fire one strike right now (requires Enable Lightning; works at 0 strikes/min). Handy for tuning intensities without waiting on the random schedule."
+msgstr "立即触发一次闪电（需要勾选“启用闪电”；在 0 次/分钟时也有效）。便于调整强度，无需等待随机触发。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1248
+msgid "Strikes Per Minute"
+msgstr "每分钟闪电次数"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1252
+msgid "Mean strike rate. Gaps are randomized so strikes cluster and lull like a real storm. 0 = no automatic strikes. The weather presets drive this while active (thunderstorm 12, rainstorm 4) - manual edits will be overridden during a preset blend."
+msgstr "平均闪电频率。间隔是随机的，因此闪电会像真实风暴一样密集出现或暂歇。0 = 无自动闪电。天气预设启用时会驱动此值（雷暴 12，暴雨 4）——预设混合期间，手动修改将被覆盖。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1256
+msgid "Cloud Flash Brightness"
+msgstr "云层闪光亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1259
+msgid "Radiance of the glow inside the cloud deck. The flash competes with direct sunlight - day storms need much more than night ones."
+msgstr "云层内部辉光的辐射度。闪光会与直射阳光相互竞争——白天的风暴所需的值比夜间大得多。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1262
+msgid "Scene Flash Brightness"
+msgstr "场景闪光亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1265
+msgid "Radiance of the transient light that flashes the ground / scene, independent of the in-cloud glow. 0 = cloud-only lightning."
+msgstr "照亮地面/场景的瞬时光源的辐射度，与云内辉光无关。0 = 仅云内闪电。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1268
+msgid "Max Strike Distance"
+msgstr "最大闪电距离"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1271
+msgid "How far from the camera strikes may land. Distant strikes read as horizon sheet-lightning; near ones light the ground hard."
+msgstr "闪电可落在距摄像机多远的位置。远处的闪电看起来像地平线上的片状闪电；近处的闪电会强烈照亮地面。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1274
+msgid "Flash Color"
+msgstr "闪光颜色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1276
+msgid "Flash tint for both the in-cloud glow and the scene flash. Default is a cool blue-white."
+msgstr "云内辉光和场景闪光共用的闪光染色。默认为冷蓝白色。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1281
+msgid "Layer 2"
+msgstr "第 2 层"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1282
+msgid "Enable Layer 2"
+msgstr "启用第 2 层"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1285
+msgid "Adds a second high-altitude cloud deck on top of the main layer. Off by default. Voxel-grid terrain shadows still come from layer 1 only."
+msgstr "在主云层上方添加第二个高空云层。默认关闭。体素网格地形阴影仍只来自第 1 层。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1289
+msgid "Layer 2 Altitude"
+msgstr "第 2 层高度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1292
+msgid "Layer-2 altitude in km. Default 7.5 km targets the cirrus band."
+msgstr "第 2 层的高度 (km)。默认 7.5 km，对应卷云所在的高度带。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1293
+msgid "Layer 2 Depth"
+msgstr "第 2 层厚度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1296
+msgid "Vertical depth of the layer-2 slab. Cirrus is thin - default 0.5 km."
+msgstr "第 2 层云层板的垂直厚度。卷云很薄——默认 0.5 km。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1297
+msgid "Layer 2 Coverage"
+msgstr "第 2 层云量"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1300
+msgid "How much of the sky has layer-2 clouds. Defaults sparser than layer 1 so cirrus reads as patches, not overcast."
+msgstr "天空中第 2 层云的覆盖程度。默认比第 1 层更稀疏，使卷云呈现为斑块，而不是阴天。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1302
+msgid "Layer 2 Cloud Type"
+msgstr "第 2 层云类型"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1305
+msgid "Cloud type for layer 2. Low values (~0.05) read as stratiform wisps - appropriate for cirrus."
+msgstr "第 2 层的云类型。较低的值（~0.05）呈现为层状丝缕——适合卷云。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1309
+msgid "Layer 2 Density"
+msgstr "第 2 层密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1312
+msgid "Per-step density multiplier for layer 2 only. Lower values keep the echo deck from competing with the main cumulus deck."
+msgstr "仅用于第 2 层的每步密度倍数。较低的值可避免回声云层与主积云层相互竞争。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1317
+msgid "Layer 2 Color"
+msgstr "第 2 层颜色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1319
+msgid "Base color (albedo) of the echo deck, independent of the main cloud Color. Defaults to the same near-white; tint it to differentiate the upper deck. All other look knobs stay shared with layer 1."
+msgstr "回声云层的基础颜色（反照率），独立于主云层的“颜色”。默认使用相同的近白色；可为其染色以区分上层云。所有其他外观调节项仍与第 1 层共用。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1328
+msgid "Fast Cloud Reflections"
+msgstr "快速云反射"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1330
+msgid "Reflections and indirect light sample a small per-frame cloud lookup table instead of re-marching the cloud volume per ray. Large performance win on cloudy skies; reflected clouds also match the main sky exactly. Uncheck to restore the legacy per-ray cloud march for comparison."
+msgstr "反射和间接光采样每帧生成的小型云查找表，而不是逐光线重新步进云体积。在多云天空下能大幅提升性能；反射中的云也与主天空完全一致。取消勾选可恢复旧版的逐光线云步进以作对比。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1335
+msgid "Cloud Render Scale"
+msgstr "云渲染缩放"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1338
+msgid "Resolution of the cloud render relative to the internal render resolution. 0.5 = quarter the pixels (~4x cheaper clouds, slightly softer); 1.0 = native (legacy). Applies live."
+msgstr "云渲染相对于内部渲染分辨率的分辨率。0.5 = 像素数为四分之一（云的开销约为原来的 1/4，略微变柔和）；1.0 = 原生（旧版）。实时生效。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1341
+msgid "Temporal Smoothing"
+msgstr "时域平滑"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1344
+msgid "EMA history weight of the cloud temporal smoother. Higher = smoother but softer/smearier clouds that respond slowly; lower = crisper detail with more visible per-frame jitter. 0 = raw jittered march (no temporal blend). 0.92 = previous hardcoded behavior. Applies live."
+msgstr "云时域平滑器的 EMA 历史权重。值越高，云越平滑，但会更柔和/更模糊，且响应较慢；值越低，细节越清晰，但每帧抖动更明显。0 = 原始的抖动步进（无时域混合）。0.92 = 以前硬编码的行为。实时生效。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1349
+msgid "Cloud Sample Spacing"
+msgstr "云采样间距"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1352
+msgid ""
+"Distance between cloud samples along each view ray, in km. This is the fix for the horizontal banding near the horizon: sightlines there cross 50+ km of cloud layer, and the old fixed 32-sample march spaced samples too far apart to resolve the clouds.\n"
+"\n"
+"PERFORMANCE: cost scales with how many samples a ray needs -- overhead sightlines are unchanged, but horizon-heavy views can take up to Max Cloud Samples / 32 times the cloud cost (2x at the defaults). Raise the spacing or lower Max Cloud Samples to claw the cost back, or set 0 to restore the legacy fixed march (banding returns). Cloud Render Scale above also directly offsets this cost. Applies live."
+msgstr ""
+"沿每条视线的云采样间距 (km)。这是对地平线附近水平条带的修复：那里的视线会穿过 50 km 以上的云层，而旧版固定 32 次采样的步进采样间距过大，无法解析云。\n"
+"\n"
+"性能：开销随光线所需的采样数增长——俯视视线不受影响，但以地平线为主的视角最多可使云的开销增加到“最大云采样数”/ 32 倍（默认设置下为 2 倍）。增大间距或降低“最大云采样数”可降低开销，或设为 0 以恢复旧版固定步进（条带会重新出现）。上方的“云渲染缩放”也能直接抵消这部分开销。实时生效。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1364
+msgid "Max Cloud Samples"
+msgstr "最大云采样数"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere_ui.cpp:1367
+msgid "Hard cap on cloud samples per ray -- the performance governor for Cloud Sample Spacing. 64 resolves the default spacing out to ~6 km of cloud span; lower values cost less but let a little banding back in at the far horizon. 32 = legacy cost ceiling. Applies live."
+msgstr "每条光线云采样数的硬上限——这是“云采样间距”的性能调节器。64 可在默认间距下解析约 6 km 的云层跨度；更低的值开销更小，但会让远处地平线重新出现少许条带。32 = 旧版开销上限。实时生效。"
+
