+#. option rtx.particles.enable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:203
+msgid "Enables particle simulation and rendering."
+msgstr "启用粒子的模拟和渲染。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.enableSpawning
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:204
+msgid "Controls whether or not any particle system can currently spawn new particles."
+msgstr "控制当前是否允许任何粒子系统生成新粒子。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.enableDiscontinuityGuard
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:207
+msgid "ON: when an emitter's one-frame motion deviates from a moving average of its recent velocity (swap / teleport / loop restart), collapse the spawn prev transform to the current one to kill the spawn ghost trail. This may fix bugs where particles seems to blur across large distances for one frame. Option may be removed when instance tracking becomes more reliable."
+msgstr "开启：当发射器单帧的运动偏离其近期速度的移动平均值时（交换/传送/循环重启），将生成时的上一帧变换折叠为当前变换，以消除生成重影拖尾。这可能会修复粒子在一帧内跨越很远距离模糊的错误。当实例追踪变得更可靠时，此选项可能会被移除。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.discontinuityFactor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:208
+msgid "Multiplier on an emitter's recent velocity (plus the floor) above which a one-frame deviation is treated as a discontinuity (swap / teleport), collapsing the spawn context's prev transform to the current one. Higher = more tolerant before snapping. Only used when rtx.particles.enableDiscontinuityGuard is ON."
+msgstr "发射器近期速度（加上下限）的倍数，单帧偏差超过该值时即被视为不连续（交换/传送），并将生成上下文的上一帧变换折叠为当前变换。值越高，在对齐前的容忍度越高。仅在 rtx.particles.enableDiscontinuityGuard 开启时使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.discontinuityFloor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:209
+msgid "Minimum per-frame motion added to the emitter's recent speed when forming the discontinuity threshold. Suppresses false snaps from jitter on a near-stationary emitter. This value is multiplied by rtx.sceneScale (rendering units of 1cm per game unit, default 1). Only used when rtx.particles.enableDiscontinuityGuard is ON."
+msgstr "构成不连续阈值时，加到发射器近期速度上的每帧最小运动量。可抑制近乎静止的发射器因抖动而产生的错误对齐。此值会乘以 rtx.sceneScale（每游戏单位对应的 1cm 渲染单位数，默认为 1）。仅在 rtx.particles.enableDiscontinuityGuard 开启时使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.spawnRatePerSecond
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:211
+msgid "Number of particles (per system) to spawn per second on average."
+msgstr "平均每秒生成的粒子数（每个系统）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.spawnBurstDuration
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:212
+msgid "Number of seconds between particle spawning bursts.  For a value of 0, we assume continuous spawning, for all values greater than 0 we expect particles to be spawned in bursts.  This value will still respect the spawn rate per second parameter and the max particle parameter."
+msgstr "粒子爆发生成之间的间隔秒数。值为 0 时视为连续生成；所有大于 0 的值都表示粒子以爆发方式生成。此值仍会遵循每秒生成速率参数和最大粒子数参数。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.numberOfParticlesPerMaterial
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:213
+msgid "Maximum number of particles to simulate per material simultaneously.  There is a performance consideration, lower numbers are more performant.  Ideal is to tune this number for your specific needs."
+msgstr "每个材质同时模拟的最大粒子数。需要考虑性能，数值越低性能越好。最好根据具体需求调整此数值。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:219
+msgid "*DEPRECATED* this setting has been removed in favor of maxSpawnVelocity and maxTargetVelocity."
+msgstr "*已弃用* 此设置已被移除，改用 maxSpawnVelocity 和 maxTargetVelocity。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.minSpawnSize
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:221
+msgid "Minimum size (in centimeters) to give to a particle when spawned."
+msgstr "粒子生成时赋予的最小尺寸（厘米）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxSpawnSize
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:222
+msgid "Maximum size (in centimeters) to give to a particle when spawned."
+msgstr "粒子生成时赋予的最大尺寸（厘米）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.minSpawnRotationSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:223
+msgid "Minimum rotation speed (in revolutions per second) to give to a particle when spawned."
+msgstr "粒子生成时赋予的最小旋转速度（每秒转数）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxSpawnRotationSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:224
+msgid "Maximum rotation speed (in revolutions per second) to give to a particle when spawned."
+msgstr "粒子生成时赋予的最大旋转速度（每秒转数）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.minSpawnColor
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxSpawnColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:225 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:226
+msgid "Minimum range of the color to tint a particle with when spawned."
+msgstr "粒子生成时用于染色的颜色范围最小值。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.minTargetSize
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:228
+msgid "Minimum size (in centimeters) picked from a range, to be used as the target animation state, at the end of the particles life."
+msgstr "从范围中选取的最小尺寸（厘米），用作粒子生命结束时的目标动画状态。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxTargetSize
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:229
+msgid "Maximum size (in centimeters) picked from a range, to be used as the target animation state, at the end of the particles life."
+msgstr "从范围中选取的最大尺寸（厘米），用作粒子生命结束时的目标动画状态。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.minTargetRotationSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:230
+msgid "Minimum rotation speed (in revolutions per second) picked from a range, to be used as the target animation state, at the end of the particles life.  Only used if alignParticlesToVelocity is false."
+msgstr "从范围中选取的最小旋转速度（每秒转数），用作粒子生命结束时的目标动画状态。仅在 alignParticlesToVelocity 为 false 时使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxTargetRotationSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:231
+msgid "Maximum rotation speed (in revolutions per second) picked from a range, to be used as the target animation state, at the end of the particles life.  Only used if alignParticlesToVelocity is false."
+msgstr "从范围中选取的最大旋转速度（每秒转数），用作粒子生命结束时的目标动画状态。仅在 alignParticlesToVelocity 为 false 时使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.minTargetColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:232
+msgid "Minimum RGBA color picked from a range, to be used as the target animation state, at the end of the particles life."
+msgstr "从范围中选取的最小 RGBA 颜色，用作粒子生命结束时的目标动画状态。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxTargetColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:233
+msgid "Maximum RGBA color picked from a range, to be used as the target animation state, at the end of the particles life."
+msgstr "从范围中选取的最大 RGBA 颜色，用作粒子生命结束时的目标动画状态。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.initialVelocityFromMotion
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:235
+msgid "Multiplier for initial velocity applied at spawn time, based on the spawning objects current velocity."
+msgstr "生成时应用的初始速度倍数，基于生成物体的当前速度。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.initialVelocityFromNormal
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:236
+msgid "Initial speed to apply on spawn (centimeters per sec) along the normal vector of the spawning triangle."
+msgstr "生成时沿生成三角形法线方向施加的初始速度（厘米/秒）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.initialVelocityConeAngleDegrees
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:237
+msgid "Specifies the half angle, in degrees, of the random emission cone  around the triangles surface normal when spawning a new particle.  A value in the range of 0 to 180 degrees is expected."
+msgstr "指定生成新粒子时，围绕三角形表面法线的随机发射锥体的半角（单位：度）。取值应在 0 到 180 度之间。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.gravityForce
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:238
+msgid "Net influence of gravity acting on each particle (centimeters per second squared)."
+msgstr "作用于每个粒子的重力净影响（厘米每二次方秒）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxSpawnVelocity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:239
+msgid "Maximum velocity of a particle in world space (in centimeters per second) to be used at spawn time.  Negative values imply unlimited."
+msgstr "生成时使用的粒子在世界空间中的最大速度（厘米/秒）。负值表示无限制。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.maxTargetVelocity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:240
+msgid "Maximum velocity of a particle in world space (in centimeters per second) at a particles end of life.  Negative values imply unlimited."
+msgstr "粒子生命结束时在世界空间中的最大速度（厘米/秒）。负值表示无限制。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.useSpawnTexcoords
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:241
+msgid "Use the texture coordinates of the emitter mesh when spawning particles."
+msgstr "生成粒子时使用发射器网格的纹理坐标。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.alignParticlesToVelocity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:242
+msgid "Rotates the particles such that they are always aligned with their direction of travel, in this mode we ignore rotation speed."
+msgstr "旋转粒子，使其始终与运动方向对齐，在此模式下会忽略旋转速度。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.enableCollisionDetection
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:243
+msgid "Enables particle collisions with the world."
+msgstr "启用粒子与世界的碰撞。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.collisionRestitution
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:244
+msgid "The fraction of velocity retained after a collision with scene geometry. 1.0 = perfectly elastic (no speed loss), 0.0 = completely inelastic (velocity zeroed). Values outside [0,1] will be clamped to this range."
+msgstr "与场景几何体碰撞后保留的速度比例。1.0 = 完全弹性（无速度损失），0.0 = 完全非弹性（速度归零）。超出 [0,1] 的值将被钳制到此范围内。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.collisionThickness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:245
+msgid "The maximum penetration depth (in centimeters) at which a particle will still collide with geometry.  Particles that penetrate deeper than this value are considered to have passed through thin objects and will not collide."
+msgstr "粒子仍会与几何体碰撞的最大穿透深度（厘米）。穿透深度超过此值的粒子被视为已穿过薄物体，不会发生碰撞。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.turbulenceForce
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:247
+msgid "How much turbulence influences the velocity of a particle as an external force (represented in centimeters per second squared)."
+msgstr "湍流作为外力对粒子速度的影响程度（以厘米每二次方秒表示）。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.turbulenceFrequency
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:248
+msgid "Frequency (rate of change) of the turbulence forces. Lower values change slowly; higher values change rapidly.  This is specified in centimeters."
+msgstr "湍流力的频率（变化速率）。较低的值变化缓慢；较高的值变化迅速。以厘米为单位指定。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.enableMotionTrail
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:249
+msgid "Elongates the particle with respect to velocity, texture edges are preserved, with only the center being stretched which provides a motion blur like effect on the particles themselves.  This will automatically align particles rotation with their individual velocity (similar to rtx.particles.globalPreset.alignParticlesToVelocity) and so rotation parameters are no longer taken into account when this setting is enabled."
+msgstr "根据速度拉长粒子，保留纹理边缘，只拉伸中心部分，从而在粒子自身上产生类似动态模糊的效果。这会自动将粒子的旋转与其各自的速度对齐（类似于 rtx.particles.globalPreset.alignParticlesToVelocity），因此启用此设置后将不再考虑旋转参数。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.motionTrailMultiplier
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:250
+msgid "When enableMotionTrail is set to enabled, this value can be used to increase (or decrease) the length of the tail artificially, which is determined by the velocity.  A value of 1 (the default) will ensure each particle is the exact size of the motion over the previous frame.  Values greater than 1 will increase that size linearly.  Likewise for smaller than 1.  0 and below is an invalid value."
+msgstr "当 enableMotionTrail 设为启用时，可使用此值人为地增加（或减少）由速度决定的拖尾长度。值为 1（默认）时，每个粒子的大小恰好等于上一帧的运动量。大于 1 的值会线性增加该大小，小于 1 的值同理会线性减小。0 及以下为无效值。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.billboardType
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:251
+msgid "Billboard type to use for the global particle preset."
+msgstr "全局粒子预设使用的公告板类型。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.spriteSheetMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:252
+msgid "Sprite sheet mode to use for generating particle UVs.  Options are, 0: Prefer material sprite sheet parameters - 1: Animate spritesheet with respect to the lifetime of the particle - 2: Pick a random sprite from the sheet per particle to use as the texture."
+msgstr "生成粒子 UV 时使用的精灵表模式。选项为：0：优先使用材质的精灵表参数 - 1：根据粒子的生命周期播放精灵表动画 - 2：为每个粒子从精灵表中随机选取一个精灵作为纹理。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.attractorPosition
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:253
+msgid "The position in world space of the 'attractor' - which can be used to make particles be drawn to and even orbit a particular location."
+msgstr "“吸引器”在世界空间中的位置——可用于使粒子被吸引到某个特定位置，甚至绕其运行。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.attractorForce
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:254
+msgid "How strongly should the particles be attracted to the the attractor position.  A value of 0 defines no attraction what soever, the unit is centimeters per second per second."
+msgstr "粒子被吸引到吸引器位置的强度。值为 0 表示完全没有吸引力，单位为厘米每二次方秒。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.attractorRadius
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:255
+msgid "Tunable falloff for the attractor - outside of this radius the attractor has no effect."
+msgstr "吸引器的可调衰减——在此半径之外吸引器不起作用。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.collisionMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:256
+msgid "Selects the collision mode for the particle - which controls behaviour on collision (if enabled). 0: Bounce on collision.  1: Stop all motion on collision.  2: Kill particle on collision."
+msgstr "选择粒子的碰撞模式——控制碰撞时的行为（如已启用）。0：碰撞时反弹。1：碰撞时停止所有运动。2：碰撞时销毁粒子。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.dragCoefficient
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:257
+msgid "Slows particles down over time, like air-resistance.  This parameter must be greater than 0.  0 means particles wont slow down due to drag, for values larger than this particles will slow over time without any external force being applied."
+msgstr "像空气阻力一样随时间使粒子减速。此参数必须大于 0。0 表示粒子不会因阻力而减速；对于大于 0 的值，即使没有施加任何外力，粒子也会随时间减速。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.restrictVelocityX
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:258
+msgid "Restricts particle velocity in the X axis."
+msgstr "限制粒子在 X 轴上的速度。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.restrictVelocityY
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:259
+msgid "Restricts particle velocity in the Y axis."
+msgstr "限制粒子在 Y 轴上的速度。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.restrictVelocityZ
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:260
+msgid "Restricts particle velocity in the Z axis."
+msgstr "限制粒子在 Z 轴上的速度。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.randomFlipAxis
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:261
+msgid "Allows the particle to be flipped randomly on spawn based on the selection here.  Controlled per axis (or both).  This feature helps hide repetition when reusing a single particle texture multiple times."
+msgstr "允许粒子在生成时根据此处的选择进行随机翻转。按轴控制（或两者同时）。此功能有助于在多次复用同一粒子纹理时隐藏重复感。"
+
+#. option rtx.particles.globalPreset.initialRotationDeviationDegrees
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_particle_system.h:262
+msgid "Range of degrees to rotate each particle by on spawn."
+msgstr "生成时旋转每个粒子的角度范围（度）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_point_instancer_system.cpp:52
+msgid "Point Instancer Culling"
+msgstr "点实例化器剔除"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_point_instancer_system.cpp:57
+msgid "Enable Culling"
+msgstr "启用剔除"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_point_instancer_system.cpp:60
+msgid "Culling Radius"
+msgstr "剔除半径"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_point_instancer_system.cpp:61
+msgid "Fade Start Radius"
+msgstr "淡出起始半径"
+
+#. option rtx.pointInstancer.enable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_point_instancer_system.h:115
+msgid "Enables radius-based culling for USD PointInstancer replacements. When disabled, all instances are submitted to the TLAS regardless of distance."
+msgstr "为 USD PointInstancer 替换启用基于半径的剔除。禁用时，无论距离远近，所有实例都会提交到 TLAS。"
+
+#. option rtx.pointInstancer.cullingRadius
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_point_instancer_system.h:129
+msgid "Maximum distance (in world units) from the camera beyond which PointInstancer instances are culled. Instances farther than this distance are not included in the TLAS."
+msgstr "距摄像机的最大距离（世界单位），超过此距离的 PointInstancer 实例将被剔除。比此距离更远的实例不会被纳入 TLAS。"
+
+#. option rtx.pointInstancer.fadeStartRadius
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_point_instancer_system.h:136
+msgid "Distance (in world units) from the camera at which instances begin to be stochastically removed to create a smooth density falloff. Set to 0 to disable the fade region (hard culling boundary only). Must be less than cullingRadius."
+msgstr "距摄像机的距离（世界单位），从此处开始随机移除实例，以形成平滑的密度衰减。设为 0 可禁用淡出区域（仅保留硬剔除边界）。必须小于 cullingRadius。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:119
+msgid "Post Effect Enabled"
+msgstr "启用后期效果"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:122
+msgid "Motion Blur Enabled"
+msgstr "启用动态模糊"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:124
+msgid "Motion Blur Noise Sample Enabled"
+msgstr "启用动态模糊噪声采样"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:125
+msgid "Motion Blur Emissive Surface Enabled"
+msgstr "启用自发光表面动态模糊"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:126
+msgid "Motion Blur Sample Count"
+msgstr "动态模糊采样数"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:127
+msgid "Exposure Fraction"
+msgstr "曝光比例"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:128
+msgid "Blur Diameter Fraction"
+msgstr "模糊直径比例"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:129
+msgid "Motion Blur Minimum Velocity Threshold (unit: pixel)"
+msgstr "动态模糊最小速度阈值（单位：像素）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:130
+msgid "Motion Blur Dynamic Deduction"
+msgstr "动态模糊动态物体削减"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:131
+msgid "Motion Blur Jitter Strength"
+msgstr "动态模糊抖动强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:134
+msgid "Chromatic Aberration Enabled"
+msgstr "启用色差"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:136
+msgid "Fringe Intensity"
+msgstr "色边强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:137
+msgid "Fringe Center Attenuation Amount"
+msgstr "色边中心衰减量"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:140
+msgid "Vignette Enabled"
+msgstr "启用暗角"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:142
+msgid "Vignette Intensity"
+msgstr "暗角强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:143
+msgid "Vignette Radius"
+msgstr "暗角半径"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.cpp:144
+msgid "Vignette Softness"
+msgstr "暗角柔和度"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.enable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:78
+msgid "Enables post-processing effects."
+msgstr "启用后处理效果。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.enableMotionBlur
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:81
+msgid "Enables motion blur post-processing effect."
+msgstr "启用动态模糊后处理效果。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.enableChromaticAberration
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:84
+msgid "Enables chromatic aberration post-processing effect."
+msgstr "启用色差后处理效果。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.enableVignette
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:86
+msgid "Enables vignette post-processing effect."
+msgstr "启用暗角后处理效果。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.enableMotionBlurNoiseSample
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:94
+msgid "Enable random distance sampling for every step along the motion vector. The random pattern is generated with interleaved gradient noise."
+msgstr "沿运动矢量的每一步启用随机距离采样。随机图案由交错梯度噪声生成。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.enableMotionBlurEmissive
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:95
+msgid "Enable Motion Blur for Emissive surfaces. Disable this when the motion blur on emissive surfaces cause severe artifacts."
+msgstr "为自发光表面启用动态模糊。当自发光表面上的动态模糊造成严重瑕疵时，请禁用此项。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.motionBlurSampleCount
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:96
+msgid "The number of samples along the motion vector. More samples could help to reduce motion blur noise."
+msgstr "沿运动矢量的采样数。更多的采样有助于减少动态模糊噪点。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.exposureFraction
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:97
+msgid "Simulate the camera exposure, the longer exposure will cause stronger motion blur."
+msgstr "模拟摄像机曝光，曝光时间越长，动态模糊越强。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.blurDiameterFraction
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:98
+msgid "The diameter of the circle that motion blur samplings occur. Motion vectors beyond this circle will be clamped."
+msgstr "进行动态模糊采样的圆的直径。超出此圆的运动矢量将被钳制。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.motionBlurMinimumVelocityThresholdInPixel
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:99
+msgid "The minimum motion vector distance that enable the motion blur. The unit is pixel size."
+msgstr "启用动态模糊的最小运动矢量距离。单位为像素大小。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.motionBlurDynamicDeduction
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:100
+msgid "The deduction of motion blur for dynamic objects."
+msgstr "对动态物体的动态模糊削减量。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.motionBlurJitterStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:101
+msgid "The jitter strength of every sample along the motion vector."
+msgstr "沿运动矢量的每个采样的抖动强度。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.chromaticAberrationAmount
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:102
+msgid "The strength of chromatic aberration."
+msgstr "色差的强度。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.chromaticCenterAttenuationAmount
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:103
+msgid "Control the amount of chromatic aberration effect that attunuated when close to the center of screen."
+msgstr "控制靠近屏幕中心时色差效果的衰减量。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.vignetteIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:104
+msgid "The darkness of vignette effect."
+msgstr "暗角效果的暗度。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.vignetteRadius
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:105
+msgid "The radius that vignette effect starts. The unit is normalized screen space, 0 represents the center, 1 means the edge of the short edge of the rendering window. So, this setting can larger than 1 until reach to the long edge of the rendering window."
+msgstr "暗角效果开始的半径。单位为归一化屏幕空间，0 表示中心，1 表示渲染窗口短边的边缘。因此，此设置可以大于 1，直到到达渲染窗口长边的边缘。"
+
+#. option rtx.postfx.vignetteSoftness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_postFx.h:106
+msgid "The gradient that the color drop to black from the vignetteRadius to the edge of rendering window."
+msgstr "颜色从 vignetteRadius 到渲染窗口边缘渐变为黑色的梯度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:624
+msgid "Precipitation (global)"
+msgstr "降水（全局）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:628
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"Rain / snow particles. Look and amount are per-preset\n"
+"(Weather Preset Editor -> Precipitation); these are the\n"
+"budget and spawn-volume knobs shared by every preset."
+msgstr ""
+"雨/雪粒子。外观和数量按预设设置\n"
+"（天气预设编辑器 -> 降水）；以下是\n"
+"所有预设共用的预算和生成体积调节项。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:640
+msgid "Enable Precipitation"
+msgstr "启用降水"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:649
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"Per-preset look values (amount, motion, drop look, sky\n"
+"light) are edited in the Weather Preset Editor above."
+msgstr ""
+"按预设的外观值（数量、运动、雨滴外观、天空\n"
+"光照）在上方的天气预设编辑器中编辑。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:655
+msgid "Appearance overrides (stack on presets)"
+msgstr "外观覆盖（叠加在预设之上）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:656
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"Tint and multipliers applied ON TOP of the per-preset look,\n"
+"so they hold even while an active weather preset drives the\n"
+"look fields every frame. Saved like any other option. Edits\n"
+"apply on the descriptor dwell (~1s) and crossfade in over\n"
+"one particle lifetime."
+msgstr ""
+"染色和倍数会“叠加”在按预设的外观之上，\n"
+"因此即使当前天气预设每帧都在驱动\n"
+"外观字段，它们也会保持生效。与其他选项一样保存。修改\n"
+"会在描述符驻留时间（约 1 秒）后应用，并在\n"
+"一个粒子生命周期内交叉淡入。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:662
+msgid "Tint"
+msgstr "染色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:665
+msgid "Opacity x"
+msgstr "不透明度 x"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:668
+msgid "Drop Width x"
+msgstr "雨滴宽度 x"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:671
+msgid "Drop Length x"
+msgstr "雨滴长度 x"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:674
+msgid "Motion Streak x"
+msgstr "运动拖尾 x"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:677
+msgid "Size Variance"
+msgstr "尺寸变化"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:680
+msgid "Opacity Variance"
+msgstr "不透明度变化"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:686
+msgid "Particle Budget"
+msgstr "粒子预算"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:689
+msgid "Spawn Radius (m)"
+msgstr "生成半径 (m)"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:692
+msgid "Spawn Height (m)"
+msgstr "生成高度 (m)"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:695
+msgid "Fall Margin (m)"
+msgstr "下落余量 (m)"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:698
+msgid "Emission Spread (deg)"
+msgstr "发射扩散（度）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:706
+msgid "Stop Under Cover (ray traced)"
+msgstr "遮蔽下停止（光线追踪）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:738
+#, c-format
+msgid "Occlusion diagnostics (readback is a few frames old):"
+msgstr "遮挡诊断（回读数据有几帧延迟）："
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:740
+#, c-format
+msgid "  Scene TLAS: MISSING - trace skipped"
+msgstr "  场景 TLAS：缺失 - 已跳过追踪"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:742
+#, c-format
+msgid "  Scene TLAS: available"
+msgstr "  场景 TLAS：可用"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:744
+#, c-format
+msgid "  Spawn rays: %u   shelter kills: %u   landing hits: %u   relocated: %u"
+msgstr "  生成光线：%u   遮蔽销毁：%u   落地命中：%u   重新定位：%u"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:746
+#, c-format
+msgid "  Spawn plane: +%.0f world units above camera (%.1f m at rtx.sceneScale = %.3g)"
+msgstr "  生成平面：摄像机上方 +%.0f 世界单位（%.1f m，rtx.sceneScale = %.3g）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:749
+msgid ""
+"Sanity-check this against the game's real unit scale. Remix converts authored meters via\n"
+"meterToWorldUnitScale = 100 * rtx.sceneScale; if the game's world uses more units per real meter\n"
+"than that (Fallout 4: ~70 units/m vs 10 units/m at sceneScale 0.1), every meter-authored\n"
+"precipitation dimension is proportionally smaller in the real world - including this spawn-plane\n"
+"height. Cover ABOVE the spawn plane is handled by the upward shelter probe, so occlusion still\n"
+"works; but the visible rain volume itself scales with these numbers."
+msgstr ""
+"请根据游戏的实际单位比例核对此值。Remix 通过\n"
+"meterToWorldUnitScale = 100 * rtx.sceneScale 转换以米为单位制作的数值；如果游戏世界中每真实米对应的单位数\n"
+"比这更多（Fallout 4：约 70 单位/m，而 sceneScale 0.1 时为 10 单位/m），则每个以米为单位制作的\n"
+"降水尺寸在真实世界中都会按比例变小——包括此生成平面的\n"
+"高度。生成平面“上方”的遮蔽物由向上的遮蔽探测处理，因此遮挡仍然\n"
+"有效；但可见的雨体积本身会随这些数值缩放。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:757
+msgid "Collide With World (screen-space)"
+msgstr "与世界碰撞（屏幕空间）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:760
+msgid "Collision Thickness (cm)"
+msgstr "碰撞厚度 (cm)"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:765
+msgid "Drop Roughness"
+msgstr "雨滴粗糙度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:768
+msgid "Drop Metallic"
+msgstr "雨滴金属度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:771
+msgid "Descriptor Update Interval (ms)"
+msgstr "描述符更新间隔 (ms)"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.cpp:774
+msgid "Debug: Show Emitter Plane"
+msgstr "调试：显示发射平面"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.intensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:37
+msgid "Base/fallback precipitation dial. 0 disables the system entirely; 1 saturates the particle budget (rtx.weather.precipitation.maxParticles). An active WeatherSnapshot supplies the effective preset intensity without mutating this option."
+msgstr "基础/回退降水调节值。0 会完全禁用该系统；1 会用满粒子预算 (rtx.weather.precipitation.maxParticles)。处于活动状态的 WeatherSnapshot 会提供实际的预设强度，而不会修改此选项。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.fallSpeed
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:41
+msgid "Vertical fall speed in meters/second. Real rain terminal velocity is roughly 4-9 m/s; snow is 0.5-1.5 m/s. Combined with wind (see windResponse) to produce the actual travel direction."
+msgstr "垂直下落速度（米/秒）。真实雨滴的终端速度约为 4-9 m/s；雪为 0.5-1.5 m/s。与风（参见 windResponse）结合产生实际的运动方向。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.dropWidth
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:44
+msgid "Particle width in centimeters (across the direction of travel)."
+msgstr "粒子宽度（厘米，垂直于运动方向）。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.dropLength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:46
+msgid "Particle length in centimeters (along the direction of travel, before motion-trail stretching)."
+msgstr "粒子长度（厘米，沿运动方向，在运动拖尾拉伸之前）。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.streak
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:48
+msgid "Motion-trail multiplier. 0 disables trails entirely (round snowflakes); 1 stretches each particle by exactly its per-frame motion (rain streaks); higher exaggerates."
+msgstr "运动拖尾倍数。0 会完全禁用拖尾（圆形雪花）；1 会按每帧的运动量精确拉伸每个粒子（雨丝）；更高的值会夸大效果。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.opacity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:51
+msgid "Per-particle alpha, modulated with the drop texture."
+msgstr "每个粒子的 Alpha，与雨滴纹理相乘调制。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.color
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:53
+msgid "Per-particle tint, modulated with the drop texture's albedo."
+msgstr "每个粒子的染色，与雨滴纹理的反照率相乘调制。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.turbulence
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:55
+msgid "Turbulent flutter force in meters/second^2. 0 for rain (it falls straight); 0.3-1.5 gives snow its drifting, tumbling motion."
+msgstr "湍流飘动力（米/秒^2）。雨设为 0（垂直下落）；0.3-1.5 可使雪产生飘荡、翻滚的运动。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.drag
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:58
+msgid "Air resistance (1/second). 0 means particles hold their spawn velocity exactly. Non-zero values are automatically balanced against gravity so the VERTICAL terminal velocity still equals fallSpeed, which lets turbulence perturbations decay instead of accumulating - that is what makes snow flutter without wandering off. Note there is no opposing horizontal force, so drag also bleeds off the wind push with time constant 1/drag: wind-driven looks (blizzard, sandstorm) want LOW drag with high turbulence, not the reverse."
+msgstr "空气阻力（1/秒）。0 表示粒子完全保持其生成时的速度。非零值会自动与重力平衡，使“垂直”终端速度仍等于 fallSpeed，从而让湍流扰动衰减而不是累积——这正是让雪飘动而不会四处漂走的原因。注意：没有相反的水平力，因此阻力也会以时间常数 1/drag 削弱风的推力：风驱动的效果（暴风雪、沙尘暴）需要“低”阻力配合高湍流，而不是相反。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.skyLight
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:65
+msgid "Base/fallback strength of the SKYLIGHT the drops pick up, 1 = physical. Active weather supplies precipitationSkyLight through the WeatherSnapshot, so a blizzard can author different skylight than a drizzle. Mechanism: precipitation particles are shaded by the renderer's particle lighting approximation (albedo x froxel volumetric radiance), but the froxel grid contains NO skylight - its integrator only samples the analytic light pool - so under an overcast (sun-killed) preset the drops rendered as dark silhouettes against the bright sky. This term adds the missing skylight: the resolver samples the atmosphere's own sky-view LUT (including the cloud-transmittance LUT) per rain pixel, so drops carry true sky radiance - dimmed by real storm decks, warm at sunset, zero at night - with no heuristics. Scene lights still add on top through the froxel term (lanterns light rain at night). 0 disables the sky term (froxel-only). Only this system's particles receive it: the spawn-time shelter probe guarantees every living drop actually sees open sky. Applies immediately (per-frame constant, no descriptor rebuild)."
+msgstr "雨滴获取的“天光”的基础/回退强度，1 = 物理值。处于活动状态的天气会通过 WeatherSnapshot 提供 precipitationSkyLight，因此暴风雪可以设置与毛毛雨不同的天光。原理：降水粒子由渲染器的粒子光照近似（反照率 x froxel 体积辐射度）着色，但 froxel 网格中“没有”天光——其积分器只采样解析光源池——因此在阴天（无太阳）预设下，雨滴会在明亮的天空中呈现为深色剪影。此项补上缺失的天光：解析器会针对每个雨滴像素采样大气自身的天空视图 LUT（包括云透射率 LUT），因此雨滴带有真实的天空辐射度——会被真实的风暴云层压暗，在日落时偏暖，夜间为零——无需任何启发式规则。场景光源仍会通过 froxel 项叠加（夜间灯笼会照亮雨）。0 会禁用天空项（仅 froxel）。只有此系统的粒子会获得此项：生成时的遮蔽探测确保每个存活的雨滴确实能看到开阔的天空。立即生效（逐帧常量，无需重建描述符）。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.windResponse
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:79
+msgid "Fraction of the cloud wind speed (rtx.atmosphere.cloudWindSpeed) applied as horizontal drift. Also tilts the spawn plane, so the fall slants with the storm. Keep this SMALL: the cloud wind is an altitude wind defaulting to ~20 m/s, and the resulting slant is fixed in world space, so it re-projects on screen as the camera turns - a slant big enough to notice reads as the rain changing direction when you look around. 0.06 gives ~1.2 m/s, slanting 9.5 m/s rain by about 7 degrees. Values above ~0.1 are for deliberately wind-driven looks (blizzard, sandstorm) where near-horizontal travel is the point."
+msgstr "作为水平漂移应用的云层风速 (rtx.atmosphere.cloudWindSpeed) 比例。还会倾斜生成平面，使降落方向随风暴倾斜。请保持此值“较小”：云层风是默认约 20 m/s 的高空风，而由此产生的倾斜在世界空间中是固定的，因此会随摄像机转动在屏幕上重新投影——倾斜大到足以察觉时，环顾四周会看起来像雨在改变方向。0.06 约为 1.2 m/s，会使 9.5 m/s 的雨倾斜约 7 度。高于约 0.1 的值适用于刻意营造的风驱动效果（暴风雪、沙尘暴），这类效果正需要近乎水平的运动。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.appearance.tintColor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:91
+msgid "Global tint multiplied into the per-preset particle color. White (1,1,1) leaves the preset color unchanged. Applies to every preset (rain, snow, sand) - it is a user-taste override, not a weather field, so it sticks even while a weather preset is actively driving the look."
+msgstr "与按预设的粒子颜色相乘的全局染色。白色 (1,1,1) 保持预设颜色不变。适用于所有预设（雨、雪、沙）——这是一个按用户喜好的覆盖，而不是天气字段，因此即使天气预设正在驱动外观，它也会保持生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.appearance.opacityScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:95
+msgid "Multiplier on the per-preset particle opacity. 1 = preset value; below 1 fades precipitation toward invisible, above 1 thickens it (clamped at fully opaque)."
+msgstr "按预设的粒子不透明度的倍数。1 = 预设值；低于 1 会使降水逐渐淡化至不可见，高于 1 会使其更浓（上限为完全不透明）。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.appearance.widthScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:98
+msgid "Multiplier on the per-preset drop width (across the direction of travel). 1 = preset value."
+msgstr "按预设的雨滴宽度（垂直于运动方向）的倍数。1 = 预设值。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.appearance.lengthScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:100
+msgid "Multiplier on the per-preset drop length (along the direction of travel, before motion-trail stretching). 1 = preset value. For LONGER RAIN STREAKS this is usually the knob you want, possibly together with streakScale."
+msgstr "按预设的雨滴长度（沿运动方向，在运动拖尾拉伸之前）的倍数。1 = 预设值。要获得“更长的雨丝”，通常应调整此项，也可同时调整 streakScale。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.appearance.streakScale
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:104
+msgid "Multiplier on the per-preset motion-trail amount. The visible streak of a raindrop is its length plus its per-frame motion times this trail factor, so streakScale stretches the velocity-driven part of the streak while lengthScale stretches the sprite itself. At 0 the preset's trails are suppressed entirely (also disabling velocity alignment, like snow)."
+msgstr "按预设的运动拖尾量的倍数。雨滴可见的拖尾为其长度加上每帧运动量乘以此拖尾系数，因此 streakScale 拉伸的是拖尾中由速度驱动的部分，而 lengthScale 拉伸的是精灵本身。设为 0 时会完全抑制预设的拖尾（同时也会像雪一样禁用速度对齐）。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.appearance.sizeVariance
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:109
+msgid "Per-drop random size variation, 0..0.9. Each particle picks a stable random size in [1-v, 1+v] times the authored width/length (uniform per drop, held for its lifetime). Real rain and especially snow are not uniform; 0.3-0.5 reads naturally. 0 keeps every drop identical (the previous behavior)."
+msgstr "每个雨滴的随机尺寸变化，0..0.9。每个粒子会在制作的宽度/长度的 [1-v, 1+v] 倍范围内选取一个稳定的随机尺寸（每个雨滴均匀缩放，并在其生命周期内保持不变）。真实的雨，尤其是雪，并不均匀；0.3-0.5 看起来较自然。0 会使每个雨滴完全相同（以前的行为）。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.appearance.opacityVariance
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:114
+msgid "Per-drop random opacity variation, 0..0.9. Each particle picks a stable random opacity in [1-v, 1+v] times the effective opacity (clamped at 1). Mixing fainter and stronger drops adds depth; 0.3-0.5 reads naturally. 0 keeps every drop identical (the previous behavior)."
+msgstr "每个雨滴的随机不透明度变化，0..0.9。每个粒子会在实际不透明度的 [1-v, 1+v] 倍范围内选取一个稳定的随机不透明度（上限为 1）。混合较淡和较浓的雨滴能增加层次感；0.3-0.5 看起来较自然。0 会使每个雨滴完全相同（以前的行为）。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.enable
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:119
+msgid "Master switch for the weather precipitation particle system."
+msgstr "天气降水粒子系统的总开关。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.maxParticles
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:121
+msgid "Particle budget. This is the population at intensity 1.0; VRAM for the particle/vertex/index buffers is allocated for this count up front, so treat it as the performance dial."
+msgstr "粒子预算。这是强度为 1.0 时的粒子数量；粒子/顶点/索引缓冲区的 VRAM 会按此数量预先分配，因此请将其视为性能调节项。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.spawnRadiusMeters
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:124
+msgid "Radius of the spawn plane above the camera, in meters. Wider covers more of the view at the cost of spreading the same particle budget thinner."
+msgstr "摄像机上方生成平面的半径（米）。越宽覆盖的视野越多，但同样的粒子预算会分布得更稀疏。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.spawnHeightMeters
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:127
+msgid "Height of the spawn plane above the camera, in meters. Particles are seeded here and fall past the viewer."
+msgstr "生成平面在摄像机上方的高度（米）。粒子在此处生成，并从观察者身边落下。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.fallMarginMeters
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:131
+msgid "Extra fall distance below the camera before particles expire, in meters. Larger keeps drops visible further down the screen; smaller recycles the budget sooner."
+msgstr "粒子消失前在摄像机下方额外下落的距离（米）。值越大，雨滴在屏幕下方保持可见的范围越远；值越小，预算回收得越快。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.spreadDegrees
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:134
+msgid "Half-angle of the random emission cone about the spawn plane's normal, in degrees. A degree or two breaks up the otherwise perfectly parallel streaks."
+msgstr "围绕生成平面法线的随机发射锥体的半角（度）。一两度即可打破原本完全平行的雨丝。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.occludeUnderCover
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:137
+msgid "Stop precipitation under roofs, bridges and overhangs by ray tracing the scene's acceleration structure when each particle spawns: an upward shelter probe checks each drop for opaque cover overhead (even cover far above the spawn plane), and a downward trace along the fall path ends surviving drops' lives where they would land. A drop born under cover is NOT simply discarded - it rerolls to a different random spot on the spawn disc (up to 8 tries) and keeps the first one with open sky, so stepping under a roof moves the rain to the sky you can still see (a doorway, the street outside) instead of stopping it everywhere; only a fully enclosed space kills drops outright. Unlike collideWithWorld this is NOT screen-space, so it works for the roof over the player's head and anything else out of view - which is what makes interiors behave. Costs 2-9 rays per spawned particle (hundreds per frame, not thousands). Exact for straight-falling rain; an approximation for heavily tumbling snow, because the rays are straight lines along the spawn velocity. Only opaque geometry blocks: glass and foliage cards do not. Read-only hit counters are shown below this toggle in the dev menu."
+msgstr "在每个粒子生成时对场景的加速结构进行光线追踪，使降水在屋顶、桥梁和悬挑结构下停止：向上的遮蔽探测会检查每个雨滴上方是否有不透明遮蔽物（即使遮蔽物远高于生成平面），沿下落路径向下的追踪则会让存活的雨滴在其将要落地处结束生命。在遮蔽物下生成的雨滴“不会”被直接丢弃——它会在生成圆盘上重新随机选取一个位置（最多 8 次），并保留第一个能看到开阔天空的位置，因此走到屋顶下时，雨会移到您仍能看到的天空处（门口、外面的街道），而不是在所有地方都停止；只有完全封闭的空间才会直接销毁雨滴。与 collideWithWorld 不同，这“不是”屏幕空间的，因此对玩家头顶的屋顶以及视野之外的其他任何物体都有效——这正是室内表现正确的关键。每个生成的粒子需要 2-9 条光线（每帧数百条，而非数千条）。对于直线下落的雨是精确的；对于剧烈翻滚的雪则是近似，因为光线是沿生成速度方向的直线。只有不透明几何体会阻挡：玻璃和植被面片不会。只读的命中计数器显示在开发者菜单中此开关的下方。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.enableCollision
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:151
+msgid "Kill particles that hit world geometry, so rain stops under roofs and overhangs. Costs a depth-buffer test per particle per frame, and only occludes against what the camera can see."
+msgstr "销毁击中世界几何体的粒子，使雨在屋顶和悬挑结构下停止。每个粒子每帧需要一次深度缓冲区测试，并且只会针对摄像机可见的物体进行遮挡。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.collisionThickness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:154
+msgid "Maximum penetration depth in centimeters at which a particle still collides. Particles that get deeper than this are assumed to have passed behind a thin object rather than through it."
+msgstr "粒子仍会发生碰撞的最大穿透深度（厘米）。比此值更深的粒子被视为已经到了薄物体的后方，而不是穿过它。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.turbulenceFrequency
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:157
+msgid "Spatial frequency of the turbulence field (in centimeters). Lower values swirl over larger, slower eddies; higher values jitter."
+msgstr "湍流场的空间频率（厘米）。较低的值会形成更大、更慢的涡旋；较高的值则会产生抖动。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.roughness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:160
+msgid "Surface roughness of the drop material. Applied on the descriptor dwell timer (descUpdateIntervalMs): changing it re-registers the drop material, which forks the particle system identity exactly like a descriptor change, so the new look crossfades in over one particle lifetime rather than snapping."
+msgstr "雨滴材质的表面粗糙度。按描述符驻留计时器 (descUpdateIntervalMs) 应用：更改它会重新注册雨滴材质，这会像描述符更改一样分叉出新的粒子系统标识，因此新外观会在一个粒子生命周期内交叉淡入，而不是突然切换。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.metallic
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:165
+msgid "Surface metalness of the drop material. Applied on the descriptor dwell timer - see roughness."
+msgstr "雨滴材质的表面金属度。按描述符驻留计时器应用——参见 roughness。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.descUpdateIntervalMs
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:167
+msgid "Minimum time between particle-descriptor updates, in milliseconds. The particle manager keys its systems on the descriptor hash, so a value that changes every frame would allocate a new particle system every frame. Lower reacts to weather blends faster and costs more transient VRAM. The effective interval is floored at maxTimeToLive/6 so slow-falling looks (snow lives ~20s) cannot pile up dozens of orphaned systems during a blend; 0 disables both the dwell AND the floor and is a debugging setting only."
+msgstr "粒子描述符两次更新之间的最短时间（毫秒）。粒子管理器以描述符哈希作为其系统的键，因此每帧都变化的值会每帧都分配一个新的粒子系统。值越低，对天气混合的响应越快，但会占用更多临时 VRAM。实际间隔的下限为 maxTimeToLive/6，以免下落缓慢的效果（雪的寿命约 20 秒）在混合期间堆积数十个孤立的系统；0 会同时禁用驻留时间“和”下限，仅用于调试。"
+
+#. option rtx.weather.precipitation.debugShowEmitter
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_precipitation.h:174
+msgid "Render the emitter quad instead of hiding it. Diagnostic: shows exactly where particles are spawned and which way the plane is tilted."
+msgstr "渲染发射器四边形而不是将其隐藏。诊断用：可准确显示粒子的生成位置以及平面的倾斜方向。"
+
