+msgstr "调试：禁用绑定"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.enableBaking
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:67
+msgid ""
+"[Experimental] Enables runtime baking of blended terrains from top down (i.e. in an opposite direction of \"rtx.zUp\").\n"
+"It bakes multiple blended albedo terrain textures into a single texture sampled during ray tracing. The system requires \"Terrain Textures\" to contain hashes of the terrain textures to apply.\n"
+"Only use this system if the game renders terrain surfaces with multiple blended surfaces on top of each other (i.e. sand mixed with dirt, grass, snow, etc.).\n"
+"Requirement: the baked terrain surfaces must not be placed vertically in the game world. Horizontal surfaces will have the best image quality. Requires \"rtx.zUp\" to be set properly."
+msgstr ""
+"[实验性] 启用从上向下（即与 \"rtx.zUp\" 相反的方向）对混合地形进行运行时烘焙。\n"
+"它会将多个混合的反照率地形纹理烘焙为一张在光线追踪期间采样的纹理。该系统要求“地形纹理”中包含要应用的地形纹理的哈希。\n"
+"仅当游戏以多个相互叠加混合的表面渲染地形（例如沙子与泥土、草、雪等混合）时才使用此系统。\n"
+"要求：被烘焙的地形表面在游戏世界中不能垂直放置。水平表面的画质最佳。需要正确设置 \"rtx.zUp\"。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.clearTerrainBeforeBaking
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:72
+msgid "Performs a clear on the terrain texture before it is baked to in a frame."
+msgstr "在一帧中烘焙地形纹理之前先对其进行清除。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.debugDisableBaking
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:73
+msgid "Force disables rebaking every frame. Used for debugging only."
+msgstr "强制禁用每帧重新烘焙。仅用于调试。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.debugDisableBinding
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:74
+msgid "Force disables binding of the baked terrain texture to the terrain meshes. Used for debugging only."
+msgstr "强制禁用将烘焙的地形纹理绑定到地形网格。仅用于调试。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:84
+msgid ""
+"Enables reading of secondary PBR replacement textures in pixel shaders when supported.\n"
+"Current support is limitted to fixed function pipelines and programmable shaders with Shader Model 1.0.\n"
+"When set to false or unsupported, an extra compute shader is used to preproces the secondary textures to make them compatible at an expense of performance and quality instead.\n"
+"Requires \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_fixedFunction = True\" to apply for draw calls with fixed function graphics pipeline.\n"
+"Requires \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_programmableShaders = True\" to apply for draw calls with programmable graphics pipeline."
+msgstr ""
+"在支持时，允许在像素着色器中读取次要 PBR 替换纹理。\n"
+"目前仅支持固定功能管线和着色器模型 1.0 的可编程着色器。\n"
+"设为 false 或不受支持时，会改用一个额外的计算着色器预处理次要纹理以使其兼容，但会牺牲性能和质量。\n"
+"要应用于使用固定功能图形管线的绘制调用，需要 \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_fixedFunction = True\"。\n"
+"要应用于使用可编程图形管线的绘制调用，需要 \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_programmableShaders = True\"。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.bakeReplacementMaterials
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:99
+msgid "Enables baking of replacement materials when they are present."
+msgstr "存在替换材质时启用其烘焙。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.bakeSecondaryPBRTextures
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:101
+msgid ""
+"Enables baking of secondary textures in replacement materials when they are present.\n"
+"Secondary textures are all PBR textures except for albedoOpacity. So that includes normal, roughness, etc."
+msgstr ""
+"替换材质中存在次要纹理时启用其烘焙。\n"
+"次要纹理是指除 albedoOpacity 之外的所有 PBR 纹理，包括法线、粗糙度等。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.maxResolutionToUseForReplacementMaterials
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:104
+msgid ""
+"Max resolution to use for preprocessing and baking of input replacement material textures other than color opacity which is used as is.\n"
+"Applies only to a case when a preprocessing compute shader is used to support baking of secondary PBR materials.\n"
+"Replacement materials need to be preprocessed prior to baking them and limitting the max resolution allows to balance the quality vs performance cost."
+msgstr ""
+"预处理和烘焙输入的替换材质纹理（颜色不透明度纹理除外，它按原样使用）时使用的最大分辨率。\n"
+"仅适用于使用预处理计算着色器来支持次要 PBR 材质烘焙的情况。\n"
+"替换材质在烘焙之前需要进行预处理，限制最大分辨率可以在质量与性能开销之间取得平衡。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.roughnessAnisotropy
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:113
+msgid "Roughness anisotropy. Valid range is <-1, 1>, where 0 is isotropic."
+msgstr "粗糙度各向异性。有效范围为 <-1, 1>，0 表示各向同性。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.emissiveIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:114
+msgid "Emissive intensity."
+msgstr "自发光强度。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.roughnessConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:115
+msgid "Perceptual roughness constant. Valid range is <0, 1>."
+msgstr "感知粗糙度常量。有效范围为 <0, 1>。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.metallicConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:116
+msgid "Metallic constant. Valid range is <0, 1>."
+msgstr "金属度常量。有效范围为 <0, 1>。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.emissiveColorConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:117
+msgid "Emissive color constant. Should be a color in sRGB colorspace with gamma encoding."
+msgstr "自发光颜色常量。应为 sRGB 色彩空间中经伽马编码的颜色。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.enableEmission
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:118
+msgid "A flag to determine if emission is enabled."
+msgstr "决定是否启用自发光的标志。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.displaceInFactor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:119
+msgid ""
+"The max depth and height the baked terrain can support will be larger than the max \n"
+"of any incoming draw call, which results in a loss of detail. When this is \n"
+"too low, the displacement will lack detail. When it is too high, the lowest \n"
+"and highest parts of the POM will flatten out.  This affects both displaceIn \n"
+"and displaceOut, despite the name."
+msgstr ""
+"烘焙地形可支持的最大深度和高度将大于任何传入绘制调用的\n"
+"最大值，这会导致细节损失。此值\n"
+"过低时，置换会缺乏细节。过高时，POM 的最低\n"
+"和最高部分会变平。尽管名称如此，它同时影响 displaceIn\n"
+"和 displaceOut。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.useTerrainBBOX
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:132
+msgid "Uses terrain's bounding box to calculate the cascade map's scene footprint."
+msgstr "使用地形的包围盒计算级联贴图在场景中的覆盖范围。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.defaultHalfWidth
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:133
+msgid "Cascade map square's default half width around the camera [meters]. Used when the terrain's BBOX couldn't be estimated."
+msgstr "摄像机周围级联贴图正方形的默认半宽 [米]。在无法估算地形包围盒时使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.defaultHeight
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:134
+msgid "Cascade map baker's camera default height above the in-game camera [meters]. Used when the terrain's BBOX couldn't be estimated."
+msgstr "级联贴图烘焙器的摄像机在游戏内摄像机上方的默认高度 [米]。在无法估算地形包围盒时使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.levelHalfWidth
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:135
+msgid "First cascade level square's half width around the camera [meters]."
+msgstr "摄像机周围第一级联层级正方形的半宽 [米]。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.maxLevels
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:136
+msgid "Max number of cascade levels."
+msgstr "最大级联层级数。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.levelResolution
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:140
+msgid "Texture resolution per cascade level."
+msgstr "每个级联层级的纹理分辨率。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.expandLastCascade
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:144
+msgid ""
+"Expands the last cascade's footprint to cover the whole cascade map.\n"
+"This ensures whole terrain surface has valid baked texture data to sample from\n"
+"even if there isn't enough cascades generated (due to the current settings or limitations)."
+msgstr ""
+"扩展最后一个级联的覆盖范围，使其覆盖整个级联贴图。\n"
+"这可确保即使生成的级联数量不足（由于当前设置或限制），\n"
+"整个地形表面也有有效的烘焙纹理数据可供采样。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:90
+msgid "Global Exposure"
+msgstr "全局曝光"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:92
+msgid "Color Grading Enabled"
+msgstr "启用调色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:97
+msgid "Color Balance"
+msgstr "色彩平衡"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:102
+msgid "Tonemapping Enabled"
+msgstr "启用色调映射"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.exposureBias
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:91
+msgid "The exposure value to use for the global tonemapper when auto exposure is disabled, or a bias multiplier on top of the auto exposure's calculated exposure value."
+msgstr "禁用自动曝光时全局色调映射器使用的曝光值，或在自动曝光计算出的曝光值之上应用的偏移倍数。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.tonemappingEnabled
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:92
+msgid "A flag to enable or disable the global tonemapper."
+msgstr "启用或禁用全局色调映射器的标志。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:93
+msgid "A flag to enable or disable color grading after the global tonemapper's tonemapping pass, but before gamma correction and dithering (if enabled)."
+msgstr "启用或禁用调色的标志。调色在全局色调映射器的色调映射阶段之后、伽马校正和抖动（如启用）之前进行。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.colorBalance
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:96
+msgid "The color tint to apply after tonemapping when color grading is enabled for the tonemapper (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled). Values should be in the range [0, 1]."
+msgstr "为色调映射器启用调色 (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled) 时，在色调映射之后应用的颜色染色。值应在 [0, 1] 范围内。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.contrast
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:97
+msgid "The contrast adjustment to apply after tonemapping when color grading is enabled for the tonemapper (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled). Values should be in the range [0, 1]."
+msgstr "为色调映射器启用调色 (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled) 时，在色调映射之后应用的对比度调整。值应在 [0, 1] 范围内。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.saturation
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:98
+msgid "The saturation adjustment to apply after tonemapping when color grading is enabled for the tonemapper (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled). Values should be in the range [0, 1]."
+msgstr "为色调映射器启用调色 (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled) 时，在色调映射之后应用的饱和度调整。值应在 [0, 1] 范围内。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.ditherMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:101
+msgid ""
+"Tonemap dither mode selection, dithering allows for reduction of banding artifacts in the final rendered output from quantization using a small amount of monochromatic noise. Impact typically most visible in darker regions with smooth lighting gradients.\n"
+"Enabling dithering will make the rendered image slightly noisier, though usually dither noise is fairly imperceptible in most cases without looking closely. Generally dithered results will also look better than the alternative of banding artifacts due to increasing perceptual precision of the signal.\n"
+"Note that temporal dithering may increase perceptual precision further but may also introduce more noticeable noise in the final output in some cases due to the noise pattern changing every frame unlike a purely spatial approach.\n"
+"Supported enum values are 0 = None (Disabled), 1 = Spatial (Enabled, Spatial dithering only), 2 = SpatialTemporal (Enabled, Spatial and temporal dithering).\n"
+"Generally enabling dithering is recommended, but disabling it may be useful in some niche cases for improving compression ratios in images or videos at the cost of quality (as noise while it may not be very visible may be more difficult to compress), or for capturing \"raw\" post-tonemapped data from the renderer."
+msgstr ""
+"色调映射抖动模式选择。抖动通过加入少量单色噪声，减少最终渲染输出中因量化产生的色带瑕疵。其影响通常在光照渐变平滑的较暗区域最为明显。\n"
+"启用抖动会使渲染图像略带噪点，不过在大多数情况下，不仔细看通常很难察觉抖动噪声。由于提高了信号的感知精度，抖动后的结果通常也比出现色带瑕疵更好看。\n"
+"注意：时域抖动可能会进一步提高感知精度，但由于噪声图案每帧都会变化（与纯空间方法不同），在某些情况下也可能在最终输出中引入更明显的噪点。\n"
+"支持的枚举值：0 = None（禁用），1 = Spatial（启用，仅空间抖动），2 = SpatialTemporal（启用，空间和时域抖动）。\n"
+"通常建议启用抖动，但在某些特殊情况下禁用它可能会有用，例如以牺牲质量为代价提高图像或视频的压缩率（因为噪声虽然可能不太明显，但可能更难压缩），或从渲染器捕获色调映射后的“原始”数据。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:627
+msgid "Fog Density"
+msgstr "雾密度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:631
+msgid "Intuitive thickness dial. 0 = clear, 1 = whiteout (~10 m visibility). Drives Transmittance Distance below (shorter distance = denser fog)."
+msgstr "直观的浓度调节。0 = 晴朗，1 = 白茫茫一片（能见度约 10 m）。驱动下方的“透射距离”（距离越短，雾越浓）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:636
+msgid "Fog Tint"
+msgstr "雾染色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:638
+msgid "The colour the fog scatters (single-scattering albedo). This, not Transmittance Color, is what tints the fog you actually see."
+msgstr "雾散射的颜色（单次散射反照率）。真正决定您看到的雾的颜色的是此项，而不是“透射颜色”。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1029
+msgid "(none / dormant)"
+msgstr "（无/休眠）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1121
+msgid "clear"
+msgstr "晴朗"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1121
+msgid "drizzle"
+msgstr "毛毛雨"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1121
+msgid "foggy"
+msgstr "有雾"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1121
+msgid "hazy"
+msgstr "霾"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1121
+msgid "overcast"
+msgstr "阴天"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1121
+msgid "partlyCloudy"
+msgstr "局部多云"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1031 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1122
+msgid "blizzard"
+msgstr "暴风雪"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1031 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1122
+msgid "rainstorm"
+msgstr "暴雨"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1031 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1122
+msgid "sandstorm"
+msgstr "沙尘暴"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1031 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1122
+msgid "smoggy"
+msgstr "烟霾"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1031 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1122
+msgid "snow"
+msgstr "雪"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1031 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1122
+msgid "thunderstorm"
+msgstr "雷暴"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1035
+msgid "Target Preset"
+msgstr "目标预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1036
+msgid "Blend Duration (sec)"
+msgstr "混合时长（秒）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1037
+msgid "Apply Preset"
+msgstr "应用预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1043
+msgid "Pause Weather Blender"
+msgstr "暂停天气混合器"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1054
+#, c-format
+msgid "Current: %s    Target: %s    Previous: %s    Blend: %.3f"
+msgstr "当前：%s    目标：%s    上一个：%s    混合：%.3f"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1060
+msgid "Close Preset Editor"
+msgstr "关闭预设编辑器"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1060
+msgid "Open Preset Editor"
+msgstr "打开预设编辑器"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1065
+msgid "Weather Variation"
+msgstr "天气变化"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1069
+msgid "Variation speed"
+msgstr "变化速度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1071
+msgid "Scales how fast the weather variation evolves. 0 = frozen. Smoothed with tau = 1.0s."
+msgstr "缩放天气变化的演变速度。0 = 冻结。以 tau = 1.0s 进行平滑。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1074
+msgid "Variation intensity"
+msgstr "变化强度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1076
+msgid "Scales how big the variation swings are around the preset midpoint. 0 = fully off."
+msgstr "缩放围绕预设中值的变化幅度。0 = 完全关闭。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1086
+#, c-format
+msgid "Variation phase:     %.2f s"
+msgstr "变化相位：     %.2f s"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1087
+#, c-format
+msgid "Speed (smoothed):    %.3f"
+msgstr "速度（平滑）：    %.3f"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1088
+#, c-format
+msgid "Intensity (smoothed):%.3f"
+msgstr "强度（平滑）：%.3f"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1090
+msgid "Reset to defaults"
+msgstr "重置为默认值"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1095
+msgid "Disable variation"
+msgstr "禁用变化"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1115
+msgid "Weather Preset Editor"
+msgstr "天气预设编辑器"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1126
+msgid "Editing Preset"
+msgstr "正在编辑的预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1128
+msgid "Use Active"
+msgstr "使用当前预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1133
+msgid "Point the editor at whatever preset the blender is currently targeting."
+msgstr "让编辑器指向混合器当前的目标预设。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1136
+msgid "filter settings by name..."
+msgstr "按名称筛选设置..."
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1138
+msgid "Authoring tools"
+msgstr "制作工具"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1140
+msgid "Pin & Freeze for Tuning"
+msgstr "固定并冻结以便调整"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1152
+msgid "Snap the blender to this preset (0 s blend) and freeze variation so edits show on a held image. Unchecking restores the previous variation intensity."
+msgstr "使混合器立即切换到此预设（0 秒混合）并冻结变化，以便在静止的画面上显示编辑效果。取消勾选会恢复之前的变化强度。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1170
+msgid "Copy Into Edited"
+msgstr "复制到正在编辑的预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1172
+msgid "Copy every value from the chosen preset into the one being edited."
+msgstr "将所选预设中的所有值复制到正在编辑的预设中。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1174
+msgid "Snapshot Live -> Preset"
+msgstr "实时快照 -> 预设"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1176
+msgid "Capture the current live renderer values into this preset. Tune the real atmosphere/volumetrics with the blender dormant, then capture."
+msgstr "将渲染器当前的实时值捕获到此预设中。请在混合器休眠时调整实际的大气/体积效果，然后进行捕获。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1179
+msgid "Copy as user.conf lines"
+msgstr "复制为 user.conf 行"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1183
+msgid "Optional: copies this preset as rtx.weather.preset.* lines to the clipboard. The dev menu's Save Settings already persists edits to the modder config; use this only to move values into a specific game's user.conf."
+msgstr "可选：将此预设以 rtx.weather.preset.* 行的形式复制到剪贴板。开发者菜单的“保存设置”已经会将编辑内容持久保存到模组制作者配置中；仅在需要将数值移到特定游戏的 user.conf 中时才使用此功能。"
+
+#. option rtx.xess.preset
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_xess.h:53
+msgid "Adjusts XeSS scaling factor, trades quality for performance."
+msgstr "调整 XeSS 缩放系数，以质量换取性能。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.albedoScale
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:79
+msgid "A scale factor to apply to all albedo values in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "应用于不透明材质中所有反照率值的缩放系数。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.albedoBias
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:80
+msgid "A bias factor to add to all albedo values in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "加到不透明材质中所有反照率值上的偏移量。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.roughnessScale
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:81
+msgid "A scale factor to apply to all roughness values in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "应用于不透明材质中所有粗糙度值的缩放系数。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.roughnessBias
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:82
+msgid "A bias factor to add to all roughness values in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "加到不透明材质中所有粗糙度值上的偏移量。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.metallicScale
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:83
+msgid "A scale factor to apply to all metallic values in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "应用于不透明材质中所有金属度值的缩放系数。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.metallicBias
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:84
+msgid "A bias factor to add to all metallic values in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "加到不透明材质中所有金属度值上的偏移量。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.normalIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:85
+msgid "An arbitrary strength scale factor to apply when decoding normals in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "在不透明材质中解码法线时应用的任意强度缩放系数。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.layeredWaterNormalMotion
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:86
+msgid ""
+"A vector describing the motion in the U and V axes across a texture to apply for layered water.\n"
+"Only takes effect when layered water normals are enabled (and an object is properly classified as animated water)."
+msgstr ""
+"描述分层水面在纹理上沿 U 轴和 V 轴运动的向量。\n"
+"仅在启用分层水面法线（且物体被正确归类为动画水面）时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.layeredWaterNormalMotionScale
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:90
+msgid ""
+"A scale factor applied to the layered water normal motion vector.\n"
+"Only takes effect when layered water normals are enabled (and an object is properly classified as animated water)."
+msgstr ""
+"应用于分层水面法线运动向量的缩放系数。\n"
+"仅在启用分层水面法线（且物体被正确归类为动画水面）时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.layeredWaterNormalLodBias
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:93
+msgid ""
+"The LoD bias to use when sampling from the normal map on layered water for the second layer of detail.\n"
+"This value typically should be greater than 0 to allow for a more blurry mip to be selected as this allows for a low frequency variation of normals to be applied to the higher frequency variation from the typical normal map.\n"
+"Only takes effect when layered water normals are enabled (and an object is properly classified as animated water)."
+msgstr ""
+"在分层水面上为第二层细节采样法线贴图时使用的 LoD 偏移。\n"
+"此值通常应大于 0，以便选择更模糊的 Mip，从而将低频的法线变化叠加到常规法线贴图的高频变化之上。\n"
+"仅在启用分层水面法线（且物体被正确归类为动画水面）时生效。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.layeredWaterNormalEnable
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:97
+msgid ""
+"A flag indicating if layered water normal should be enabled or disabled.\n"
+"Note that objects must be properly classified as animated water to be rendered with this mode."
+msgstr ""
+"指示是否启用分层水面法线的标志。\n"
+"注意：物体必须被正确归类为动画水面，才能以此模式渲染。"
+
+#. option rtx.opaqueMaterial.enableThinFilmOverride
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:104
+msgid "A flag to force the thin-film layer on the opaque material to be enabled. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "强制启用不透明材质薄膜层的标志。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.transmittanceColorScale
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:135
+msgid "A scale factor to apply to all transmittance color values in the translucent material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "应用于半透明材质中所有透射颜色值的缩放系数。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.transmittanceColorBias
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:136
+msgid "A bias factor to add to all transmittance color values in the opaque material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "加到不透明材质中所有透射颜色值上的偏移量。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.normalIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:137
+msgid "An arbitrary strength scale factor to apply when decoding normals in the translucent material. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "在半透明材质中解码法线时应用的任意强度缩放系数。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.refractiveIndexScale
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:138
+msgid "A scale factor to apply to the index of refraction for all translucent materials. The scale is clamped to [0.0, 3.0]. Should only be used for look development."
+msgstr "应用于所有半透明材质折射率的缩放系数。该缩放会被钳制在 [0.0, 3.0] 范围内。仅应用于外观开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.animatedWaterPrimaryNormalMotion
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:141
+msgid ""
+"Velocity in UV space for the primary texture coordinate.\n"
+"This relies on Remix animation time, which will not respect any time warping performed by the game (so pause, slow mo, etc will not change animation speed)."
+msgstr ""
+"主纹理坐标在 UV 空间中的速度。\n"
+"这依赖于 Remix 动画时间，它不会遵循游戏进行的任何时间变速（因此暂停、慢动作等都不会改变动画速度）。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.animatedWaterSecondaryNormalMotion
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:144
+msgid ""
+"Velocity in UV space for the secondary texture coordinate.\n"
+"This relies on Remix animation time, which will not respect any time warping performed by the game (so pause, slow mo, etc will not change animation speed)."
+msgstr ""
+"次级纹理坐标在 UV 空间中的速度。\n"
+"这依赖于 Remix 动画时间，它不会遵循游戏进行的任何时间变速（因此暂停、慢动作等都不会改变动画速度）。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.animatedWaterSecondaryNormalLodBias
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:147
+msgid ""
+"LoD bias to use when taking the second normal map sample.\n"
+"Values greater than 0 will cause the secondary normal map to be blurred, resulting in lower frequency waves."
+msgstr ""
+"进行第二次法线贴图采样时使用的 LoD 偏移。\n"
+"大于 0 的值会使次级法线贴图变模糊，从而产生频率更低的波浪。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.animatedWaterEnable
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:150
+msgid ""
+"If enabled, draw calls in the AnimatedWater category and a translucent material will have their primary texcoordinates animated, and will also take a second sample from the normal map.\n"
+"Note that objects must be properly categorized as animated water to be rendered with this mode."
+msgstr ""
+"启用后，属于 AnimatedWater 类别且使用半透明材质的绘制调用，其主纹理坐标将产生动画，并会对法线贴图进行第二次采样。\n"
+"注意：物体必须被正确归类为动画水面，才能以此模式渲染。"
+
+#. option rtx.translucentMaterial.enableDiffuseLayerOverride
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/material_args.h:155
+msgid "A flag to force the diffuse layer on the translucent material to be enabled. Should only be used for debugging or development."
+msgstr "强制启用半透明材质漫反射层的标志。仅应用于调试或开发。"
+
+#. option rtx.viewDistance.distanceMode
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/view_distance_args.h:73
+msgid "The view distance mode, None disables view distance, Hard Cutoff will cut off geometry past a point, Coherent Noise will feather geometry out using a stable worldspace noise pattern (experimental), and Coherent Noise Smooth Primary will do the same except for primary rays, which instead smoothly blend distant surfaces into the sky."
+msgstr "视距模式：“无”会禁用视距，“硬截断”会截断超过某一距离的几何体，“相干噪声”会使用稳定的世界空间噪声图案使几何体逐渐羽化消失（实验性），“相干噪声，主光线平滑”的效果相同，但主光线除外，主光线会将远处的表面平滑地混合到天空中。"
+
+#. option rtx.viewDistance.distanceFunction
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/view_distance_args.h:74
+msgid "The view distance function. 0: Euclidean, a simple distance from the camera. 1: Horizontal (Planar Euclidean), which ignores distance across the world's \"up\" direction. 2: Vertical, which uses only the \"up\" direction."
+msgstr "视距函数。0：欧几里得，即到摄像机的简单距离。1：水平（平面欧几里得），忽略沿世界“向上”方向的距离。2：垂直，仅使用“向上”方向。"
+
+#. option rtx.viewDistance.distanceThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/view_distance_args.h:75
+msgid "The view distance to draw out to based on the result of the view distance function, only used for the Hard Cutoff view distance mode."
+msgstr "根据视距函数结果确定的绘制距离，仅用于“硬截断”视距模式。"
+
+#. option rtx.viewDistance.distanceFadeMin
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/view_distance_args.h:78
+msgid "The view distance based on the result of the view distance function to start view distance noise fading at, only used for the Coherent Noise view distance mode."
+msgstr "根据视距函数结果确定的、开始视距噪声淡出的距离，仅用于“相干噪声”视距模式。"
+
+#. option rtx.viewDistance.distanceFadeMax
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/view_distance_args.h:81
+msgid "The view distance based on the result of the view distance function to end view distance noise fading at (and effectively draw nothing past this point), only used for the Coherent Noise view distance mode."
+msgstr "根据视距函数结果确定的、结束视距噪声淡出的距离（超过此距离实际上不再绘制任何内容），仅用于“相干噪声”视距模式。"
+
+#. option rtx.viewDistance.noiseScale
+#: src/dxvk/shaders/rtx/pass/view_distance_args.h:83
+msgid "The scale per meter value applied to ther world space position fed into the noise generation function for generating the fade in Coherent Noise view distance mode."
+msgstr "在“相干噪声”视距模式下，为生成淡出效果而输入噪声生成函数的世界空间位置所应用的每米缩放值。"
+
+#~ msgid "%.1f GB"
+#~ msgstr "%.1f GB"
+
+#~ msgid "%+d.0 EV"
+#~ msgstr "%+d.0 EV"
+
+#~ msgid "%+.2f EV"
+#~ msgstr "%+.2f EV"
+
+#~ msgid "%+.1f EV"
+#~ msgstr "%+.1f EV"
+
+#~ msgid "Initial Hash: 0x%"
+#~ msgstr "初始哈希：0x%"
+
+#~ msgid "Transformed Hash: 0x%"
+#~ msgstr "变换后哈希：0x%"
diff --git a/i18n/zh-TW.po b/i18n/zh-TW.po
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..d0aee0af
--- /dev/null
+++ b/i18n/zh-TW.po
@@ -0,0 +1,16358 @@
+# 繁體中文 translation of the RTX Remix menus. See i18n/README.md.
+msgid ""
+msgstr ""
+"Project-Id-Version: dxvk-remix-gmod\n"
+"Language: zh-TW\n"
+"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
+"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
+"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
+"X-Remix-Language-Name: 繁體中文\n"
+"X-Remix-Font: NotoSansTC\n"
+
+#. option rtx.orthographicIsUI
+#: src/d3d9/d3d9_rtx.h:41
+msgid "When enabled, draw calls that are orthographic will be considered as UI."
+msgstr "啟用後，正交投影的繪製呼叫會被視為 UI。"
+
+#. option rtx.preTransformedVerticesIsUI
+#: src/d3d9/d3d9_rtx.h:42
+msgid "When enabled, draw calls using pre-transformed (screen-space) vertices will be considered as UI. This is typical for D3D8/D3D9 games that render UI with RHW vertices."
+msgstr "啟用後，使用預先轉換（螢幕空間）頂點的繪製呼叫會被視為 UI。這在以 RHW 頂點渲染 UI 的 D3D8/D3D9 遊戲中很常見。"
+
+#. option rtx.allowCubemaps
+#: src/d3d9/d3d9_rtx.h:43
+msgid "When enabled, cubemaps from the game are processed through Remix, but they may not render correctly."
+msgstr "啟用後，遊戲的立方體貼圖會經由 Remix 處理，但可能無法正確渲染。"
+
+#. option rtx.useVertexCapture
+#: src/d3d9/d3d9_rtx.h:44
+msgid "When enabled, injects code into the original vertex shader to capture final shaded vertex positions.  Is useful for games using simple vertex shaders, that still also set the fixed function transform matrices."
+msgstr "啟用後，會在原始頂點著色器中注入程式碼，以擷取最終著色後的頂點位置。適用於使用簡單頂點著色器、但仍會設定固定功能轉換矩陣的遊戲。"
+
+#. option rtx.useVertexCapturedNormals
+#: src/d3d9/d3d9_rtx.h:45
+msgid "When enabled, vertex normals are read from the input assembler and used in raytracing.  This doesn't always work as normals can be in any coordinate space, but can help sometimes."
+msgstr "啟用後，會從輸入組合器讀取頂點法線並用於光線追蹤。由於法線可能位於任何座標空間，這不一定有效，但有時會有幫助。"
+
+#. option rtx.useVertexCapturedTexcoords
+#: src/d3d9/d3d9_rtx.h:46
+msgid "When enabled, vertex shader output texcoords always override input texcoords from the vertex declaration. Enable for games where the vertex shader applies meaningful UV transformations that should be used for ray tracing (e.g. animated UVs via shader constants)."
+msgstr "啟用後，頂點著色器輸出的紋理座標一律覆寫頂點宣告中的輸入紋理座標。若遊戲的頂點著色器會套用應該用於光線追蹤的有意義 UV 轉換（例如透過著色器常數製作的動畫 UV），請啟用此選項。"
+
+#. option rtx.useWorldMatricesForShaders
+#: src/d3d9/d3d9_rtx.h:47
+msgid "When enabled, Remix will utilize the world matrices being passed from the game via D3D9 fixed function API, even when running with shaders.  Sometimes games pass these matrices and they are useful, however for some games they are very unreliable, and should be filtered out.  If you're seeing precision related issues with shader vertex capture, try disabling this setting."
+msgstr "啟用後，即使在使用著色器時，Remix 也會利用遊戲透過 D3D9 固定功能 API 傳入的世界矩陣。有些遊戲傳入的這些矩陣很有用，但對某些遊戲來說它們非常不可靠，應予以過濾。若著色器頂點擷取出現精確度相關問題，請嘗試停用此設定。"
+
+#. option rtx.profiler.memory.enable
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:9
+msgid "Enables the memory profiler which allows users to inspect Remix resources using the profiler tool in the Dev Settings Remix window.  This option is disabled by default, and must be enabled from application launch to work correctly."
+msgstr "啟用記憶體效能分析工具，讓使用者能在 Remix 的「開發者設定」視窗中，使用效能分析工具檢查 Remix 資源。此選項預設為停用，且必須在應用程式啟動時就啟用才能正常運作。"
+
+#. option rtx.profiler.memory.includeWholeFrame
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:10
+msgid "Profiles memory across the entire frame when enabled.  When disabled we only see a snapshot of memory at the time of sampling.  This has some additional CPU performance overhead so is disabled by default."
+msgstr "啟用時，會分析整個畫格的記憶體。停用時，只能看到取樣當下的記憶體快照。此功能會帶來一些額外的 CPU 效能負擔，因此預設為停用。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:178
+msgid "Memory Profiler"
+msgstr "記憶體效能分析工具"
+
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:179
+#, c-format
+msgid "This is a tool to help diagnose memory related problems in Remix.  Press the `Sample Memory` button to take a snapshot of all the memory allocations currently in use by the application.  You can refresh this list at any time by clicking that button.  Once you have a snapshot, the data will be displayed as a list below."
+msgstr "這是協助診斷 Remix 記憶體相關問題的工具。按下 `Sample Memory`（取樣記憶體）按鈕，即可擷取應用程式目前使用中所有記憶體配置的快照。您隨時可以按下該按鈕重新整理此清單。取得快照後，資料會以清單形式顯示在下方。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:182
+#, c-format
+msgid "Memory profiler is disabled.  Please enable in the rtx.conf with `rtx.profiler.memory.enable = True` or with `RTX_PROFILER_MEMORY_ENABLE = 1` environment variable"
+msgstr "記憶體效能分析工具已停用。請在 rtx.conf 中設定 `rtx.profiler.memory.enable = True`，或使用 `RTX_PROFILER_MEMORY_ENABLE = 1` 環境變數來啟用"
+
+#: src/dxvk/dxvk_memory_tracker.cpp:187
+#, c-format
+msgid "In release builds of Remix, we truncate the resource names to 32 characters for performance reasons.  Truncated names end with an ellipsis to signify this."
+msgstr "在 Remix 的發行組建中，基於效能考量，資源名稱會截斷為 32 個字元。被截斷的名稱會以省略號結尾來表示這一點。"
+
