+#: src/dxvk/imgui/dxvk_imgui.cpp:5015
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"When a screen in-game is displaying the rasterized results of another camera, this can be used to raytrace that scene.\n"
+"Note that the render target texture containing the rasterized results needs to be set to `raytracedRenderTargetTextures` in the texture selection menu."
