+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.anisotropy
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:511
+msgid "The default roughness anisotropy to use for non-replaced \"legacy\" materials. Should be in the range -1 to 1, where 0 is isotropic."
+msgstr "未替換的「舊版」材質所使用的預設粗糙度非等向性。應在 -1 到 1 的範圍內，其中 0 為等向。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.emissiveIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:514
+msgid "The default emissive intensity to use for non-replaced \"legacy\" materials."
+msgstr "未替換的「舊版」材質所使用的預設自發光強度。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.useAlbedoTextureIfPresent
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:516
+msgid "A flag to determine if an \"albedo\" texture (a qualifying color texture) from the original application should be used if present on non-replaced \"legacy\" materials."
+msgstr "決定在未替換的「舊版」材質上，若存在原始應用程式的「反照率」紋理（符合條件的色彩紋理），是否加以使用的旗標。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.albedoConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:519
+msgid "The default albedo constant to use for non-replaced \"legacy\" materials. Should be a color in sRGB colorspace with gamma encoding."
+msgstr "未替換的「舊版」材質所使用的預設反照率常數。應為 sRGB 色彩空間中經伽瑪編碼的色彩。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.opacityConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:522
+msgid "The default opacity constant to use for non-replaced \"legacy\" materials. Should be in the range 0 to 1."
+msgstr "未替換的「舊版」材質所使用的預設不透明度常數。應在 0 到 1 的範圍內。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.roughnessConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:525
+msgid "The default perceptual roughness constant to use for non-replaced \"legacy\" materials. Should be in the range 0 to 1."
+msgstr "未替換的「舊版」材質所使用的預設感知粗糙度常數。應在 0 到 1 的範圍內。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.metallicConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:529
+msgid "The default metallic constant to use for non-replaced \"legacy\" materials. Should be in the range 0 to 1."
+msgstr "未替換的「舊版」材質所使用的預設金屬度常數。應在 0 到 1 的範圍內。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.emissiveColorConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:532
+msgid "The default emissive color constant to use for non-replaced \"legacy\" materials. Should be a color in sRGB colorspace with gamma encoding."
+msgstr "未替換的「舊版」材質所使用的預設自發光色彩常數。應為 sRGB 色彩空間中經伽瑪編碼的色彩。"
+
+#. option rtx.legacyMaterial.ignoreAlphaChannel
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_materials.h:537
+msgid "A flag to determine if the albedo alpha channel should be ignored on non-replaced \"legacy\" materials."
+msgstr "決定是否在未替換的「舊版」材質上忽略反照率 alpha 通道的旗標。"
+
+#. option rtx.usd.reloadOnChanged
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_mod_usd.h:75
+msgid "Watches for changes to USD files and reloads them in-game when saved. Uses OS file-change notifications (no polling overhead). Note: changes made during the first few seconds of initial stage load may be missed if the mod directory is not yet registered with the file watcher. Set to False to suppress automatic reloads; the file watcher still runs so this can be toggled at runtime without restarting."
+msgstr "監看 USD 檔案的變更，並在儲存時於遊戲中重新載入。使用作業系統的檔案變更通知（沒有輪詢負擔）。注意：若模組目錄尚未向檔案監看程式註冊，初次載入 stage 的最初幾秒內所做的變更可能會被遺漏。設為 False 可停止自動重新載入；檔案監看程式仍會執行，因此可在執行期間切換而無需重新啟動。"
+
+#. option rtx.usd.watchDependencies
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_mod_usd.h:80
+msgid "When reloadOnChanged is True, also triggers a reload when a USD file this mod actually depends on changes (sublayers, references, payloads - anything composed into the mod's stage), not just mod.usda itself. Useful when textures or mesh data live in separate USD files that mod.usda references."
+msgstr "當 reloadOnChanged 為 True 時，若此模組實際相依的 USD 檔案（子圖層、參照、payload，即任何組合進模組 stage 的內容）發生變更，也會觸發重新載入，而不只限於 mod.usda 本身。適用於紋理或網格資料位於 mod.usda 所參照之獨立 USD 檔案中的情況。"
+
