+msgstr "使動畫水面的歷史失效"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.pathTracerPreset
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:63
+msgid "Path tracer preset to use when Ray Reconstruction is enabled."
+msgstr "啟用光線重建時使用的路徑追蹤器預設。"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.useSpecularHitDistance
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:65
+msgid "Use specular hit distance to reduce ghosting.\n"
+msgstr "使用鏡面命中距離來減少殘影。\n"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.preserveSettingsInNativeMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:66
+msgid "Preserve settings when switched to native mode, otherwise the default preset will be applied.\n"
+msgstr "切換到原生模式時保留設定；否則會套用預設的預設組合。\n"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.combineSpecularAlbedo
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:67
+msgid "Combine primary and secondary specular albedo to improve DLSS-RR reflection quality.\n"
+msgstr "合併主要與次要鏡面反照率，以提升 DLSS-RR 的反射品質。\n"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.enableDetailEnhancement
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:68
+msgid "Enable detail enhancement filter to enhance normal map details.\n"
+msgstr "啟用細節增強濾鏡，以增強法線貼圖細節。\n"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.demodulateRoughness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:69
+msgid "Demodulate roughness to enhance roughness details.\n"
+msgstr "解調粗糙度，以增強粗糙度細節。\n"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.upscalerRoughnessDemodulationOffset
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:70
+msgid "Strength of upscaler roughness demodulation. Only used by DLSS-RR."
+msgstr "升頻器粗糙度解調的強度。僅由 DLSS-RR 使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.upscalerRoughnessDemodulationMultiplier
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:71
+msgid "Multiplier of upscaler roughness demodulation to suppress noise. Only used by DLSS-RR."
+msgstr "升頻器粗糙度解調的倍數，用於抑制雜訊。僅由 DLSS-RR 使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.enableDisocclusionMaskBlur
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:72
+msgid "Enables blurring of disocclusion mask to suppress instabilities due to abrupt mask value changes."
+msgstr "啟用去遮擋遮罩的模糊，以抑制遮罩值突然變化造成的不穩定。"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.disocclusionMaskBlurRadius
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:73
+msgid "Pixel radius to use for blurring disocclusion mask."
+msgstr "模糊去遮擋遮罩時使用的像素半徑。"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.disocclusionMaskBlurNormalizedGaussianWeightSigma
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:74
+msgid ""
+"Normalized Gaussian weight sigma to use for blurring disocclusion mask.\n"
+"The sigma is applied to the normalized blur kernel radius extents (i.e. <0, 1>)."
+msgstr ""
+"模糊去遮擋遮罩時使用的正規化高斯權重 sigma。\n"
+"sigma 會套用於正規化後的模糊核心半徑範圍（即 <0, 1>）。"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.invalidateHistoryForAnimatedWater
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:77
+msgid ""
+"Adds animated water surfaces to the disocclusion mask, making DLSS Ray Reconstruction discard their temporal history every frame.\n"
+"This suppresses ghosting from the water's per-frame normal variation, but can introduce shimmering on objects seen through or near the water, so it is disabled by default.\n"
+"Enable it for content whose animated water ghosts noticeably."
+msgstr ""
+"將動畫水面加入去遮擋遮罩，讓 DLSS 光線重建每個畫格都捨棄其時域歷史。\n"
+"這可抑制水面逐畫格法線變化造成的殘影，但可能會讓透過水面或靠近水面看到的物件出現閃爍，因此預設為停用。\n"
+"若內容中的動畫水面有明顯殘影，請啟用此選項。"
+
+#. option rtx.rayreconstruction.preset
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_ray_reconstruction.h:81
+msgid "Render preset for Ray Reconstruction. Default = 0 (DLSS picks the best preset), D = 4, E = 5, F = 6."
+msgstr "光線重建的渲染預設。預設值 = 0（由 DLSS 選擇最佳預設），D = 4，E = 5，F = 6。"
+
