+msgstr "可見性長度臨界值"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useTemporalReuse
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:91
+msgid "Enables temporal reuse."
+msgstr "啟用時域重複使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useSpatialReuse
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:92
+msgid "Enables spatial reuse."
+msgstr "啟用空間重複使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useFinalVisibility
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:93
+msgid "Tests visiblity in output."
+msgstr "在輸出中測試可見性。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.misMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:96
+msgid "MIS mode to mix specular output with input."
+msgstr "將鏡面輸出與輸入混合的 MIS 模式。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.misRoughness
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:97
+msgid "Reference roughness when roughness MIS is used. Higher values give ReSTIR inputs higher weight."
+msgstr "使用粗糙度 MIS 時的參考粗糙度。值越高，ReSTIR 輸入的權重越高。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.parallaxAmount
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:98
+msgid "Parallax strength when parallax MIS is used. Higher values give ReSTIR inputs higher weight."
+msgstr "使用視差 MIS 時的視差強度。值越高，ReSTIR 輸入的權重越高。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useVirtualSample
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:106
+msgid "Uses virtual position for samples from highly specular surfaces."
+msgstr "對來自高鏡面表面的取樣使用虛擬位置。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.virtualSampleLuminanceThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:107
+msgid "The last path vertex with luminance greater than 2 times of the previous accumulated radiance will get virtualized. Higher values tend to keep the first path vertex with non-zero contribution."
+msgstr "亮度大於先前累積輻射亮度 2 倍的最後一個路徑頂點會被虛擬化。值越高，越傾向保留第一個有非零貢獻的路徑頂點。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.virtualSampleRoughnessThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:108
+msgid "Surface with roughness under this threshold is considered to be highly specular, i.e. a \"mirror\"."
+msgstr "粗糙度低於此臨界值的表面會被視為高鏡面，也就是「鏡子」。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.virtualSampleSpecularThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:109
+msgid "If a highly specular path vertex's direct specular light portion is higher than this. Its distance to the light source will get accumulated."
+msgstr "若高鏡面路徑頂點的直接鏡面光比例高於此值，其與光源的距離會被累積。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.virtualSampleMaxDistanceRatio
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:110
+msgid "Clamp max virtual distance, measured by the proportion of distance to camera. 0 disables clamping."
+msgstr "限制最大虛擬距離，以與攝影機距離的比例衡量。0 會停用限制。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useTemporalBiasCorrection
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:112
+msgid "Corrects bias caused by temporal reprojection."
+msgstr "校正時域重新投影造成的偏差。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.biasCorrectionMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:113
+msgid "Bias correction mode to combine central with its neighbors in spatial reuse."
+msgstr "在空間重複使用中將中心取樣與其鄰近取樣合併的偏差校正模式。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.pairwiseMISCentralWeight
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:115
+msgid "The importance of central sample in pairwise bias correction modes."
+msgstr "成對偏差校正模式中中心取樣的重要性。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useDemodulatedTargetFunction
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:117
+msgid "Demodulates target function. This will improve the result in non-pairwise modes."
+msgstr "解調目標函數。這會改善非成對模式下的結果。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.usePermutationSampling
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:118
+msgid "Uses permutation sample to perturb samples. This will improve results in DLSS."
+msgstr "使用排列取樣擾動取樣。這會改善 DLSS 下的結果。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useDLSSRRCompatibilityMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:119
+msgid "DLSS-RR compatibility mode. In this mode temporal reprojection is randomized to reduce sample coherency."
+msgstr "DLSS-RR 相容模式。在此模式下，時域重新投影會隨機化，以降低取樣的相干性。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.DLSSRRTemporalRandomizationRadius
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:120
+msgid "In DLSS-RR compatibility mode temporal reprojection is randomized to reduce sample coherency. This option determines the randomization radius."
+msgstr "在 DLSS-RR 相容模式下，時域重新投影會隨機化，以降低取樣的相干性。此選項決定隨機化的半徑。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useSampleStealing
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:121
+msgid "Steals ReSTIR GI samples in path tracer. This will improve highly specular results."
+msgstr "在路徑追蹤器中竊取 ReSTIR GI 取樣。這會改善高鏡面的結果。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.sampleStealingJitter
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:122
+msgid "Jitter samples by k pixels to avoid aliasing."
+msgstr "將取樣抖動 k 個像素以避免鋸齒。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.stealBoundaryPixelSamplesWhenOutsideOfScreen
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:123
+msgid "Steals ReSTIR GI samples even a hit point is outside the screen. This will further improve highly specular samples at the cost of some bias."
+msgstr "即使命中點位於螢幕外，也竊取 ReSTIR GI 取樣。這會進一步改善高鏡面取樣，代價是一些偏差。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useDiscardEnlargedPixels
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:124
+msgid "Discards enlarged samples when the camera is moving towards an object."
+msgstr "攝影機朝物件移動時，捨棄被放大的取樣。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.historyDiscardStrength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:125
+msgid "The sensitivity of discarding history. Higher values discard more history."
+msgstr "捨棄歷史的敏感度。值越高，捨棄的歷史越多。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useTemporalJacobian
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:126
+msgid "Calculates Jacobian determinant in temporal reprojection."
+msgstr "在時域重新投影中計算 Jacobian 行列式。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useReflectionReprojection
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:127
+msgid "Uses reflection reprojection for reflective objects to achieve stable result when the camera is moving."
+msgstr "對反射物件使用反射重新投影，以在攝影機移動時獲得穩定的結果。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.reflectionMinParallax
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:129
+msgid "When the parallax between normal and reflection reprojection is greater than this threshold, randomly choose one reprojected position and reuse the sample on it. Otherwise, get a sample between the two positions."
+msgstr "當一般重新投影與反射重新投影之間的視差大於此臨界值時，會隨機選擇一個重新投影的位置，並重複使用該位置上的取樣。否則，會取得兩個位置之間的取樣。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useBoilingFilter
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:130
+msgid "Enables boiling filter to suppress boiling artifacts."
+msgstr "啟用沸騰過濾以抑制沸騰瑕疵。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.boilingFilterMinThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:131
+msgid "Boiling filter threshold when surface normal is perpendicular to view direction."
+msgstr "表面法線與視線方向垂直時的沸騰過濾臨界值。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.boilingFilterMaxThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:132
+msgid "Boiling filter threshold when surface normal is parallel to view direction."
+msgstr "表面法線與視線方向平行時的沸騰過濾臨界值。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.boilingFilterRemoveReservoirThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:133
+msgid "Removes a sample when a sample's weight exceeds this threshold."
+msgstr "當取樣的權重超過此臨界值時，移除該取樣。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.useAdaptiveTemporalHistory
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:134
+msgid "Adjust temporal history length based on frame rate."
+msgstr "依畫格率調整時域歷史長度。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.temporalAdaptiveHistoryLengthMs
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:135
+msgid "Temporal history time length, when adaptive temporal history is enabled."
+msgstr "啟用自適應時域歷史時的時域歷史時間長度。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.temporalFixedHistoryLength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:136
+msgid "Fixed temporal history length, when adaptive temporal history is disabled."
+msgstr "停用自適應時域歷史時的固定時域歷史長度。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.permutationSamplingSize
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:137
+msgid "Permutation sampling strength."
+msgstr "排列取樣強度。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.roughnessClamp
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:138
+msgid "Clamps minimum roughness a sample's importance is evaluated."
+msgstr "評估取樣重要性時所用粗糙度的最小限制值。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.validateLightingChange
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:139
+msgid "Remove samples when direct light has changed."
+msgstr "直接光變化時移除取樣。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.validateVisibilityChange
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:140
+msgid "Remove samples when visibility has changed. This feature is automatically disabled when virtual sample is enabled."
+msgstr "可見性變化時移除取樣。啟用虛擬取樣時，此功能會自動停用。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.lightingValidationThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:141
+msgid "Invalidate a sample when pixel change ratio is above this value."
+msgstr "當像素變化比例高於此值時，使取樣失效。"
+
+#. option rtx.restirGI.visibilityValidationRange
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_restir_gi_rayquery.h:142
+msgid "Check actual hit distance of a shadow ray, invalidate a sample if hit length is longer than one plus this portion, compared to the distance from the surface to the sample."
+msgstr "檢查陰影光線的實際命中距離；與表面到取樣的距離相比，若命中長度大於 1 加上此比例，就使該取樣失效。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:320
+msgid "Initial Sample Count"
+msgstr "初始取樣數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:321
+msgid "Sample Best Lights"
+msgstr "取樣最佳光源"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:322
+msgid "Initial Visibility"
+msgstr "初始可見性"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:326
+msgid "Max History Length"
+msgstr "最大歷史長度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:327
+msgid "Permutation Sampling on Nth Frame"
+msgstr "每 N 個畫格進行排列取樣"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:334
+msgid "Spatial Sample Count"
+msgstr "空間取樣數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:335
+msgid "Disocclusion Sample Count"
+msgstr "去遮擋取樣數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:336
+msgid "Disocclusion Frames"
+msgstr "去遮擋畫格數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:338
+msgid "Ray Traced Bias Correction"
+msgstr "光線追蹤偏差校正"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:340
+msgid "Discard Invisible Samples"
+msgstr "捨棄不可見的取樣"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:341
+msgid "Indirect Sample Stealing"
+msgstr "間接取樣竊取"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:342
+msgid "Steal Boundary Samples When Outside Of Screen"
+msgstr "超出螢幕時竊取邊界取樣"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:343
+msgid "Cross Portal Light"
+msgstr "跨傳送門光源"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:344
+msgid "Compute Denoiser Gradient"
+msgstr "計算降噪器梯度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:345
+msgid "Compute Denoiser Confidence"
+msgstr "計算降噪器信心度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:347
+msgid "Confidence Settings"
+msgstr "信心度設定"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:350
+msgid "History Length"
+msgstr "歷史長度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:351
+msgid "Gradient Power"
+msgstr "梯度冪次"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:352
+msgid "Gradient Scale"
+msgstr "梯度比例"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:353
+msgid "Gradient Filter Passes"
+msgstr "梯度過濾次數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:354
+msgid "Filter HitDist Sensitivity"
+msgstr "過濾 HitDist 敏感度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:355
+msgid "Minimum Confidence"
+msgstr "最小信心度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.cpp:356
+msgid "Confidence HitDist Sensitivity"
+msgstr "信心度 HitDist 敏感度"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableInitialVisibility
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:52
+msgid "Whether to trace a visibility ray for the light sample selected in the initial sampling pass."
+msgstr "是否為初始取樣階段選取的光源取樣追蹤可見性光線。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableBestLightSampling
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:53
+msgid "Whether to include a single best light from the previous frame's pixel neighborhood into initial sampling."
+msgstr "是否將上一個畫格像素鄰域中的單一最佳光源納入初始取樣。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableRayTracedBiasCorrection
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:55
+msgid "Whether to use ray traced bias correction in the spatial reuse pass."
+msgstr "是否在空間重複使用階段中使用光線追蹤偏差校正。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableSampleStealing
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:57
+msgid "No visibile IQ gains, but exhibits considerable perf drop (8% in integrate pass)."
+msgstr "沒有明顯的影像品質提升，但效能會大幅下降（積分階段下降 8%）。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.stealBoundaryPixelSamplesWhenOutsideOfScreen
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:59
+msgid "Steal screen boundary samples when a hit point is outside the screen."
+msgstr "命中點位於螢幕外時，竊取螢幕邊界取樣。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableSpatialReuse
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:61
+msgid "Whether to apply spatial reuse."
+msgstr "是否套用空間重複使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableTemporalReuse
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:63
+msgid "Whether to apply temporal reuse."
+msgstr "是否套用時域重複使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableDiscardInvisibleSamples
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:64
+msgid "Whether to discard reservoirs that are determined to be invisible in final shading."
+msgstr "是否捨棄在最終著色中被判定為不可見的儲存池。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.enableDenoiserGradient
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:68
+msgid "Enable gradient calculation, which is used by confidence calculation and GI sample validation."
+msgstr "啟用梯度計算，供信心度計算與 GI 取樣驗證使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.initialSampleCount
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:69
+msgid "The number of lights randomly selected from the global pool to consider when selecting a light with RTXDI."
+msgstr "以 RTXDI 選擇光源時，從全域集區中隨機選取以供考量的光源數量。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.spatialSamples
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:71
+msgid "The number of spatial reuse samples in converged areas."
+msgstr "已收斂區域中的空間重複使用取樣數。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.disocclusionSamples
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:73
+msgid "The number of spatial reuse samples in disocclusion areas."
+msgstr "去遮擋區域中的空間重複使用取樣數。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.permutationSamplingNthFrame
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:77
+msgid "Apply permutation sampling when (frameIdx % this == 0), 0 means off."
+msgstr "當 (frameIdx % this == 0) 時套用排列取樣，0 表示關閉。"
+
+#. option rtx.di.maxHistoryLength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_rtxdi_rayquery.h:79
+msgid "Maximum age of reservoirs for temporal reuse."
+msgstr "時域重複使用之儲存池的最大存續時間。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:53
+msgid "Per-Pixel Rate Noise Source"
+msgstr "逐像素速率雜訊來源"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:55
+msgid "Per-pixel wangHash / whiteNoise; cheap and stateless."
+msgstr "逐像素 wangHash / whiteNoise；成本低且無狀態。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:55
+msgid "White Noise (Hash)"
+msgstr "白雜訊（雜湊）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:56
+msgid "Blue Noise (R8 128x128x64)"
+msgstr "藍雜訊 (R8 128x128x64)"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:56
+msgid "R8 128x128 blue noise 64 frame length."
+msgstr "R8 128x128 藍雜訊，長度 64 個畫格。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:680
+msgid "Enable Sparse Rendering"
+msgstr "啟用稀疏渲染"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:682
+msgid "Enable Auto Scaling"
+msgstr "啟用自動縮放"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:689 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:705
+msgid "Sampling Rate"
+msgstr "取樣率"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:690
+msgid "Resolution Scaling Exponent"
+msgstr "解析度縮放指數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:691
+msgid "Max Sampling Rate"
+msgstr "最大取樣率"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:696
+#, c-format
+msgid "Effective Rate: %.3f"
+msgstr "實際速率：%.3f"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:698
+#, c-format
+msgid "Effective Rate: Off (%.3f exceeds Max Sampling Rate %.3f)"
+msgstr "實際速率：關閉（%.3f 超過最大取樣率 %.3f）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:700
+#, c-format
+msgid "Effective Rate: Off"
+msgstr "實際速率：關閉"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:708
+msgid "Sparse-Aware Alpha Blend Search"
+msgstr "稀疏感知 Alpha 混合搜尋"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:710
+msgid "Experimental"
+msgstr "實驗性"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:712
+#, c-format
+msgid "The following options are experimental and for development only. Toggling them may cause visual issues."
+msgstr "下列選項為實驗性功能，僅供開發使用。切換這些選項可能會造成畫面問題。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:713
+msgid "Sparse Primary Ray Miss Composition"
+msgstr "稀疏主要光線未命中合成"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:714
+msgid "Sparse Volumetrics (Primary Hit)"
+msgstr "稀疏體積效果（主要命中）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.cpp:715
+msgid "Sparse Volumetrics (Primary Miss)"
+msgstr "稀疏體積效果（主要未命中）"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.enableSparseRendering
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:41
+msgid "Enables sparse rendering. When enabled, applies a constant per-pixel sampling rate across the screen. DLSS Ray Reconstruction is required."
+msgstr "啟用稀疏渲染。啟用時，會在整個畫面套用固定的逐像素取樣率。需要 DLSS 光線重建。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.perPixelRateNoiseSource
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:45
+msgid ""
+"Selects the noise source used to threshold per-pixel sampling rates.\n"
+"WhiteNoise (0): wangHash ~ white-noise.\n"
+"BlueNoise128x128x64x8 (1): 8 bit 128x128 blue-noise 64 frame length."
+msgstr ""
+"選擇用於判定逐像素取樣率臨界值的雜訊來源。\n"
+"WhiteNoise (0)：wangHash ~ 白雜訊。\n"
+"BlueNoise128x128x64x8 (1)：8 位元 128x128 藍雜訊，長度 64 個畫格。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.samplingRate
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:50
+msgid ""
+"Per-pixel sampling rate.\n"
+"When enableAdaptiveSamplingRate is set, it applies at the reference internal resolution and other internal resolutions scale it, see samplingRateResolutionExponent.\n"
+"Graphics presets set it together with samplingRateResolutionExponent. The default is the Ultra preset's rate at 4K with DLSS Auto.\n"
+"Lower values boost performance at the cost of image detail and temporal stability.\n"
+"Range [0.0625, 1.0]. Rates below ~0.2 tend to suffer from undersampling and yield diminishing performance returns.\n"
+"Sparse rendering turns off when the scaled rate exceeds maxSamplingRate."
+msgstr ""
+"逐像素取樣率。\n"
+"設定 enableAdaptiveSamplingRate 時，此值適用於參考內部解析度，其他內部解析度會加以縮放，請參閱 samplingRateResolutionExponent。\n"
+"圖形預設會將它與 samplingRateResolutionExponent 一起設定。預設值為「極高」預設在 4K 搭配 DLSS 自動時的取樣率。\n"
+"較低的值可提升效能，代價是影像細節與時域穩定性。\n"
+"範圍 [0.0625, 1.0]。低於約 0.2 的取樣率容易取樣不足，且效能效益遞減。\n"
+"縮放後的取樣率超過 maxSamplingRate 時，稀疏渲染會關閉。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.enableAdaptiveSamplingRate
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:64
+msgid ""
+"Picks the sampling rate automatically for the current resolution. Use the quality option to further tune the balance of performance and quality.\n"
+"When disabled, samplingRate is used as is at every resolution."
+msgstr ""
+"針對目前解析度自動選擇取樣率。可使用品質選項進一步調整效能與品質的平衡。\n"
+"停用時，所有解析度都會直接使用 samplingRate。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.samplingRateResolutionExponent
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:68
+msgid ""
+"Scales samplingRate by the reference internal resolution's pixel count divided by the current internal resolution's pixel count, raised to this exponent.\n"
+"Graphics presets set it together with samplingRate.\n"
+"The scaled rate stays within samplingRate's range. 0 applies samplingRate at every resolution, and 1 keeps the number of active pixels constant."
+msgstr ""
+"以參考內部解析度的像素數除以目前內部解析度的像素數，再取此指數次方，來縮放 samplingRate。\n"
+"圖形預設會將它與 samplingRate 一起設定。\n"
+"縮放後的取樣率會保持在 samplingRate 的範圍內。0 會在所有解析度套用 samplingRate，1 則會讓作用中的像素數保持不變。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.quality
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:76
+msgid ""
+"Trades performance for image quality when auto scaling is enabled.\n"
+"0.5 is the default and recommended value, 1 gives the highest quality and 0 the highest performance.\n"
+"Values toward 1 can raise the rate above maxSamplingRate, which turns sparse rendering off.\n"
+"The auto scaled rate is already adjusted for each graphics preset and resolution, so this is meant for slight fine tuning.\n"
+"Setting it too low is not recommended, since image quality degrades quickly at low rates.\n"
+"Adjusts the rate that auto scaling calculates from samplingRate and samplingRateResolutionExponent."
+msgstr ""
+"啟用自動縮放時，在效能與影像品質之間取捨。\n"
+"0.5 是預設值與建議值，1 提供最高品質，0 提供最高效能。\n"
+"接近 1 的值可能會讓取樣率超過 maxSamplingRate，進而關閉稀疏渲染。\n"
+"自動縮放的取樣率已針對每個圖形預設與解析度調整，因此此值是用於輕微微調。\n"
+"不建議設得太低，因為在低取樣率下影像品質會快速下降。\n"
+"調整自動縮放從 samplingRate 與 samplingRateResolutionExponent 計算出的取樣率。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.maxSamplingRate
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:86
+msgid "Sparse rendering turns off when the scaled samplingRate exceeds this, since above it the performance gain is no longer worth the loss in image quality."
+msgstr "縮放後的 samplingRate 超過此值時，稀疏渲染會關閉，因為超過此值後，效能提升已不值得損失的影像品質。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.enableSparseAwareAlphaBlendSearch
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:112
+msgid ""
+"Improves the lighting of semi-transparent surfaces, such as particles and smoke, when sparse rendering is enabled.\n"
+"Costs a little performance, more so at lower sampling rates."
+msgstr ""
+"啟用稀疏渲染時，改善粒子與煙霧等半透明表面的照明。\n"
+"會稍微降低效能，取樣率越低影響越大。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.enableSparsePrimaryRayMissComposition
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:117
+msgid ""
+"When enabled, primary miss pixels (sky) use sparse rendering.\n"
+"This improves performance at the cost of sky reconstruction artifacts."
+msgstr ""
+"啟用時，主要光線未命中的像素（天空）會使用稀疏渲染。\n"
+"這能提升效能，代價是天空重建瑕疵。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.enableSparseVolumetricsPrimaryHit
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:121
+msgid "When enabled, volumetric NEE integration at primary-hit pixels uses sparse rendering."
+msgstr "啟用時，主要光線命中像素的體積 NEE 積分會使用稀疏渲染。"
+
+#. option rtx.sparseRendering.enableSparseVolumetricsPrimaryMiss
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_sparse_rendering.h:124
+msgid "When enabled, volumetric NEE integration at primary-miss (sky) pixels uses sparse rendering."
+msgstr "啟用時，主要光線未命中（天空）像素的體積 NEE 積分會使用稀疏渲染。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.qualityPreset
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:49
+msgid ""
+"Quality Preset: 0: Medium, 1: High, 2: Ultra.\n"
+"Scales the number of update records per frame.\n"
+"Ultra disables the record target and uses the fixed grid set by downscaleFactor.\n"
+"Lower presets reduce update tracing cost but slow cache convergence and lighting response.\n"
+"Medium combines update and query dispatches, adding one frame of latency to lighting changes.\n"
+"High and Ultra use separate update and query dispatches.\n"
+"Primary-vertex counting and cache-detail settings are preserved.\n"
+"Targets are adaptive goals, not hard caps."
+msgstr ""
+"品質預設：0：中，1：高，2：極高。\n"
+"縮放每個畫格的更新記錄數。\n"
+"「極高」會停用記錄目標，改用 downscaleFactor 設定的固定格點。\n"
+"較低的預設會降低更新追蹤成本，但會減慢快取收斂與照明反應。\n"
+"「中」會合併更新與查詢分派，使照明變化增加一個畫格的延遲。\n"
+"「高」與「極高」使用分開的更新與查詢分派。\n"
+"主要頂點計數與快取細節設定會保留。\n"
+"目標是自適應的目標值，而非硬性上限。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.resetHistory
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:62
+msgid ""
+"Clears all SHaRC hash entries and accumulated and resolved radiance on the next frame.\n"
+"The option automatically returns to false after the reset."
+msgstr ""
+"在下一個畫格清除所有 SHaRC 雜湊項目，以及已累積與已解析的輻射亮度。\n"
+"重設後，此選項會自動恢復為 false。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.enableUpdate
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:67
+msgid ""
+"Enables reduced-resolution path-traced updates that submit new radiance samples to SHaRC.\n"
+"Disabling updates stops new samples, while Resolve may continue aging and evicting existing entries."
+msgstr ""
+"啟用降低解析度的路徑追蹤更新，將新的輻射亮度取樣提交給 SHaRC。\n"
+"停用更新會停止新的取樣，而解析可能會繼續讓現有項目老化並逐出。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.enableResolve
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:70
+msgid ""
+"Enables the pass that combines current SHaRC update samples with cache history.\n"
+"Disabling Resolve discards new accumulation while queries may continue reading the last resolved cache."
+msgstr ""
+"啟用將目前 SHaRC 更新取樣與快取歷史合併的階段。\n"
+"停用解析會捨棄新的累積，而查詢可能會繼續讀取最後一次解析的快取。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.combineUpdateAndQuery
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:73
+msgid ""
+"Traces update paths in the same dispatch as query paths, like NRC traces its training paths, instead of in a separate update pass.\n"
+"This removes the fixed cost of the separate pass, but queries then read the cache resolved in the previous frame, which delays lighting changes by a frame.\n"
+"Medium enables this option. High and Ultra disable it. Use Custom graphics settings to override it manually."
+msgstr ""
+"在與查詢路徑相同的分派中追蹤更新路徑（類似 NRC 追蹤其訓練路徑的方式），而不是在獨立的更新階段中進行。\n"
+"這能省去獨立階段的固定成本，但查詢會讀取上一個畫格解析的快取，使照明變化延遲一個畫格。\n"
+"「中」會啟用此選項，「高」與「極高」會停用。使用「自訂」圖形設定可手動覆寫。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.downscaleFactor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:77
+msgid ""
+"Controls SHaRC update resolution; a factor of N traces one update ray per N by N pixel block each frame.\n"
+"Higher values reduce update cost but make cache coverage and lighting changes converge more slowly.\n"
+"Only used when targetNumUpdateRecords is 0."
+msgstr ""
+"控制 SHaRC 的更新解析度；係數為 N 時，每個畫格會為每個 N 乘 N 像素區塊追蹤一條更新光線。\n"
+"值越高，更新成本越低，但快取涵蓋範圍與照明變化的收斂會越慢。\n"
+"只在 targetNumUpdateRecords 為 0 時使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.targetNumUpdateRecords
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:81
+msgid ""
+"Target number of update records per frame. A record is a path vertex that an update path adds to the cache.\n"
+"The update grid is resized to reach it the way NRC sizes its training grid, which keeps the update cost independent of resolution.\n"
+"Higher values make the cache converge and respond to lighting changes faster at a higher update cost.\n"
+"0 disables the target, and downscaleFactor sets a fixed update grid instead.\n"
+"Quality presets set this target. Use Custom graphics settings to override it manually."
+msgstr ""
+"每個畫格的目標更新記錄數。一筆記錄是更新路徑加入快取的一個路徑頂點。\n"
+"更新格點會依 NRC 調整其訓練格點大小的方式重新調整大小以達到此目標，讓更新成本與解析度無關。\n"
+"值越高，快取收斂與對照明變化的反應越快，但更新成本也越高。\n"
+"0 會停用此目標，改由 downscaleFactor 設定固定的更新格點。\n"
+"品質預設會設定此目標。使用「自訂」圖形設定可手動覆寫。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.excludePrimaryVerticesFromTarget
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:87
+msgid ""
+"Leaves the record that each update path adds at its primary vertex out of the count that targetNumUpdateRecords targets.\n"
+"NRC's training records mostly leave out primary vertices as well, so this makes the target comparable to NRC's."
+msgstr ""
+"將每條更新路徑在其主要頂點加入的記錄，排除在 targetNumUpdateRecords 所針對的計數之外。\n"
+"NRC 的訓練記錄大多也排除主要頂點，因此這能讓此目標與 NRC 的目標相互比較。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.averageUpdateRecordsPerPath
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:90
+msgid ""
+"Average number of records per update path, including its primary vertex, assumed when sizing the largest update grid, which is also the grid used after a reset.\n"
+"Lower values allow a larger grid, so views where update paths end early, such as views mostly into the sky, can still reach the target.\n"
+"One record per path less is assumed when excludePrimaryVerticesFromTarget is enabled."
+msgstr ""
+"決定最大更新格點大小時所假設的每條更新路徑平均記錄數（包含其主要頂點）；最大更新格點也是重設後使用的格點。\n"
+"值越低，允許的格點越大，因此更新路徑提早結束的視角（例如大部分看向天空的視角）仍能達到目標。\n"
+"啟用 excludePrimaryVerticesFromTarget 時，會假設每條路徑少一筆記錄。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.numFramesToSmoothOutUpdateDimensions
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:94
+msgid "Number of frames that the record count is averaged over before the update grid is resized."
+msgstr "重新調整更新格點大小之前，用來平均記錄數的畫格數。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.voxelSize
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:96
+msgid ""
+"Base world-space size of SHaRC voxels.\n"
+"Higher values produce larger voxels with broader coverage but less spatial detail."
+msgstr ""
+"SHaRC 體素在世界空間中的基礎大小。\n"
+"值越高，體素越大、涵蓋範圍越廣，但空間細節越少。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.maxNumFramesToAccumulate
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:99
+msgid ""
+"Maximum number of frames accumulated in each SHaRC entry.\n"
+"Higher values reduce noise but respond more slowly to lighting changes."
+msgstr ""
+"每個 SHaRC 項目累積的最大畫格數。\n"
+"值越高雜訊越少，但對照明變化的反應越慢。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.staleFrameNumber
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:102
+msgid ""
+"Maximum number of frames without new samples before a SHaRC entry is evicted.\n"
+"Higher values retain coverage longer but can preserve stale data; SHaRC clamps the effective minimum to 8 frames."
+msgstr ""
+"SHaRC 項目在沒有新取樣的情況下被逐出前的最大畫格數。\n"
+"值越高，涵蓋範圍保留越久，但可能保留過時的資料；SHaRC 會將實際最小值限制為 8 個畫格。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.perceptualRoughnessThreshold
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:105
+msgid ""
+"Minimum perceptual roughness applied to secondary vertices during SHaRC update tracing.\n"
+"Higher values reduce sharp, view-dependent radiance in the cache but can lose glossy lighting detail."
+msgstr ""
+"SHaRC 更新追蹤期間套用於次要頂點的最小感知粗糙度。\n"
+"值越高，快取中銳利、隨視角變化的輻射亮度越少，但可能會失去光澤照明的細節。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.fireflyClampMultiplier
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:108
+msgid ""
+"Limits non-emissive lighting at SHaRC update hits and sky radiance on misses to this multiple of the resolved mean at the current or last hit cell.\n"
+"Set to 0 to disable clamping. Cells without valid resolved radiance are not clamped."
+msgstr ""
+"將 SHaRC 更新命中處的非自發光照明，以及未命中時的天空輻射亮度，限制在目前或上一個命中格子之已解析平均值的此倍數內。\n"
+"設為 0 可停用限制。沒有有效已解析輻射亮度的格子不會被限制。"
+
+#. option rtx.spatiallyHashedRadianceCache.jitterSequenceLength
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_spatially_hashed_radiance_cache.h:111
+msgid ""
+"Length of the Halton sequence used to vary SHaRC update locations within downscaled pixel blocks.\n"
+"Set to 0 to disable update jitter."
+msgstr ""
+"用於在縮小的像素區塊內變化 SHaRC 更新位置的 Halton 序列長度。\n"
+"設為 0 可停用更新抖動。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_srgb_dither.cpp:52 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:107
+msgid "Dither Mode"
+msgstr "混色模式"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_srgb_dither.cpp:52 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:107
+msgid "Spatial"
+msgstr "空間"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_srgb_dither.cpp:52 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:107
+msgid "Spatial + Temporal"
+msgstr "空間 + 時域"
+
+#. option rtx.srgbDither.ditherMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_srgb_dither.h:54
+msgid ""
+"Final output dither mode selection. Dithering allows for reduction of banding artifacts in the final rendered output from quantization using a small amount of monochromatic noise.\n"
+"Supported enum values are 0 = None (Disabled), 1 = Spatial (Enabled, Spatial dithering only), 2 = SpatialTemporal (Enabled, Spatial and temporal dithering).\n"
+msgstr ""
+"最終輸出的混色模式選擇。混色會使用少量的單色雜訊，減少最終渲染輸出中因量化產生的色帶瑕疵。\n"
+"支援的列舉值：0 = None（停用），1 = Spatial（啟用，僅空間混色），2 = SpatialTemporal（啟用，空間與時域混色）。\n"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_taa.cpp:71
+msgid "Maximum Radiance"
+msgstr "最大輻射亮度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_taa.cpp:72
+msgid "New Frame Weight"
+msgstr "新畫格權重"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_taa.cpp:73
+msgid "Color Clamping Factor"
+msgstr "色彩限制係數"
+
+#. option rtx.temporalAA.maximumRadiance
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_taa.h:67
+msgid ""
+"The maximum value to use in TAA-U's perceptual quantizer color transformation, measured in cd/m^2.\n"
+"The typical value used for the PQ transformation is 10,000 and usually shouldn't be changed."
+msgstr ""
+"TAA-U 感知量化器色彩轉換中使用的最大值，單位為 cd/m^2。\n"
+"PQ 轉換通常使用的值為 10,000，一般不應變更。"
+
+#. option rtx.temporalAA.newFrameWeight
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_taa.h:71
+msgid ""
+"The maximum amount of the current frame to use as part of the temporal anti-aliasing process. Must be in the range 0-1.\n"
+"Values closer to 0 will result in better image stability (less jittering) and less aliasing, values closer to 1 will result in more responsive results (less ghosting)."
+msgstr ""
+"在時域反鋸齒過程中使用的目前畫格最大比例。必須在 0-1 範圍內。\n"
+"接近 0 的值可獲得更好的影像穩定性（較少抖動）與較少的鋸齒，接近 1 的值則能獲得反應更快的結果（較少殘影）。"
+
+#. option rtx.temporalAA.colorClampingFactor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_taa.h:75
+msgid ""
+"A scalar factor to apply to the standard deviation of the neighborhood of pixels in the color signal used for clamping. Should be in the range 0-infinity.\n"
+"This value essentially represents how many standard deviations of tolerance from the current frame's colors around each pixel pixel the temporally accumulated color signal may have.\n"
+"Higher values will cause more ghosting whereas lower values may reduce ghosting but will impact image quality (less ability to upscale effectively) and reduce stability (more jittering)."
+msgstr ""
+"套用於用來限制的色彩訊號中，像素鄰域標準差的純量係數。應在 0 到無限大的範圍內。\n"
+"此值本質上代表時域累積的色彩訊號，相對於每個像素周圍目前畫格色彩，可容許多少個標準差的誤差。\n"
+"值越高殘影越多；值越低可減少殘影，但會影響影像品質（較難有效升頻）並降低穩定性（更多抖動）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:779
+msgid "Use Terrain Bounding Box"
+msgstr "使用地形邊界框"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:780
+msgid "Clear Terrain Textures Before Terrain Baking"
+msgstr "烘焙地形前清除地形紋理"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:782
+msgid "Material"
+msgstr "材質"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:787
+msgid "Replacements Support in PS"
+msgstr "在 PS 中支援替換"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:790
+msgid "Bake Replacement Materials"
+msgstr "烘焙替換材質"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:791
+msgid "Bake Secondary PBR Textures"
+msgstr "烘焙次要 PBR 紋理"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:792
+msgid "Max Resolution (except for colorOpacity)"
+msgstr "最大解析度（colorOpacity 除外）"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:794
+msgid "Properties"
+msgstr "屬性"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:798
+msgid "Enable Emission"
+msgstr "啟用發光"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:804
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"\n"
+"Displacement Settings"
+msgstr ""
+"\n"
+"位移設定"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:805
+msgid "Displacement Factor"
+msgstr "位移係數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:806
+#, c-format
+msgid ""
+"Calculate the lowest safe Displacement Factor for the current \n"
+"scene.  Mod creators should run this in scenes across the \n"
+"game, and use the highest returned value.  See Displacement \n"
+"Factor's tooltip for more info."
+msgstr ""
+"計算目前\n"
+"場景中最低的安全「位移係數」。模組製作者應在遊戲的各個\n"
+"場景中執行此計算，並使用傳回的最高值。詳細資訊請參閱\n"
+"「位移係數」的提示。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:810
+msgid "Calculate Scene's Optimal Displacement Factor"
+msgstr "計算場景的最佳位移係數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:819
+msgid "Cascade Map"
+msgstr "級聯貼圖"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:822
+msgid "Cascade Map's Default Half Width [meters]"
+msgstr "級聯貼圖預設半寬 [公尺]"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:823
+msgid "Cascade Map's Default Height [meters]"
+msgstr "級聯貼圖預設高度 [公尺]"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:824
+msgid "First Cascade Level's Half Width [meters]"
+msgstr "第一個級聯層級的半寬 [公尺]"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:826
+msgid "Max Cascade Levels"
+msgstr "最大級聯層級數"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:827
+msgid "Texture Resolution Per Cascade Level"
+msgstr "每個級聯層級的紋理解析度"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:828
+msgid "Expand Last Cascade Level"
+msgstr "擴展最後一個級聯層級"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:833
+#, c-format
+msgid "Cascade Levels: %u"
+msgstr "級聯層級數：%u"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:834
+#, c-format
+msgid "Cascade Level Resolution: %u, %u"
+msgstr "級聯層級解析度：%u, %u"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:835
+#, c-format
+msgid "Cascade Map Resolution: %u, %u"
+msgstr "級聯貼圖解析度：%u, %u"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:843
+msgid "Debug: Disable Baking"
+msgstr "偵錯：停用烘焙"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.cpp:844
+msgid "Debug: Disable Binding"
+msgstr "偵錯：停用繫結"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.enableBaking
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:67
+msgid ""
+"[Experimental] Enables runtime baking of blended terrains from top down (i.e. in an opposite direction of \"rtx.zUp\").\n"
+"It bakes multiple blended albedo terrain textures into a single texture sampled during ray tracing. The system requires \"Terrain Textures\" to contain hashes of the terrain textures to apply.\n"
+"Only use this system if the game renders terrain surfaces with multiple blended surfaces on top of each other (i.e. sand mixed with dirt, grass, snow, etc.).\n"
+"Requirement: the baked terrain surfaces must not be placed vertically in the game world. Horizontal surfaces will have the best image quality. Requires \"rtx.zUp\" to be set properly."
+msgstr ""
+"[實驗性] 啟用由上往下（即與 \"rtx.zUp\" 相反的方向）在執行階段烘焙混合地形。\n"
+"它會將多張混合的反照率地形紋理烘焙成單一紋理，供光線追蹤時取樣。此系統需要「地形紋理」包含要套用之地形紋理的雜湊。\n"
+"只有在遊戲以多個互相疊加混合的表面渲染地形時（例如沙與泥土、草、雪等混合），才使用此系統。\n"
+"需求：烘焙的地形表面不得在遊戲世界中垂直放置。水平表面的影像品質最佳。需要正確設定 \"rtx.zUp\"。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.clearTerrainBeforeBaking
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:72
+msgid "Performs a clear on the terrain texture before it is baked to in a frame."
+msgstr "在每個畫格烘焙地形紋理之前先將其清除。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.debugDisableBaking
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:73
+msgid "Force disables rebaking every frame. Used for debugging only."
+msgstr "強制停用每個畫格的重新烘焙。僅用於偵錯。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.debugDisableBinding
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:74
+msgid "Force disables binding of the baked terrain texture to the terrain meshes. Used for debugging only."
+msgstr "強制停用將烘焙的地形紋理繫結到地形網格。僅用於偵錯。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:84
+msgid ""
+"Enables reading of secondary PBR replacement textures in pixel shaders when supported.\n"
+"Current support is limitted to fixed function pipelines and programmable shaders with Shader Model 1.0.\n"
+"When set to false or unsupported, an extra compute shader is used to preproces the secondary textures to make them compatible at an expense of performance and quality instead.\n"
+"Requires \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_fixedFunction = True\" to apply for draw calls with fixed function graphics pipeline.\n"
+"Requires \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_programmableShaders = True\" to apply for draw calls with programmable graphics pipeline."
+msgstr ""
+"在支援時，於像素著色器中讀取次要 PBR 替換紋理。\n"
+"目前僅支援固定功能管線與 Shader Model 1.0 的可程式化著色器。\n"
+"設為 false 或不支援時，會改用額外的計算著色器預處理次要紋理，使其相容，代價是效能與品質。\n"
+"需要 \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_fixedFunction = True\" 才會套用於使用固定功能圖形管線的繪製呼叫。\n"
+"需要 \"rtx.terrainBaker.material.replacementSupportInPS_programmableShaders = True\" 才會套用於使用可程式化圖形管線的繪製呼叫。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.bakeReplacementMaterials
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:99
+msgid "Enables baking of replacement materials when they are present."
+msgstr "存在替換材質時，啟用其烘焙。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.bakeSecondaryPBRTextures
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:101
+msgid ""
+"Enables baking of secondary textures in replacement materials when they are present.\n"
+"Secondary textures are all PBR textures except for albedoOpacity. So that includes normal, roughness, etc."
+msgstr ""
+"存在替換材質時，啟用其次要紋理的烘焙。\n"
+"次要紋理是 albedoOpacity 以外的所有 PBR 紋理，包括法線、粗糙度等。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.maxResolutionToUseForReplacementMaterials
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:104
+msgid ""
+"Max resolution to use for preprocessing and baking of input replacement material textures other than color opacity which is used as is.\n"
+"Applies only to a case when a preprocessing compute shader is used to support baking of secondary PBR materials.\n"
+"Replacement materials need to be preprocessed prior to baking them and limitting the max resolution allows to balance the quality vs performance cost."
+msgstr ""
+"預處理與烘焙輸入替換材質紋理時使用的最大解析度（色彩不透明度紋理除外，會直接使用）。\n"
+"僅適用於使用預處理計算著色器來支援烘焙次要 PBR 材質的情況。\n"
+"替換材質需要在烘焙前進行預處理，限制最大解析度可平衡品質與效能成本。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.roughnessAnisotropy
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:113
+msgid "Roughness anisotropy. Valid range is <-1, 1>, where 0 is isotropic."
+msgstr "粗糙度非等向性。有效範圍為 <-1, 1>，其中 0 為等向。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.emissiveIntensity
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:114
+msgid "Emissive intensity."
+msgstr "自發光強度。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.roughnessConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:115
+msgid "Perceptual roughness constant. Valid range is <0, 1>."
+msgstr "感知粗糙度常數。有效範圍為 <0, 1>。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.metallicConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:116
+msgid "Metallic constant. Valid range is <0, 1>."
+msgstr "金屬度常數。有效範圍為 <0, 1>。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.emissiveColorConstant
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:117
+msgid "Emissive color constant. Should be a color in sRGB colorspace with gamma encoding."
+msgstr "自發光色彩常數。應為 sRGB 色彩空間中經伽瑪編碼的色彩。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.enableEmission
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:118
+msgid "A flag to determine if emission is enabled."
+msgstr "決定是否啟用發光的旗標。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.material.properties.displaceInFactor
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:119
+msgid ""
+"The max depth and height the baked terrain can support will be larger than the max \n"
+"of any incoming draw call, which results in a loss of detail. When this is \n"
+"too low, the displacement will lack detail. When it is too high, the lowest \n"
+"and highest parts of the POM will flatten out.  This affects both displaceIn \n"
+"and displaceOut, despite the name."
+msgstr ""
+"烘焙地形可支援的最大深度與高度，會大於任何傳入繪製呼叫的\n"
+"最大值，因而造成細節損失。此值太低時，\n"
+"位移會缺乏細節。太高時，POM 的最低\n"
+"與最高部分會變平。儘管名稱如此，此值同時影響 displaceIn\n"
+"與 displaceOut。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.useTerrainBBOX
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:132
+msgid "Uses terrain's bounding box to calculate the cascade map's scene footprint."
+msgstr "使用地形的邊界框來計算級聯貼圖的場景涵蓋範圍。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.defaultHalfWidth
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:133
+msgid "Cascade map square's default half width around the camera [meters]. Used when the terrain's BBOX couldn't be estimated."
+msgstr "級聯貼圖正方形在攝影機周圍的預設半寬 [公尺]。在無法估計地形的 BBOX 時使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.defaultHeight
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:134
+msgid "Cascade map baker's camera default height above the in-game camera [meters]. Used when the terrain's BBOX couldn't be estimated."
+msgstr "級聯貼圖烘焙器攝影機在遊戲攝影機上方的預設高度 [公尺]。在無法估計地形的 BBOX 時使用。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.levelHalfWidth
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:135
+msgid "First cascade level square's half width around the camera [meters]."
+msgstr "第一個級聯層級正方形在攝影機周圍的半寬 [公尺]。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.maxLevels
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:136
+msgid "Max number of cascade levels."
+msgstr "最大級聯層級數。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.levelResolution
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:140
+msgid "Texture resolution per cascade level."
+msgstr "每個級聯層級的紋理解析度。"
+
+#. option rtx.terrainBaker.cascadeMap.expandLastCascade
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_terrain_baker.h:144
+msgid ""
+"Expands the last cascade's footprint to cover the whole cascade map.\n"
+"This ensures whole terrain surface has valid baked texture data to sample from\n"
+"even if there isn't enough cascades generated (due to the current settings or limitations)."
+msgstr ""
+"擴展最後一個級聯的涵蓋範圍，使其涵蓋整個級聯貼圖。\n"
+"這可確保整個地形表面都有有效的烘焙紋理資料可供取樣，\n"
+"即使產生的級聯不足（因目前設定或限制所致）。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:90
+msgid "Global Exposure"
+msgstr "全域曝光"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:92
+msgid "Color Grading Enabled"
+msgstr "啟用調色"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:97
+msgid "Color Balance"
+msgstr "色彩平衡"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.cpp:102
+msgid "Tonemapping Enabled"
+msgstr "啟用色調對應"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.exposureBias
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:91
+msgid "The exposure value to use for the global tonemapper when auto exposure is disabled, or a bias multiplier on top of the auto exposure's calculated exposure value."
+msgstr "停用自動曝光時全域色調對應器使用的曝光值，或作用於自動曝光計算出之曝光值上的偏差倍數。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.tonemappingEnabled
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:92
+msgid "A flag to enable or disable the global tonemapper."
+msgstr "啟用或停用全域色調對應器的旗標。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:93
+msgid "A flag to enable or disable color grading after the global tonemapper's tonemapping pass, but before gamma correction and dithering (if enabled)."
+msgstr "啟用或停用調色的旗標；調色在全域色調對應器的色調對應階段之後、伽瑪校正與混色（若已啟用）之前進行。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.colorBalance
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:96
+msgid "The color tint to apply after tonemapping when color grading is enabled for the tonemapper (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled). Values should be in the range [0, 1]."
+msgstr "為色調對應器啟用調色 (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled) 時，在色調對應後套用的色調。值應在 [0, 1] 範圍內。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.contrast
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:97
+msgid "The contrast adjustment to apply after tonemapping when color grading is enabled for the tonemapper (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled). Values should be in the range [0, 1]."
+msgstr "為色調對應器啟用調色 (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled) 時，在色調對應後套用的對比調整。值應在 [0, 1] 範圍內。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.saturation
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:98
+msgid "The saturation adjustment to apply after tonemapping when color grading is enabled for the tonemapper (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled). Values should be in the range [0, 1]."
+msgstr "為色調對應器啟用調色 (rtx.tonemap.colorGradingEnabled) 時，在色調對應後套用的飽和度調整。值應在 [0, 1] 範圍內。"
+
+#. option rtx.tonemap.ditherMode
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_tone_mapping.h:101
+msgid ""
+"Tonemap dither mode selection, dithering allows for reduction of banding artifacts in the final rendered output from quantization using a small amount of monochromatic noise. Impact typically most visible in darker regions with smooth lighting gradients.\n"
+"Enabling dithering will make the rendered image slightly noisier, though usually dither noise is fairly imperceptible in most cases without looking closely. Generally dithered results will also look better than the alternative of banding artifacts due to increasing perceptual precision of the signal.\n"
+"Note that temporal dithering may increase perceptual precision further but may also introduce more noticeable noise in the final output in some cases due to the noise pattern changing every frame unlike a purely spatial approach.\n"
+"Supported enum values are 0 = None (Disabled), 1 = Spatial (Enabled, Spatial dithering only), 2 = SpatialTemporal (Enabled, Spatial and temporal dithering).\n"
+"Generally enabling dithering is recommended, but disabling it may be useful in some niche cases for improving compression ratios in images or videos at the cost of quality (as noise while it may not be very visible may be more difficult to compress), or for capturing \"raw\" post-tonemapped data from the renderer."
+msgstr ""
+"色調對應的混色模式選擇；混色會使用少量的單色雜訊，減少最終渲染輸出中因量化產生的色帶瑕疵。影響通常在照明漸層平滑的較暗區域最明顯。\n"
+"啟用混色會讓渲染影像的雜訊稍微增加，不過在大多數情況下，不仔細看通常幾乎察覺不到混色雜訊。由於提高了訊號的感知精確度，混色的結果一般也會比出現色帶瑕疵好看。\n"
+"請注意，時域混色可能會進一步提高感知精確度，但由於雜訊圖樣每個畫格都會改變（不同於純空間的做法），在某些情況下也可能在最終輸出中產生更明顯的雜訊。\n"
+"支援的列舉值：0 = None（停用），1 = Spatial（啟用，僅空間混色），2 = SpatialTemporal（啟用，空間與時域混色）。\n"
+"一般建議啟用混色，但在某些特殊情況下停用可能有用，例如為了提高影像或影片的壓縮率而犧牲品質（雜訊雖然不太明顯，卻可能更難壓縮），或從渲染器擷取色調對應後的「原始」資料。"
+
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:627
+msgid "Fog Density"
+msgstr "霧密度"
